1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
*The air in our town is always dry.*

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:07,000
*Even the crisp freshness of a clear sky appears pale through the arid veil.*

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
*However, slowly but surely, color is returning to our lives.*

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
*Voices can be heard. Lively ones. Gentle ones. Caring ones.*

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:25,000
*Waking up to each other's presence in this precious space we call home is a splash of watercolors onto the dry canvas of this monochrome world.*

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
*And so, another priceless day begins.*

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Lucia: "Aisia, come here and I'll fix your hair for you. You can't go out with your hair in a mess like that, right?"

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Aisia: "Auugh. Sorry..."

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Lucia: "All right, sit here."

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
*Once Aisia plops herself down on a seat, her head is at just the right height for Lucia.*

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Lucia: "Your hair's pretty but it doesn't always behave, does it?"

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Aisia: "It certainly does not. I have to fight it every morning..."

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Leon: "Your hair's just like you, Aisia."

14
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Lucia: "Hehe, that's true."

15
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Aisia: "Wh-What is that supposed to mean?"

16
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Lucia: "Well... You know how they say cute little rascals? Sometimes, it's the naughty kids who are more lovable."

17
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Aisia: "I'm not your kid, Lucia!"

18
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Lucia: "What? I didn't say you were! Besides, if you were my kid, then your father would be..."

19
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,000
*Lucia's gaze shifts toward me.*

20
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Leon: "Hm?"

21
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Lucia: "I-It's nothing... Okay, there, you can get up now. Go take a look at your hair in the mirror later."

22
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Aisia: "Thank you very much!"

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:35,000
*...It looks like Lucia got overly conscious about something again.*

24
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,000
*Of course, that's part of why she's so adorable.*

25
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Lucia: "But wow, Leon, you sure took your sweet time today. Shouldn't you be preparing ingredients by now?"

26
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Leon: "The coal mine's closed today. There's less stuff I have to make than usual, so I'm fine."

27
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Lucia: "Hehe, aren't you glad you realized that?"

28
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Leon: "...I'm putting up daily reports and actually reading them now, after all."

29
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Aisia: "What do you mean?"

30
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
*After examining herself in the mirror, Aisia returns and cocks her head.*

31
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,000
*Her hair is now impeccable.*

32
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Lucia: "There were times before when the coal mine closed  but Leon didn't realize, so he kept preparing as usual."

33
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Aisia: "Oh, no! That is not good!"

34
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Leon: "Yeah, that happened before..."

35
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Aisia: "What did you do then?"

36
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Leon: "Well, Cullen and the people at the radio station ended up with a free lunch, but..."

37
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Lucia: "...Yeah, it's not like there were any big eaters around here."

38
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Lucia: "We had to finish up the last four ourselves. That was not pleasant..."

39
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Leon: "If only you were with us, Aisia. You would have been a big help."

40
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:48,000
*...Right, it was just Lucia and me back then. There were only two of us.*

41
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:53,000
*It occurs to me that I've come to think of having three people here as the norm.*

42
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Aisia: "Yes! If you ever make too much food again, just leave it to me!"

43
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Lucia: "I'd rather you just don't do that again..."

44
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,000
*Lucia smiles wryly at Aisia's cheerful response.*

45
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:09,000
*Sunlight streams in from an unfamiliar angle. It is later in the day than usual.*

46
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Aisia: "Hmm... would it be better to make it a little more sour?"

47
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Leon: "I'll leave that to you."

48
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Aisia: "In that case, I'll just have another taste..."

49
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Lucia: "No, you won't! You've already tasted it six times!"

50
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,000
Aisia: "You noticed?!"

51
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:27,000
Lucia: "It'd be weirder to not notice..."

52
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:34,000
Leon: "Aisia, this isn't one of those 'I'm so famished I just couldn't help it' situations today, is it?"

53
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,000
Aisia: "No, I had my fill from Lucia last night."

54
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Leon: "Good."

55
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:44,000
*Just like how we obtain our nutrients through eating, vampires obtain theirs by sucking blood.*

56
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:49,000
*For Aisia, our local vampire, sucking blood is merely a basic act of living.*

57
00:03:49,000 --> 00:04:00,000
*Neither Lucia nor I want to see Aisia fall ill from refusing blood for too long like she did last time, but it took a while for her to come to grips with that fact.*

58
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
*The only person other than us who knows about Aisia's vampiric tendencies is Cullen.*

59
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:09,000
*And the only person who knows that is me.*

60
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:13,000
Lucia: "Leon, that's going to turn really hard at this rate."

61
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
Leon: "Whoops."

62
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,000
*I lightly shake the fry pan.*

63
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,000
Leon: "Thanks, Lucia."

64
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:22,000
Lucia: "You're welcome. I see that both dishes today are more female-oriented."

65
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:27,000
Leon: "Do you think I should have made them appeal to a broader audience?"

66
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Lucia: "No, I think they're fine. There are so few males around, anyway. Personally, I'm okay with it staying like this."

67
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:41,000
Leon: "Yeah, Doctor David left, too... The demand for young men's menus is definitely dropping."

68
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:44,000
Lucia: "Yea?Hey, Aisia! You're tasting it again?!"

69
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Aisia: "Th-This needed one final touch!"

70
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Lucia: "Did it really?"

71
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Aisia: "It did! Oh, Leon, I'm finished with the coleslaw!"

72
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:57,000
Lucia: "Is it just me, or did you just sidestep the question..."

73
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Leon: "Thanks. Could you just pack it like that for me? I'm almost done with the omelette here, too."

74
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,000
Aisia: "Will do!"

75
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:10,000
Aisia: "...On that note, there is something that I've been wondering for a while."

76
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,000
Leon: "Hm? What is it?"

77
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,000
*I continue working as I listen.*

78
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Aisia: "Why is it that everyone around Leon is a girl?"

79
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,000
*...!*

80
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:24,000
Lucia: "Leon, it's dangerous to look away when you're working, you know?"

81
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:30,000
Leon: "Y-Yeah, I know. I just jumped a bit because Aisia's question was so sudden."

82
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,000
Aisia: "Did I ask something strange?"

83
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,000
Lucia: "No, not at all."

84
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:39,000
Lucia: "Actually, let's see... Aisia, how many men do you know other than Leon?"

85
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,000
Aisia: "..."

86
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:44,000
Aisia: "Wow! Now that you mention it, I don't know any!"

87
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:49,000
Lucia: "And there's your answer. Leon's probably the only young male around here."

88
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:54,000
Lucia: "I guess you could count Doctor David, too, but he moved away."

89
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Leon: "And Doctor David's only young in the relative sense."

90
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,000
Aisia: "Huuuuh, so you're a rare breed."

91
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Leon: "As for young women, there are you two, of course. Cullen's still young, too. Oh, and the radio DJ's pretty young, I guess."

92
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,000
Lucia: "...You sure are on top of these things."

93
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:16,000
Leon: "I'm just telling you what I know."

94
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:22,000
Lucia: "In any case, Sagami Francisco isn't the only place to have a shortage of young males."

95
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,000
Aisia: "Is it not?"

96
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Lucia: "Nope. With that said, it IS pretty rare to find a guy like Leon. He's young. He's got no ears. And, um... no tail."

97
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:34,000
Aisia: "Lucia, is your face turning a little red?"

98
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
Lucia: "What? No way!"

99
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Aisia: "Did the memory of Leon's tail just pop into your mind? I love his tail."

100
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:49,000
Lucia: "L-Love? Stop throwing that word around like that! And no, that's not it! Don't you start getting any funny ideas, either, Leon!"

101
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:52,000
*...What's even the correct reaction to have here?*

102
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:56,000
*My timing on this dish was just right. It looks nice and full.*

103
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:59,000
Leon: "All right, the Spanish omelette's done."

104
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:02,000
*I place it on a plate that Lucia prepared for me.*

105
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:08,000
*After it cools a little, I pack it into a delivery box, and everything is ready to go.*

106
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:11,000
Lucia: "...Someone sure didn't take the bait."

107
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,000
Leon: "Do you want me to take the bait?"

108
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:17,000
Lucia: "Gah! You're so mean! I hate you!"

109
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:23,000
*I swear, I'll never figure out the right thing to say... Women truly are terrifying creatures.*

110
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:28,000
Lucia: "...But, I'm glad Leon isn't one of those super greedy people."

111
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Aisia: "What do you mean?"

112
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:37,000
Lucia: "Remember what I said earlier? Because there are so few men, polygamy is the norm around here."

113
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,000
Aisia: "Poly... Gamy?"

114
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:41,000
Lucia: "It's when one man can marry multiple women."

115
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:45,000
Aisia: "Does that mean Lucia and I can be Leon's wives together?"

116
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,000
Lucia: "Kyaa!"

117
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
Leon: "S-Sorry. My hand slipped."

118
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,000
Lucia: "Are you hurt?"

119
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:53,000
Leon: "No, I'm fine. Did any of the pieces hit you, Aisia?"

120
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:56,000
Aisia: "I'm fine, too. Here you go, Leon. Use this."

121
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:59,000
*It's a good thing I wasn't heating anything.*

122
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:04,000
*I take the broom and dustpan that Aisia hands me and clean up the broken glass.*

123
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:09,000
Lucia: "...Geez, Aisia, you really need to stop saying weird things."

124
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:12,000
Aisia: "Huh? Was what I just said that weird?"

125
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,000
Lucia: "O-Of course..."

126
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:21,000
Aisia: "But both Lucia and I like Leon very much. It seems very natural for us in that case, does it not?"

127
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,000
Lucia: "Well, I guess... but no!"

128
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:25,000
Aisia: "...Hmmm? ...This is hard."

129
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:32,000
Lucia: "Anyway, it's just, um, not like that for Leon right now... For all sorts of reason, right?"

130
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,000
Aisia: "Is that true, Leon?"

131
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:37,000
Leon: "Yeah... I think I'm fine for now."

132
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Aisia: "I see."

133
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:40,000
*Aisia's shoulders slump.*

134
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:43,000
*Even her ears and tail seem a little withered.*

135
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:48,000
Lucia: "Okay, come on, let's get the delivery ready. We took long enough already."

136
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,000
Leon: "Yeah, you're right."

137
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:55,000
*During our banter, my gaze naturally gravitates toward the two of them.*

138
00:08:55,000 --> 00:09:01,000
*Until now, the topic has either been subtly avoided or used by Cullen for her wisecracks...*

139
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:07,000
*But now that we're living together like this, the nuance might have changed a little...*

140
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Lucia: "What's wrong?"

141
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:17,000
Leon: "Nothing. I was just, um... thinking we shouldn't keep them waiting. I'm heading out for deliveries, so the store's all yours."

142
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,000
Aisia: "Understood!"

143
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Lucia: "Yeah, take care."

144
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:24,000
*As always, I drive northward on National Highway 65.*

145
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:28,000
*Aisia is now fully able to mind the store in my absence.*

146
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:33,000
*Leaving the store to Lucia and Aisia while I run deliveries is now our new norm.*

147
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:40,000
*...With that said, nobody ever comes to the store during delivery hours, anyway. Nobody but Cullen.*

148
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:54,000
Radio DJ: "Hey, Sagami Francisco, it'll be sunny skies for the whole day. When the weather's this great, it really makes you want to go outside, doesn't it? How about taking your little puppy out for a walk?"

149
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:58,000
*It sounds like the radio lady is in good spirits today, as well.*

150
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:05,000
*As soon as Aisia and I fixed the radio, they started broadcasting again. They haven't missed a day since.*

151
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Momo: "Woof woof!"

152
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:12,000
*I return earlier than usual from my deliveries and am greeted by a small but lively figure.*

153
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,000
Leon: "Hey, I'm back."

154
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:18,000
*I crouch down and gently stroke Momo's neck. She is in much better shape now.*

155
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:27,000
*After an intense debate between Lucia and Aisia, they finally settled on "Momo" as the name of the newest member of our family.*

156
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Cullen: "You leave two pretty girls hanging and make a beeline for the pup, huh... Then again, I guess she counts as a girl, too."

157
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:41,000
Leon: "Oh, I didn't know you were here already, Cullen. You're early."

158
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:44,000
Cullen: "Yeah, I wanted to have a word with you."

159
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:47,000
*Cullen's words are accompanied by a rare grimace.*

160
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:52,000
*Her expression gives me a fairly good idea as to what she's here for.*

161
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:55,000
*Well, this might get a little complicated...*

162
00:10:55,000 --> 00:11:01,000
*I follow Cullen into the store. To no one's surprise, the place is devoid of customers.*

163
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,000
Aisia: "Leon, welcome back!"

164
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,000
Lucia: "Hey, you're back."

165
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Leon: "Yeah."

166
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:12,000
*A glance at the table reveals a beer mug with half its contents already consumed.*

167
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:15,000
*And it's still bright outside, too...*

168
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:20,000
*Idle thoughts occupy my mind as I lower myself on the seat across from Cullen.*

169
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:23,000
Leon: "Let me guess. Same old, right?"

170
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:30,000
Cullen: "You got it. For the sake of it, I'm going to read out who they're from, one by one, okay?"

171
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:33,000
*A pink envelope is placed before me.*

172
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:40,000
Cullen: "The first one's from the daughter of the manager of Swift Bank's Sagami Francisco branch."

173
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:45,000
*A faint aroma of flowers trails the letter as I take it out of the envelope.*

174
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:49,000
Lucia: "This smell... That makes this the fifth time."

175
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,000
Cullen: "Now, for the second one."

176
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:55,000
*Another envelope, this one light blue, is handed to me.*

177
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:59,000
*Compared to the last one, the handwriting is a little messy.*

178
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:07,000
Cullen: "Huh, this one looks like a newcomer. Apparently, it's from Argest's only daughter. The crown jewel of Argest \& Co."

179
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:10,000
Aisia: "Excuse me, but what might these letters be?"

180
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:16,000
Cullen: "Oh, right, Aisia hasn't seen these before. They're matchmaking requests for Leon."

181
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:18,000
Aisia: "Matchmaking?! All of these?!"

182
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:23,000
*Beside Cullen, there is a pile of similar envelopes, twenty or so high.*

183
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:28,000
*I'd been wondering why they hadn't come in a while. I guess this is why.*

184
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:31,000
Lucia: "So, what're you going to do this time?"

185
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:41,000
Leon: "Turn them down. I can't see myself getting married yet, and I'm in no position to take on that kind of responsibility, either. Besides..."

186
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,000
Cullen: "Besides?"

187
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,000
Leon: "Uh, never mind..."

188
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,000
Cullen: "Hmmmmmm?"

189
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:48,000
*A suggestive smile spreads across Cullen's face.*

190
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:55,000
*We likely feel the same for each other, but the thought still comes with a tinge of embarrassment.*

191
00:12:55,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Cullen: "Well, whatever you say. I'll make sure to turn them down for you."

192
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:07,000
Cullen: "Gotta say, though, as the person who has to throw these out, it feels like a real shame."

193
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,000
Aisia: "What do you mean?"

194
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:16,000
Cullen: "The invitations that get sent to Leon are almost all from company presidents or local landlords."

195
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:23,000
Lucia: "You've gotten ones from places like biotech research facilities and big institutions, too."

196
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:26,000
Leon: "How do you still remember all that, Lucia?"

197
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,000
Lucia: "I... I just do, okay?"

198
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:38,000
Cullen: "The point is, they've all got money and influence, and saying 'Yes' to any of them means you'll live like a king for the rest of your life."

199
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:42,000
Aisia: "That's amazing, Leon! You get to marry rich!"

200
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:51,000
Cullen: "It just shows you how much of a scarce resource young men are. Of course, the scarcer the resource, the fiercer the competition..."

201
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:55,000
Leon: "I'm sorry for all the trouble I'm causing you."

202
00:13:55,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Cullen: "Nah, if anything, it's me who's causing trouble. I show up at your door with these every time knowing you don't want to see them."

203
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Leon: "That's not true at all. If you weren't helping me mediate these, I'm sure it'd be even more of a headache for me."

204
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:22,000
*If someone were to come directly and hand me one of those in person, I honestly would have no idea what to do. Fortunately, that has never happened.*

205
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:28,000
Cullen: "I see... Well, I'm glad to hear it. Makes me feel a little better about myself."

206
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:35,000
*Cullen downs the remainder of her beer in one gulp, then hands me the rest of the envelopes in a bundle.*

207
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:44,000
Cullen: "All right, let's go through the rest of the senders. Make sure you remember them, or you'll end up with more problems later."

208
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:46,000
Leon: "Okay. Go ahead."

209
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,000
Lucia: "Leon, you're not asleep yet?"

210
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:54,000
*Lucia walks over in her pajamas while I'm sorting through the letters in the living room.*

211
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:56,000
Leon: "Yeah... Huh, where's Aisia?"

212
00:14:56,000 --> 00:15:04,000
Lucia: "After playing with Momo during the day and partying it up with Cullen during the night, she's sleeping like a rock."

213
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Lucia: "She's just like a kid."

214
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:09,000
Leon: "Ahaha, that makes you mom, Lucia."

215
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:11,000
Lucia: "M-Mom? Wh-What're you?Leon!"

216
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:14,000
Leon: "My bad, my bad. I'll sleep soon, too."

217
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,000
Lucia: "So, what were you doing?"

218
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:22,000
*Lucia plops herself down on my knees. A comfortable warmth radiates from her body.*

219
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:28,000
Leon: "I figured I should go over the invitations so I remember who has sent me one so far."

220
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:33,000
*Just to be safe, I keep a record of the letters and their senders.*

221
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:40,000
*I felt a need to confirm how many times I've received letters from some of the senders in this bundle.*

222
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:47,000
Leon: "If I marry any one of them, I won't be able to turn them down like I'm doing right now anymore."

223
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:50,000
Lucia: "...Are you thinking of marrying?"

224
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,000
*Lucia looks up at me.*

225
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:57,000
*My left hand is free, so I place it on her head and feel her soft hair.*

226
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:59,000
Lucia: "What's the matter?"

227
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,000
Leon: "Well..."

228
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
*Her hair is still damp from the bath she took, but it's not so wet that she would catch a cold.*

229
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:11,000
Leon: "It's like I told Cullen earlier. I can't see myself getting married yet."

230
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:12,000
Lucia: "...Good."

231
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:16,000
*But, if I had to imagine someone, I know who it'd be.*

232
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:21,000
*In my mind, I see two figures?the people whom I've come to think of as family.*

233
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,000
Leon: "All right, done."

234
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:28,000
*Once I finish organizing the letters, I take my left hand off Lucia's head.*

235
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,000
Lucia: "Ah..."

236
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:33,000
Leon: "...Did you want me to stroke for a little longer?"

237
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:37,000
*My question is met with a quick shake of Lucia's head.*

238
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:43,000
Lucia: "I'm okay now. Aisia's going to laugh at me if I keep coming to you like this."

239
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,000
Leon: "She probably will."

240
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:47,000
Lucia: "...Why are you laughing?"

241
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:52,000
Leon: "You just... seem so adorable, Lucia. Anyway, let's head to bed."

242
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,000
Lucia: "Okay... Good night, Leon."

243
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:59,000
*I watch Lucia go back to her room before turning off the living room lights.*

244
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,000
*To marry is to become a family.*

245
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:09,000
*Right now, I simply cannot imagine a future for me where that happens with a complete stranger who gets sent to my doorstep.*

246
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:13,000
Aisia: "Only a bit! Please, it will only be for a bit!"

247
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:15,000
Lucia: "What're you trying to do?!"

248
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:18,000
*Lively voices are heard from upstairs.*

249
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Leon: "...I can hear you from down here, you know."

250
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:25,000
*With a resigned smile, I push the mop across the wet floor.*

251
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:31,000
*It's been a while since she'd done so, but Aisia made a mess just around closing hours.*

252
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:41,000
*She tipped over a bucket she was carrying. It was a small mistake?nothing like the spectacular failures of old?but Lucia ended up as collateral damage.*

253
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:48,000
*Aisia declared that she would make sure Lucia was nice and clean again, but I wonder how things are going now.*

254
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:56,000
*Lucia tends to avoid those situations out of embarrassment... but she probably got talked into getting in the tub together.*

255
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:58,000
Lucia: "Geez! Leon, help me already!"

256
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:02,000
Aisia: "Ah, no asking Leon for help! That's not fair!"

257
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,000
*...I hear nothing. I hear nothing.*

258
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:14,000
*I focus my senses on the mop. Its rhythmic motions clear my mind of worldly distractions... until the sound of the door opening shatters my inner peace.*

259
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:22,000
*Cullen's here two days in a row? I wonder if she ran into some problems while turning down yesterday's requests.*

260
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:24,000
*Slightly concerned, I turn around.*

261
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,000
Leon: "Wha?"

262
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:29,000
*A lady that I don't recognize is smiling at me from the entrance.*

263
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:35,000
*She looks a little older than me with features that are best described as "elegant".*

264
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:36,000
*...A customer?!*

265
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:42,000
*People almost never come around this hour. Caught off guard, my mind goes blank for a moment.*

266
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:45,000
*I look at the clock to check the time.*

267
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:48,000
*Yeah, it's definitely past closing time.*

268
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:55,000
*...Also, it's quiet right now, but there's no telling when the two of them might raise another ruckus.*

269
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:58,000
Leon: "I'm sorry, but we're closed for today."

270
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:06,000
*Considering she's the first customer we've had in a long time, I feel a tinge of regret, but I decide to turn her away.*

271
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:08,000
???: "Oh, my, is that so?"

272
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:14,000
*The lady replies with an unfazed smile. She doesn't look particularly disappointed.*

273
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:18,000
Leon: "Yes. After you came all this way, I'm terribly sorry, but?"

274
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:21,000
???: "Oh, no, you don't need to apologize."

275
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,000
Leon: "Huh?"

276
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:28,000
???: "After all... I didn't come here for the store. I came here to see you, Leon."

277
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,000
*...To see me?*

278
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:33,000
*Is she perhaps a repeat customer from a long time ago?*

279
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:36,000
Leon: "Um... excuse me, but could I know your name?"

280
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:39,000
???: "Rebecca Valentine. Call me Rebecca."

281
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,000
Leon: "Rebecca..."

282
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:45,000
*The ring of the name finds no corresponding memory that resonates.*

283
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:47,000
*Then... why does she know my name?*

284
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:54,000
*The next thing I know, her face is mere inches away from mine. A faint scent of greens hangs in the air.*

285
00:19:54,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Rebecca: "You're thinking far too hard about this. Relax, this is the first time we've met."

286
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:04,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, my, is your thinking face ever adorable, Leon."

287
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:08,000
Leon: "U-Uh, Re?I mean, Miss Valentine? Why do you know my name?"

288
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:13,000
Rebecca: "I heard it from my father. He said you're a wonderful man."

289
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:16,000
Rebecca: "Please, would you accept this?"

290
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:20,000
*Rebecca produces an envelope, which she then presents to me.*

291
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:23,000
*Its appearance bespeaks its contents.*

292
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:26,000
Leon: "...I see. So that's what this is about."

293
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:31,000
*None of the envelopes I got from Cullen yesterday looked like this one.*

294
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,000
Leon: "May I read what's inside?"

295
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,000
Rebecca: "Please."

296
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:40,000
*I take a moment to recompose myself. Then, I open the envelope and take a look at its contents.*

297
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:43,000
*The paper bears the same scent as her.*

298
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:52,000
*Neither traced nor copied, the gently-curving letters written in neat lines across the page are undoubtedly the products of her hand.*

299
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:56,000
*The words themselves, though, are a dime a dozen for me.*

300
00:20:56,000 --> 00:21:02,000
*I finish reading the letter and look up to find Rebecca waiting with a soft smile.*

301
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:04,000
Rebecca: "Leon, will you marry me?"

302
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,000
Leon: "...U-Ugh."

303
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:11,000
*Words strike harder through tongue than pen. I find myself shaken by her direct proposal.*

304
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:16,000
*However, I sorted through my feelings only yesterday. My stance does not change.*

305
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:19,000
*I take a deep breath before replying.*

306
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:23,000
Leon: "...I can't see myself marrying someone right now."

307
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:25,000
Rebecca: "Why might that be?"

308
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:30,000
*Rebecca's expression remains unchanged, though she cocks her head a little.*

309
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:37,000
Leon: "I don't think I'm mature enough. It'd be irresponsible of me to marry someone before I'm a real adult."

310
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Leon: "Also, I cherish my family and this store, and those have to come first."

311
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:49,000
*She came all this way to ask me in person. An earnest request deserves an equally earnest response.*

312
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:52,000
*Lively voices can still be heard from upstairs.*

313
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:57,000
*...If those two were down here, I'd be in some serious trouble right now.*

314
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,000
Rebecca: "I see... That's a shame."

315
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,000
Leon: "Yes... So?"

316
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:10,000
Rebecca: "In that case, allow me to change your mind. If I'm going to have someone as my husband, I want it to be you, Leon. I'm sure of it now."

317
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,000
Leon: "...Huh?"

318
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:13,000
*I... did just turn her down, right?*

319
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:21,000
Rebecca: "When someone can tell me what they hold dear without a second thought, it's proof that they're a wonderful person."

320
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:31,000
Rebecca: "I've had plenty of training in homemaking, so I'll be useful around the store. I'm sure your family will come to accept me, as well."

321
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:36,000
Rebecca: "After all, a family cherished by you is family to me, too."

322
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:38,000
Leon: "U-Um, Miss Valentine...?"

323
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:44,000
*I make an attempt to stop her train of thought, fully aware that it's probably in vain.*

324
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:53,000
Rebecca: "Of course, we would need to get to know each other better... Oh, but what if I fall for you even more? Whatever will I do?"

325
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:55,000
*Rebecca's cheeks redden.*

326
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:59,000
*I need to get myself out of this predicament. What can I do...*

327
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:04,000
*As I consider my options, Rebecca brings her hands together in a clap.*

328
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:07,000
Rebecca: "I just had a wonderful idea!"

329
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:10,000
*...I have such a bad feeling about this.*

330
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:19,000
Rebecca: "Getting married so suddenly can certainly cause problems. Therefore, we should have a trial first. What do you think?"

331
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:22,000
Leon: "U-Um, I'm not sure what I think..."

332
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:25,000
Rebecca: "Do you think... it's a bad idea?"

333
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:29,000
Leon: "No, but... what exactly are we going to do in this trial?"

334
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:34,000
Rebecca: "Well, first, we'll go register ourselves as being married?"

335
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:39,000
Leon: "I feel like we've already lost the 'trial' part of the idea..."

336
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:46,000
Rebecca: "I see... That's rather unfortunate. Hmm, what do you think would be good for a trial, Leon?"

337
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:49,000
Leon: "U-Um, you mean for a marriage?"

338
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:52,000
Rebecca: "Yes. What comes one step before marriage?"

339
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,000
*One step before...?*

340
00:23:53,000 --> 00:24:03,000
*If people were free to choose their own path toward marriage instead of going through matchmaking, I assume they would go on dates, and then kiss...*

341
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:05,000
Leon: "Cohabitation, I suppose?"

342
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:11,000
Rebecca: "Cohabitation... that sounds splendid! Leon, may I live here for a little while?"

343
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:18,000
Rebecca: "I certainly won't impose upon you for a long time... Let's see, how does one week sound?"

344
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:23,000
Leon: "Whoa, whoa, slow down. We're getting way ahead of ourselves here."

345
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:25,000
Rebecca: "Does that mean... no?"

346
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:34,000
Leon: "No?I mean, not no, but... U-Uh, right! Miss Valentine, don't you have family of your own? Wouldn't this be too sudden for?"

347
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:39,000
Rebecca: "That's no problem. My father has always wanted me to marry you, Leon."

348
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:46,000
*Ah, I see... They already had this in mind, and she just came here by herself to make the request.*

349
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:56,000
*I take a moment to appreciate how much of a help having Cullen as an intermediate has been until now. I'd have no idea how to refuse people otherwise.*

350
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:58,000
Leon: "...Are you sure? About me?"

351
00:24:58,000 --> 00:25:02,000
Rebecca: "Hmm... I can't imagine myself marrying anyone else."

352
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:06,000
*Is it just me, or did things just get even more serious?*

353
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:11,000
*She... is probably not a bad person. That much seems clear from our exchange.*

354
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:14,000
Leon: "...Um, what would happen if I say no?"

355
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:22,000
Rebecca: "Hmm, I'll come again tomorrow. It's warm around here, so I think I'll be quite fine spending a night by myself."

356
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:24,000
Leon: "Spending a night?"

357
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:31,000
Rebecca: "I have nowhere else to go, and it's a little too late to start walking back to the town now."

358
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:35,000
*...It's true that I didn't hear a car when she came to the store.*

359
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:44,000
*It was the same with Aisia, too... Is fate playing tricks on me? Am I just going to keep running into people who have nowhere else to go?*

360
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:50,000
*Then again... if I was okay with Aisia, there's no reason I shouldn't be okay with Rebecca.*

361
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:52,000
Leon: "One week's enough, right?"

362
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:58,000
Rebecca: "Yes. Of course, I'd be fine with one month, or one year, or even one whole lifetime."

363
00:25:58,000 --> 00:26:02,000
Leon: "...Okay. In that case, feel free to stay here for a week."

364
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:03,000
Rebecca: "Really?!"

365
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:05,000
*Rebecca's eyes widen.*

366
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Leon: "Well, I'd rather you didn't... but I can't just slam my door in your face and leave you by yourself."

367
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:24,000
*Knowing her, there's probably no risk of finding her dried out like a mummy on the roadside, but she does seem like the type to just pace back and forth in the same place.*

368
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:26,000
Rebecca: "Leon... you're so kind."

369
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:31,000
Rebecca: "Oh, I have one more request to make. Could you call me Rebecca?"

370
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:34,000
Leon: "Uh, but... aren't you older than me?"

371
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:39,000
Rebecca: "Yes, but it feels strange to have my husband call me 'Miss'. Please?"

372
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:40,000
Leon: "Um, well..."

373
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:41,000
Rebecca: "No?"

374
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:45,000
Leon: "...Okay, fine. I'll call you Rebecca, Miss?Erm, Rebecca."

375
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:48,000
Rebecca: "Wonderful! Thank you very much!"

376
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:52,000
*With that, Rebecca gives me her brightest smile so far.*

377
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:58,000
*Her expression is striking. It radiates with a charm that makes me unable to look away.*

378
00:26:58,000 --> 00:27:04,000
Rebecca: "It's a wonderful pleasure to meet the two of you. I'm Rebecca Valentine."

379
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Lucia: "...Nice to meet you, too."

380
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:11,000
Aisia: "I-It's my pleasure, too! I'm Aisia Mayfield! Nice to meet you!"

381
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:14,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, Aisia, you're adorable."

382
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:17,000
Aisia: "Wha?! R-Really? Thank you very much."

383
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:23,000
*After exchanging greetings, Lucia slowly turns and looks at me with dead fish eyes.*

384
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:25,000
Lucia: "Leon... is this a dream?"

385
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,000
Leon: "...Lucia?"

386
00:27:26,000 --> 00:27:34,000
Lucia: "I'm getting this weird feeling that there's a third female around here. And she just walked out of your room."

387
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Leon: "Uh, yeah... You're right."

388
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:45,000
*I couldn't ask Rebecca to sleep on the store sofa right from the get-go. The only person who'd sleep there by choice is Cullen.*

389
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:50,000
*That left me no choice but to give Rebecca my own room last night.*

390
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:58,000
*I, of course, had to then spend the night in the living room. And, of course, my body hurts in various places now.*

391
00:27:58,000 --> 00:28:02,000
Aisia: "Huh? Then, is this not the first time we met...?"

392
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:07,000
*Understandably, Aisia becomes confused about the greeting they just exchanged.*

393
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:08,000
Momo: "Aaaarf..."

394
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:10,000
Rebecca: "There, there."

395
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:13,000
*...Momo is clearly the least confused one here.*

396
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:20,000
*After happily having her ears scratched by Rebecca, Momo wags her tail more vigorously than I've ever seen.*

397
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:26,000
*I haven't explained anything to anyone... and I don't feel like I'll be able to, either.*

398
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:32,000
*As I mull helplessly over what I should do, Rebecca takes a look at Lucia and chuckles.*

399
00:28:32,000 --> 00:28:38,000
Rebecca: "What a wonderful name you have, Lucia. I love it. I hope we'll get along."

400
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:42,000
Lucia: "...Hey, Leon. Pinch my cheek for me, will you?"

401
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,000
Leon: "Huh?"

402
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:45,000
Lucia: "Pinch. My. Cheek."

403
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:46,000
Leon: "Um, sure..."

404
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:51,000
*I reach for Lucia's cheek as I'm told. It feels soft and supple in my fingers.*

405
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:53,000
*I squeeze it with a bit of force.*

406
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:56,000
Lucia: "...Thanks. You can let go now."

407
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:57,000
Leon: "...How is it?"

408
00:28:57,000 --> 00:29:02,000
Lucia: "It hurts a bit... Oh, Leon, what am I going to do? This isn't a dream."

409
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:08,000
Lucia: "And her breasts are bigger than mine again. Maybe you really are into that..."

410
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:11,000
Rebecca: "Leon, is Lucia not a morning person?"

411
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:14,000
Leon: "Well, she's usually fine, but..."

412
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:18,000
Lucia: "Leon, that's enough talking. Also... you know the drill."

413
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:19,000
Leon: "...Okay."

414
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:25,000
*I do as I'm told, folding my legs under me and sitting in seiza on the living room floor.*

415
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:33,000
*This is really tough on the legs. It's apparently even more painful for people with tails since the fur gets squished.*

416
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:41,000
*Just when I steel myself for the inevitable numbness in my legs, I find another person in the same stance as me.*

417
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:45,000
Lucia: "What are you sitting like that for, Rebecca?!"

418
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:48,000
*Lucia blurts out the question before I can.*

419
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:51,000
Rebecca: "Oh, you remembered my name? Thank you."

420
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:58,000
Rebecca: "As for why I'm sitting... Well, if my husband is sitting in seiza, I should do the same, no?"

421
00:29:58,000 --> 00:30:00,000
Lucia: "Husband... Husband?!"

422
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:01,000
*Oh, crap.*

423
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:13,000
Lucia: "L-Leon... what is the meaning of this? Didn't you just say you couldn't see yourself getting married the other day? How come you're someone's husband all of a sudden, then?!"

424
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:16,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, relax. This is only a trial."

425
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:17,000
Aisia: "A trial?"

426
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:29,000
Rebecca: "I certainly would like to be married to Leon as soon as possible, but he's rather hesitant to say 'Yes'... So I'm going to spend this week showing him why I'm a good fit."

427
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:32,000
Aisia: "I see. That's what you mean by a trial."

428
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:37,000
Rebecca: "That's right~ So, Aisia, Lucia, let's have a great week together, too."

429
00:30:37,000 --> 00:30:39,000
Aisia: "Eh? Ah, right."

430
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:46,000
*...Aisia somehow manages a reply. She's certainly unique in how she can just go with the flow like that.*

431
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:49,000
*On the other hand... Lucia has completely lost it.*

432
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:56,000
Lucia: "Leon's the husband and Rebecca's the trial and Aisia's... What am I, then? Huh? What's going on?"

433
00:30:56,000 --> 00:31:07,000
*She manages to give a halfhearted reply before descending into a sequence of vague mumbling. I'm sorry, Lucia. I honestly have no idea what's going on, either.*

434
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:13,000
Rebecca: "Truly, the two of you are absolutely adorable. Wouldn't you say so, too, Leon?"

435
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:16,000
*...You're expecting me to follow up on that?*

436
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:22,000
*A clever smile on her face, Rebecca asks from the seat next to me. When did she even sit down?*

437
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:33,000
Lucia: "...All right, I mostly understand now. I think this is insane, but it's probably even more insane to expect Leon to turn away a lady in the middle of the night."

438
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Aisia: "Leon's got a kind heart, after all."

439
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:39,000
Lucia: "I think he's more of a pushover, really..."

440
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:45,000
*And that's the reaction I get after I tell them about how Rebecca showed up last night.*

441
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:49,000
*A pushover, huh... Well, I can't exactly say she's wrong.*

442
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:55,000
Lucia: "The store sure is clean, though, considering someone showed up so late at night."

443
00:31:55,000 --> 00:32:01,000
Leon: "Rebecca insisted she'd clean the store... I tried to stop her but she wouldn't listen."

444
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:03,000
Lucia: "She wouldn't, huh..."

445
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:12,000
Aisia: "By the way, did you change how you make your onion soup this morning? The seasoning tasted a little different than usual."

446
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:15,000
Leon: "Oh, yeah, that was also Rebecca's work."

447
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:21,000
*She showed up when I was preparing things in the morning and asked if she could do it instead.*

448
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:29,000
*Her homemaking training really showed. It tasted different from our usual menu, but it was delicious in its own right.*

449
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:31,000
Aisia: "I see! Rebecca's amazing!"

450
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:36,000
Leon: "In terms of being amazing, I think you've got one up on her, Aisia."

451
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:41,000
*You're the one who can copy someone else's dish with just one look, after all.*

452
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:48,000
*On the other hand, when I watch Rebecca's motions, I can see all the work that she has put in over the years.*

453
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:56,000
*She takes care to not burn anything she's sauteing, and makes sure to remove any bitterness to improve the flavor.*

454
00:32:56,000 --> 00:33:04,000
*Once she finishes cooking, she immediately starts washing the utensils she no longer needs and dries them with clean cloth.*

455
00:33:04,000 --> 00:33:12,000
*There is no genius at work here. No flash of inspiration. Every act is a deliberate choice made through experience.*

456
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:18,000
Rebecca: "Leon, there's something I would like to discuss with you. May I have a moment?"

457
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:21,000
Leon: "Sure. Aisia, I'll leave the rest to you."

458
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:22,000
Aisia: "Okay!"

459
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:29,000
Rebecca: "I'd like to head out to buy something... Leon, could you take me to the shopping plaza?"

460
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:31,000
Leon: "What do you want to buy?"

461
00:33:31,000 --> 00:33:37,000
Rebecca: "Some seedlings. Hm? Oh, relax. I'll choose the easier ones that will grow in a week."

462
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:42,000
Leon: "I wasn't actually worried about that, but... Seedlings, huh."

463
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:44,000
Rebecca: "Is something the matter?"

464
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:51,000
Leon: "No, but I don't think I've ever seen any at the usual plaza... We might have to go to the Market."

465
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:53,000
Rebecca: "The Market, you say..."

466
00:33:53,000 --> 00:34:03,000
Leon: "Yeah, I'm not exactly itching to go there... but then again, I do need to replenish our herb supply, so I'll probably have to go there, anyway."

467
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:08,000
Rebecca: "In that case, I'll go do an inventory of our remaining herb supply."

468
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:14,000
Leon: "Oh, um, sure. Thanks. If there's something you don't know, you can ask Lucia."

469
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:16,000
*Still, the Market, huh...*

470
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:24,000
*The first thing that comes to mind about that place is being warned by Cullen time and again to only go there when necessary.*

471
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:28,000
*Indeed, there's a gloominess about that place that I don't like.*

472
00:34:28,000 --> 00:34:38,000
*I might have allowed my worry to show while I was chewing on my thoughts, as when I come to, I find Rebecca staring at my face from up close.*

473
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:41,000
Rebecca: "Leon, are you sure you're okay with this?"

474
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:43,000
Leon: "Y-Yeah, don't worry."

475
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:46,000
*I end up looking away in spite of myself.*

476
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:51,000
*Ever so slightly, Rebecca's hair brushes against the tip of my nose.*

477
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:53,000
Rebecca: "Are you really sure?"

478
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:59,000
Leon: "Yeah. It shouldn't be that dangerous if we go there while it's still bright outside."

479
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:03,000
Rebecca: "If anything does happen... I'll do whatever I can."

480
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:07,000
Leon: "You... No, I can't let a girl put herself in danger."

481
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:11,000
Rebecca: "...You're willing to treat me like a girl, I see."

482
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:12,000
*Rebecca beams.*

483
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:19,000
*It's not Aisia's energetic one. It's not Lucia's heartwarming one. And it's not Cullen's gleeful one, either.*

484
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:24,000
*Rebecca's smile is one that wraps you in a comfortable blanket of bliss.*

485
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:27,000
Leon: "Of course I do... That goes without saying."

486
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:31,000
*I'm flustered by a new sense of closeness between the two of us.*

487
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:39,000
Rebecca: "Well, then, let's hurry up and prepare the deliveries. The Market will have to come after that, right?"

488
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:43,000
Leon: "...Yeah. We'll go once we finish today's deliveries."

489
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:45,000
Leon: "I'll go tell Lucia."

490
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:47,000
Rebecca: "Thank you, Leon. Mmmhmhm."

491
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:58,000
*...Lucia goes without saying, since she's been with me forever, but not only have my recipes been stolen by Aisia, Rebecca has gotten a good handle on them now, too.*

492
00:35:58,000 --> 00:36:01,000
*Is my store's workflow really that obvious?*

493
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:04,000
*And can I really keep being the boss at this rate?*

494
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:13,000
*With uncertainty swirling through my mind, I go off looking for Lucia. We're about to open, so she's probably cleaning the store...*

495
00:36:13,000 --> 00:36:18,000
*The deliveries go smoothly and we arrive at the Market earlier than expected.*

496
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:23,000
*I park the car a little ways off and we walk the rest of the distance.*

497
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:29,000
*After passing through an alley, it feels like the temperature suddenly dropped a few degrees.*

498
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:32,000
Leon: "...It's been a while since I last came here."

499
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:41,000
*The damp air clings to my skin while air conditioning units hum noisily. The sun is still up, but it feels strangely dark here.*

500
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:48,000
Rebecca: "I had some idea of what to expect based on what you told me, but I see. So this is the Market."

501
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:51,000
Leon: "Have you never been here before?"

502
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:56,000
*Just walking through here makes me feel like I'm being showered by cold glares.*

503
00:36:56,000 --> 00:37:04,000
*When I first came to Sagami Francisco, there were times when I felt like this walking through the town, as well.*

504
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:09,000
*I suppose not having four ears like everyone else makes me a rare sight.*

505
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:14,000
Rebecca: "I was raised by my father to be a proper lady, after all."

506
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:20,000
*For a proper lady, she's been spending an awful lot of time staring at our surroundings.*

507
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:23,000
*This place is probably an exciting sight for her.*

508
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:28,000
*It also happens to be a place where trouble is always just around the corner.*

509
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:32,000
*...I'd rather not be here for any longer than I need to.*

510
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:42,000
Leon: "You've got a point. You definitely don't look like the type to come here often. There are things here that you can't find in the regular plazas."

511
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:50,000
Leon: "With that said... the place is a veritable maze. I sometimes get lost here... Hm, I wonder where they sell seedlings."

512
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:54,000
Rebecca: "Let's see... why don't we go this way and take a look?"

513
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:59,000
Leon: "H-Hey, Rebecca? It's dangerous to wander around like that, you know?"

514
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:05,000
Rebecca: "Relax~ I just get the feeling that they're this way. I hear them calling to me."

515
00:38:05,000 --> 00:38:11,000
Leon: "I'm pretty sure it's even more dangerous to be hearing the voices of plants in your head."

516
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:15,000
*With Rebecca leading the way, we round corner after corner.*

517
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:26,000
*I keep scanning the stalls left and right to make sure I don't miss anything. Every once in a while, I pick a person to ask. Meanwhile, Rebecca continues to plow onward.*

518
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:30,000
*About five minutes have passed since we entered the Market.*

519
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:39,000
*Normally, this is when I finally figure out the general direction I should head in. Rebecca, however, has already found the store.*

520
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:41,000
Rebecca: "See? There we go."

521
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:42,000
Leon: "No way..."

522
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:47,000
*In all my times coming to the market, I've never reached my goal this smoothly.*

523
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:56,000
*On top of that, we found this store today without even knowing its name. Of course, stores here rarely stay in one place, anyway.*

524
00:38:56,000 --> 00:38:59,000
Rebecca: "Now, then, what shall we go for..."

525
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:04,000
*With a bright smile on her face, Rebecca proceeds to pick her seedlings.*

526
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:11,000
Rebecca: "Leon... it might end up being a little heavy, but may I also pick up some tools and fertilizer?"

527
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:15,000
Leon: "Oh, yeah. Go ahead. Pick up whatever you want."

528
00:39:15,000 --> 00:39:21,000
*After we finish, Rebecca takes the lead again, bringing us safely back the way we came.*

529
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:27,000
*I'm feeling just the slightest bit of regret over saying "whatever you want", though.*

530
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:28,000
Rebecca: "We're back~"

531
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,000
Leon: "There we go."

532
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:33,000
*I lower the fertilizer and seedlings I'm carrying to the ground.*

533
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:37,000
*It is still bright outside, but there are no signs of customers.*

534
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:40,000
*...I guess this really has become the norm.*

535
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:47,000
*After getting Aisia's help in addition to Lucia's, running the store has become a lot more manageable.*

536
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:53,000
*I suppose from now on, I should start thinking about how to attract more customers here.*

537
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:54,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

538
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:58,000
Leon: "These aren't your toys, okay? No chewing on them."

539
00:39:58,000 --> 00:40:04,000
*Momo runs in circles around the seedlings before being gently pulled into Lucia's arms.*

540
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:10,000
Lucia: "Welcome back. That took you longer than usual... Wait, what's with all this stuff?"

541
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:18,000
Rebecca: "Leon got them for me after I asked him about it. I'll be borrowing your backyard for a little while, okay?"

542
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:21,000
Lucia: "Eh? Oh, uh, sure. Go ahead..."

543
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:27,000
Rebecca: "Here you go... Hmm, like I thought, the soil here has lost a lot of its fertility."

544
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:31,000
Aisia: "What are you going to be doing here, Rebecca?"

545
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:42,000
Rebecca: "I was thinking of growing a vegetable garden. It can become a selling point of the store, too, you know? You can say you cook with homegrown vegetables."

546
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:46,000
Aisia: "You're going to grow your own vegetables? That's amazing!"

547
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:52,000
Rebecca: "It's not very hard at all. I've also chosen easy ones to grow this time."

548
00:40:52,000 --> 00:40:54,000
*A vegetable garden, huh...*

549
00:40:54,000 --> 00:41:00,000
*I've heard of them before, but this is the first time I've seen anyone actually make one.*

550
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:10,000
*Apparently, there was a time in the past when stuff like that was popular. These days, though, most vegetables are grown in cultivation plants.*

551
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:15,000
Rebecca: "By preparing the soil properly like this, we can help life to grow."

552
00:41:15,000 --> 00:41:16,000
Aisia: "Wow, I see..."

553
00:41:16,000 --> 00:41:25,000
Rebecca: "Once the soil is ready, we make furrows like this and plant the seedlings we bought in here... Okay, and that's all there is to it."

554
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:28,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, I do hope they'll grow..."

555
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:30,000
Aisia: "Are you worried?"

556
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:39,000
Rebecca: "Worried? No... I think it's more of a nervous excitement. I've done all I can, so the rest is up to these little ones."

557
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:46,000
*Rebecca squats down and lightly pokes at the leaves of the newly-planted seedlings with her finger.*

558
00:41:46,000 --> 00:41:49,000
*Her gaze is gentle?like that of a loving mother.*

559
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:52,000
Leon: "You really do love plants, don't you?"

560
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:59,000
Rebecca: "Yes... They're like my friends and family. They're as adorable to me as Aisia and Lucia."

561
00:41:59,000 --> 00:42:02,000
Lucia: "Is that supposed to be a compliment?"

562
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:03,000
Leon: "Probably."

563
00:42:03,000 --> 00:42:09,000
*After spending a day with her, I'm beginning to understand the kind of person Rebecca is.*

564
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:13,000
*However, I'm not confident enough to say for sure yet.*

565
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:18,000
*For the next week, at least, the living room sofa will become Rebecca's bed.*

566
00:42:18,000 --> 00:42:23,000
*I was fine with her staying in my room, but she adamantly refused.*

567
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:26,000
*Last night was a one-off thing, and that was that.*

568
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:35,000
*She said that living together properly meant treasuring the lifestyle that everyone has crafted so far. I could do little to refute that.*

569
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:39,000
Leon: "Sorry, Rebecca, about not having a room ready for you."

570
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:43,000
Rebecca: "Relax, I don't mind. In fact, I'm quite excited."

571
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:44,000
Leon: "Excited?"

572
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:51,000
Rebecca: "I've never slept in a place like this before. I'm becoming more and more glad I came to you, Leon."

573
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:54,000
Lucia: "...The two of you are still awake?"

574
00:42:54,000 --> 00:42:59,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, Lucia, you look absolutely adorable in your pajamas."

575
00:42:59,000 --> 00:43:01,000
Lucia: "Wha?Uh... Um, thank you."

576
00:43:01,000 --> 00:43:06,000
Rebecca: "Aaah, you're too cute! Leon, please, may I hug Lucia to sleep tonight?"

577
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:10,000
Leon: "Well, I don't think I really have a say in that..."

578
00:43:10,000 --> 00:43:12,000
*Why is she asking me?*

579
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:14,000
Lucia: "Tell her no, geez!"

580
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:16,000
Leon: "H-Hey, don't get so upset."

581
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:21,000
Lucia: "For the love of... I can't even have a calm conversation like this."

582
00:43:21,000 --> 00:43:22,000
Leon: "Lucia?"

583
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:27,000
Aisia: "Lucia? What's the matter? Weren't we going to draw up battle plans?"

584
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:30,000
*Aisia's voice is heard from their room.*

585
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:33,000
*Lucia's expression suddenly stiffens.*

586
00:43:33,000 --> 00:43:37,000
*With her hand on her cheek, Rebecca smiles contemplatively.*

587
00:43:37,000 --> 00:43:40,000
Rebecca: "Battle plans? Oh, my. How interesting?"

588
00:43:40,000 --> 00:43:49,000
Lucia: "A-Aaaaaah, Aisia! Oh, what can that girl possibly be talking about? Maybe she's half-asleep? I-I'd better go. Good night, you two!"

589
00:43:49,000 --> 00:43:51,000
*Lucia rushes back to her room.*

590
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:58,000
*The door fails to close completely, allowing the voices from inside to leak into the living room.*

591
00:43:58,000 --> 00:44:01,000
Lucia: "Stop being so loud! They'll hear you!"

592
00:44:01,000 --> 00:44:04,000
Aisia: "You're right! That was a terrible mistake!"

593
00:44:04,000 --> 00:44:11,000
Lucia: "It's okay. I smoothed it over with them, so we haven't blown our cover. Anyway, about Rebecca..."

594
00:44:11,000 --> 00:44:16,000
*Without making a sound, Rebecca walks over to the door and closes it.*

595
00:44:16,000 --> 00:44:18,000
Rebecca: "There we go."

596
00:44:18,000 --> 00:44:20,000
Leon: "...Aren't you curious?"

597
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:29,000
Rebecca: "Hmm, of course, I'm curious to know what they're talking about if it's about me, but girls prefer to have their secrets."

598
00:44:29,000 --> 00:44:31,000
Leon: "Does that include you, too?"

599
00:44:31,000 --> 00:44:39,000
*Rebecca freezes for an instant?the question seemingly catching her off-guard?but soon returns to her usual smile.*

600
00:44:39,000 --> 00:44:47,000
Rebecca: "But of course. If you would like to know my secrets... well, I'll consider telling you if you marry me, Leon."

601
00:44:47,000 --> 00:44:49,000
*...I walked straight into that one.*

602
00:44:49,000 --> 00:44:53,000
Leon: "I guess I won't get to know for a good while, then."

603
00:44:53,000 --> 00:44:56,000
Rebecca: "Is that so? That's a shame..."

604
00:44:56,000 --> 00:45:03,000
Rebecca: "We'd be bothering the two of them if we keep talking like this. How about we go to bed?"

605
00:45:03,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Leon: "Oh, right. Good night, then, Rebecca."

606
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:11,000
Rebecca: "Good night. Oh, by the way, Leon, would you like to sleep together?"

607
00:45:11,000 --> 00:45:14,000
Leon: "...I think I'm fine on my own, thanks."

608
00:45:14,000 --> 00:45:19,000
Rebecca: "I see. That's a shame... Aha, just kidding. Good night, then."

609
00:45:19,000 --> 00:45:23,000
*I turn off the lights in the living room and head off to bed.*

610
00:45:23,000 --> 00:45:27,000
Aisia: "...I think the two of them have gone to bed."

611
00:45:27,000 --> 00:45:31,000
Lucia: "Okay, then let's figure out our battle plans."

612
00:45:31,000 --> 00:45:32,000
Momo: "Woof!"

613
00:45:32,000 --> 00:45:35,000
Lucia: "...Aisia, did you bring Momo in again?"

614
00:45:35,000 --> 00:45:37,000
Aisia: "W-Was I not supposed to?!"

615
00:45:37,000 --> 00:45:38,000
Momo: "Aaaarf..."

616
00:45:38,000 --> 00:45:44,000
Lucia: "Well, I don't really mind. I guess that means this meeting will have three members."

617
00:45:44,000 --> 00:45:45,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

618
00:45:45,000 --> 00:45:51,000
Aisia: "You're always so nice, Lucia. Okay, time for the battle plans! This sounds so exciting."

619
00:45:51,000 --> 00:45:59,000
Lucia: "Exciting? Oh, Aisia... you silly girl. Do you realize what's on the line for us? The situation is critical."

620
00:45:59,000 --> 00:46:03,000
Aisia: "The situation is critical! That sounds so exciting!"

621
00:46:03,000 --> 00:46:11,000
Lucia: "I spent the whole day today observing Rebecca, and it suddenly hit me. At this rate, we'll be in some serious trouble."

622
00:46:11,000 --> 00:46:12,000
Aisia: "Hm, hm."

623
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:21,000
Lucia: "First of all, unlike you, Aisia, she's good at all sorts of things right off the bat. Cooking, cleaning, washing, and even gardening."

624
00:46:21,000 --> 00:46:28,000
Lucia: "It'd be okay if she was just good at housework, but she... you know, seems to, um... like Leon a lot."

625
00:46:28,000 --> 00:46:33,000
Aisia: "You're right. But that's okay, because both of us like Leon a lot, too!"

626
00:46:33,000 --> 00:46:39,000
Lucia: "You make it look so easy, saying stuff like that... Sometimes, I wish I were you."

627
00:46:39,000 --> 00:46:41,000
Aisia: "What's wrong, Lucia?"

628
00:46:41,000 --> 00:46:49,000
Lucia: "Nothing! Also, Rebecca said this is only a trial... but I have a feeling she's going to end up staying here."

629
00:46:49,000 --> 00:46:57,000
Lucia: "Actually, it's more like the Leon I know isn't the kind of person who can kick someone out after only a week..."

630
00:46:57,000 --> 00:46:58,000
Aisia: "Ah..."

631
00:46:58,000 --> 00:46:59,000
Momo: "Aaarf..."

632
00:46:59,000 --> 00:47:03,000
Lucia: "Right? Of course, that's also one of his charms..."

633
00:47:03,000 --> 00:47:09,000
Lucia: "The thing is, if that happens, we won't be able to spend as much time with Leon anymore."

634
00:47:09,000 --> 00:47:12,000
Aisia: "That's bad! That's definitely very bad!"

635
00:47:12,000 --> 00:47:22,000
Lucia: "Right? Even today, before any of us even knew it, they'd gone off on deliveries together, and they even went shopping at the Market..."

636
00:47:22,000 --> 00:47:30,000
Lucia: "Anyway, if things keep going like this, we'll still be in the dark when the situation spirals out of our control!"

637
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:33,000
Aisia: "Oh, no! Wh-What should we do, then?"

638
00:47:33,000 --> 00:47:34,000
Momo: "Arf, arf..."

639
00:47:34,000 --> 00:47:43,000
Lucia: "That's why I think we have to start by getting to know Rebecca. What kind of person she is, and why she likes Leon, for example."

640
00:47:43,000 --> 00:47:49,000
Aisia: "Ah! I've heard of that somewhere before! Know your enemy and then something or other!"

641
00:47:49,000 --> 00:47:52,000
Lucia: "All right... let's do this, then."

642
00:47:52,000 --> 00:47:53,000
Aisia: "Right."

643
00:47:53,000 --> 00:47:54,000
Momo: "Woof!"

644
00:47:54,000 --> 00:47:59,000
Leon: "Morning... Huh, it looks like Rebecca's up early today, too."

645
00:47:59,000 --> 00:48:05,000
*Aisia and Lucia talked well into the night yesterday, so they'll probably be up late today.*

646
00:48:05,000 --> 00:48:08,000
Leon: "...It's been a while since I did this solo."

647
00:48:08,000 --> 00:48:11,000
*My idle musings accompany me to the kitchen.*

648
00:48:11,000 --> 00:48:15,000
*After preparing breakfast, I head out into the backyard.*

649
00:48:15,000 --> 00:48:21,000
*Rebecca is squatted as she tinkers with the soil, but she stands up as soon as she notices me.*

650
00:48:21,000 --> 00:48:25,000
Rebecca: "Oh, my, good morning. You're up early, Leon."

651
00:48:25,000 --> 00:48:30,000
Leon: "You're not exactly a late riser yourself. Some early morning gardening?"

652
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:38,000
Rebecca: "Yes. It looks like they're firmly rooted now. I don't think we have to worry about them too much anymore."

653
00:48:38,000 --> 00:48:43,000
Leon: "Speaking of that, I don't think I ever asked you what you planted."

654
00:48:43,000 --> 00:48:53,000
Rebecca: "I chose ones that are easy to grow this time. They should be fine even in this soil. There are bell peppers, cherry tomatoes, and chili peppers."

655
00:48:53,000 --> 00:48:57,000
Leon: "Huh... Yeah, they'd all come in pretty handy for the store."

656
00:48:57,000 --> 00:49:05,000
Rebecca: "Of course. I considered that when I was picking them. Hold on, let me go clean all this dirt off myself."

657
00:49:05,000 --> 00:49:08,000
*Rebecca heads to the faucet in the backyard.*

658
00:49:08,000 --> 00:49:12,000
Leon: "Oh, by the way, is that faucet working properly?"

659
00:49:12,000 --> 00:49:17,000
Rebecca: "I believe so. It's been fine so far. Is there something wrong with it?"

660
00:49:17,000 --> 00:49:24,000
Leon: "No, but I haven't touched it in a while, so I was wondering if you can still get water to come out."

661
00:49:24,000 --> 00:49:30,000
Rebecca: "I see... Now that you mention it, I suppose it wasn't the easiest to work with."

662
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Leon: "Yeah, I thought so. Time has probably taken its toll on it... I'll fix it up later."

663
00:49:36,000 --> 00:49:42,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, thank you very much. Of course, I'll only be here for six more days, though."

664
00:49:42,000 --> 00:49:45,000
Leon: "...Right. I guess that's true."

665
00:49:45,000 --> 00:49:49,000
*I feel like I've already gotten to know her very well.*

666
00:49:49,000 --> 00:49:56,000
*Aisia and Lucia still seem a little uneasy around her, but that's probably only a matter of time, as well.*

667
00:49:56,000 --> 00:49:58,000
Leon: "Marriage... and a wife, huh."

668
00:49:58,000 --> 00:50:07,000
*Rebecca imposed this week-long restriction on herself so she can live with me and demonstrate that she's a suitable candidate.*

669
00:50:07,000 --> 00:50:12,000
*Everything I've seen so far has certainly only strengthened her claim.*

670
00:50:12,000 --> 00:50:24,000
*Every aspect of her demeanor?every wink and nod?is slow but deliberate, and speaks to the homemaking training that is ingrained in her. I don't even need to see all of it to know.*

671
00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:28,000
*What she has is different from the genius of Aisia.*

672
00:50:28,000 --> 00:50:34,000
*It's probably people like Rebecca who are best suited to getting married and being wives.*

673
00:50:34,000 --> 00:50:41,000
*However... there's just something that doesn't sit well with me. I can't quite put my finger on it, though.*

674
00:50:41,000 --> 00:50:45,000
Rebecca: "Leon, there's no need to rush to a decision, you know?"

675
00:50:45,000 --> 00:50:53,000
*On the other hand, what about me? Am I, the one on the receiving end of her words of comfort, a suitable candidate?*

676
00:50:53,000 --> 00:51:01,000
*Despite having turned her down once, I'm still mulling over the possibility. Even I think I'm being wishy-washy.*

677
00:51:01,000 --> 00:51:03,000
Leon: "Oh, right... Sorry."

678
00:51:03,000 --> 00:51:09,000
Rebecca: "Hmm, you know, if you have to say something, I'd prefer thank you over sorry."

679
00:51:09,000 --> 00:51:12,000
Leon: "...I guess you're right. Thank you, Rebecca."

680
00:51:12,000 --> 00:51:15,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, you're very welcome."

681
00:51:15,000 --> 00:51:16,000
*Rebecca beams again.*

682
00:51:16,000 --> 00:51:18,000
*Man, she's really something else...*

683
00:51:18,000 --> 00:51:20,000
Aisia: "Breakfast time!"

684
00:51:20,000 --> 00:51:24,000
*After everyone takes their seats, we start eating breakfast.*

685
00:51:24,000 --> 00:51:34,000
*After Lucia drilled some etiquette into her, Aisia's table manners have significantly improved, though she's still erring on the side of rowdy today.*

686
00:51:34,000 --> 00:51:38,000
Rebecca: "Leon, could you look this way for a minute?"

687
00:51:38,000 --> 00:51:42,000
*I turn my head as I'm told, only to find her hand on my cheek.*

688
00:51:42,000 --> 00:51:47,000
*She takes a napkin with her other hand and wipes at my lower neck a few times.*

689
00:51:47,000 --> 00:51:48,000
Lucia: "Wha??!"

690
00:51:48,000 --> 00:51:51,000
Rebecca: "There. Now you're good to go."

691
00:51:51,000 --> 00:51:55,000
*Rebecca shows me the napkin, revealing a small stain.*

692
00:51:55,000 --> 00:51:59,000
Rebecca: "You had a little bit of dirt stuck to you."

693
00:51:59,000 --> 00:52:01,000
Leon: "O-Oh. Thanks, Rebecca."

694
00:52:01,000 --> 00:52:03,000
Rebecca: "You're very welcome."

695
00:52:03,000 --> 00:52:13,000
*Lucia opens her mouth as she stares at us, but no words come out. She repeats this a few times with no success before shuffling toward Aisia.*

696
00:52:13,000 --> 00:52:19,000
*Just as Aisia is about to ask for her third helping, she finds Lucia tugging at her sleeve.*

697
00:52:19,000 --> 00:52:22,000
Lucia: "A-Aisia? What did I just see?"

698
00:52:22,000 --> 00:52:24,000
Aisia: "I-I'm not sure, either."

699
00:52:24,000 --> 00:52:28,000
Lucia: "...Did something happen while we were asleep?"

700
00:52:28,000 --> 00:52:30,000
Aisia: "S-Something? Like what?"

701
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:38,000
Lucia: "I've always thought that Leon's the last person who would do something like that. And I still do... but what if..."

702
00:52:38,000 --> 00:52:44,000
Aisia: "C-Calm down, Lucia! We spent so much time yesterday talking about this, remember?"

703
00:52:44,000 --> 00:52:51,000
Lucia: "You're right... Let's get things under way. We'll set our plans into motion at noontime today."

704
00:52:51,000 --> 00:52:54,000
Aisia: "Everything is top secret, right?"

705
00:52:54,000 --> 00:53:00,000
*To their credit, they're both speaking in hushed voices, but I can still hear every word...*

706
00:53:00,000 --> 00:53:06,000
*While I'm trying to figure out what I should do with those two, Rebecca quickly stands up.*

707
00:53:06,000 --> 00:53:11,000
Rebecca: "That was delicious. You truly are a wonderful cook, Leon."

708
00:53:11,000 --> 00:53:13,000
Leon: "Uh... right. Thanks."

709
00:53:13,000 --> 00:53:16,000
*A hesitant stammer precedes my response.*

710
00:53:16,000 --> 00:53:20,000
Rebecca: "And those two... Oh, they're absolutely adorable."

711
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:21,000
Leon: "..."

712
00:53:21,000 --> 00:53:27,000
*...I wonder if life would be easier for me if I could carry myself the way she does.*

713
00:53:27,000 --> 00:53:32,000
*Two hushed voices continue to whisper their secret plans to each other.*

714
00:53:32,000 --> 00:53:37,000
*Trying very hard to not listen, I finish off the remainder of my breakfast.*

715
00:53:37,000 --> 00:53:40,000
Lucia: "Leon, we require your cooperation."

716
00:53:40,000 --> 00:53:46,000
*As always, having Aisia's help today allows me to finish preparing the deliveries early.*

717
00:53:46,000 --> 00:53:55,000
*With some time to spare, I begin wondering what I should do, but my thoughts are cut short when Lucia shows up out of nowhere with a demand.*

718
00:53:55,000 --> 00:53:56,000
Leon: "...For what?"

719
00:53:56,000 --> 00:54:00,000
Aisia: "We would like to get to know Rebecca better, too!"

720
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:07,000
Lucia: "Yeah, and this morning, the two of you looked... you know, pretty friendly with each other."

721
00:54:07,000 --> 00:54:12,000
Lucia: "So, we figured we should get to know her better for ourselves."

722
00:54:12,000 --> 00:54:15,000
Aisia: "That is our top secret battle plan!"

723
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:26,000
Lucia: "We were pretty shocked at first, of course. I mean, we go to bed one night, and the next thing we know, there's someone else living with us under the same roof."

724
00:54:26,000 --> 00:54:29,000
Leon: "I know. I'm really sorry about that."

725
00:54:29,000 --> 00:54:35,000
Lucia: "Well, I guess this is your home, so it's not like I have any right to complain..."

726
00:54:35,000 --> 00:54:45,000
Lucia: "Wait, scratch that. What I actually mean is since you accepted her, I'm sure she's a good person. We just don't know her very well right now."

727
00:54:45,000 --> 00:54:51,000
Aisia: "If we could see her the same way you do, I think we would all have a much better time."

728
00:54:51,000 --> 00:54:55,000
Leon: "Okay, so what do you want me to cooperate with?"

729
00:54:55,000 --> 00:54:58,000
Aisia: "We would like you to stay with one of us."

730
00:54:58,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Lucia: "And then, the other person will try to have a chat with Rebecca. After all, Rebecca's, um... probably, you know..."

731
00:55:06,000 --> 00:55:08,000
Aisia: "Lucia! You can do this!"

732
00:55:08,000 --> 00:55:12,000
Lucia: "She's in, um... l-l-love with you, right, Leon?"

733
00:55:12,000 --> 00:55:15,000
Leon: "...As far as I know, it seems like it."

734
00:55:15,000 --> 00:55:17,000
Lucia: "Ah... I was right..."

735
00:55:17,000 --> 00:55:25,000
*I doubt this whole marriage fiasco would have happened otherwise. Instead, it would have ended when I turned her down.*

736
00:55:25,000 --> 00:55:33,000
*I mean, I was aware of it in the back of my mind, but hearing it said out loud like this is still a little embarrassing.*

737
00:55:33,000 --> 00:55:40,000
Lucia: "We figured that, well, if you're always with her, we'll never get to know the real Rebecca."

738
00:55:40,000 --> 00:55:44,000
Leon: "I see... Okay, no problem. You have my cooperation."

739
00:55:44,000 --> 00:55:46,000
Aisia: "Thank you very much!"

740
00:55:46,000 --> 00:55:53,000
Lucia: "Thanks, Leon. All right, waiting's not going to solve any problems, so I might as well go have a shot."

741
00:55:53,000 --> 00:55:56,000
Aisia: "Go for it, Lucia! I'm rooting for you!"

742
00:55:56,000 --> 00:55:57,000
Lucia: "..."

743
00:55:57,000 --> 00:56:00,000
*Rebecca and Lucia are alone in the store.*

744
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:12,000
*Despite it being the middle of the day, there's not a customer in sight. Which is convenient, until you realize we're running a business here, but I'll worry about that later.*

745
00:56:12,000 --> 00:56:15,000
Aisia: "Do you think Lucia is nervous?"

746
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:18,000
Leon: "Probably. She can be really shy at times."

747
00:56:18,000 --> 00:56:23,000
Aisia: "...I don't seem to remember her being like that with me, though."

748
00:56:23,000 --> 00:56:30,000
Leon: "That's because you were even better at breaking the ice with people and getting them to like you."

749
00:56:30,000 --> 00:56:32,000
Aisia: "I see! So that was why!"

750
00:56:32,000 --> 00:56:37,000
Leon: "Yeah. In fact, I think that's the most charming thing about you."

751
00:56:37,000 --> 00:56:40,000
Aisia: "Oh... Um, thank you very much."

752
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
Leon: "...You know, it'd be a lot easier for both of us if you don't get embarrassed there."

753
00:56:46,000 --> 00:56:50,000
Aisia: "S-Sorry... Oh, look! Lucia's taking deep breaths!"

754
00:56:50,000 --> 00:56:54,000
*Lucia takes two deep breaths, then clenches her fists.*

755
00:56:54,000 --> 00:56:59,000
Leon: "It looks like she's ready to... um, what is she going to do, exactly?"

756
00:56:59,000 --> 00:57:06,000
Aisia: "If she sticks to the plan we thought of yesterday, she should be asking her lots of questions..."

757
00:57:06,000 --> 00:57:10,000
Rebecca: "...? Lucia, what are you doing all the way over there?"

758
00:57:10,000 --> 00:57:17,000
Lucia: "Huh? N-Nothing. Just minding my own business. Definitely wasn't looking at you or anything."

759
00:57:17,000 --> 00:57:24,000
Aisia: "Aah! That's no good! She spent too much time staring and Rebecca ended up noticing her first!"

760
00:57:24,000 --> 00:57:28,000
Leon: "Well, at this point, she'll just have to play it by ear..."

761
00:57:28,000 --> 00:57:36,000
*This is Rebecca we're talking about, after all. I doubt it'll be too bad unless something goes spectacularly wrong.*

762
00:57:36,000 --> 00:57:40,000
*Aisia and I continue to watch the two of them from cover.*

763
00:57:40,000 --> 00:57:47,000
Rebecca: "I was actually just thinking I should have a chat with you, Lucia. Could I have a moment?"

764
00:57:47,000 --> 00:57:48,000
Lucia: "S-Sure..."

765
00:57:48,000 --> 00:57:55,000
Aisia: "Lucia has become like a kitten being held by her neck. She has lost all control over the conversation."

766
00:57:55,000 --> 00:58:01,000
Rebecca: "I heard from Leon that the two of you kept this store safe over all these years."

767
00:58:01,000 --> 00:58:11,000
Lucia: "Yeah... We had nobody else to look to. Of course, Cullen was a big help and recently, Aisia has come, too, so it's gotten a lot livelier, but..."

768
00:58:11,000 --> 00:58:20,000
Rebecca: "I did some cleaning around the store yesterday, and the amount of love and care you put into this store really showed."

769
00:58:20,000 --> 00:58:29,000
Rebecca: "So, let me take this chance to apologize. I'm sorry for touching something you treasure so much without your permission."

770
00:58:29,000 --> 00:58:32,000
*Rebecca lowers her head in a deep bow.*

771
00:58:32,000 --> 00:58:33,000
Lucia: "Eh? Eh?"

772
00:58:33,000 --> 00:58:38,000
*Lucia looks toward us with wide, panicked eyes, but we can offer her no help.*

773
00:58:38,000 --> 00:58:41,000
*With her head still down, Rebecca continues.*

774
00:58:41,000 --> 00:58:47,000
Rebecca: "...It must have been awful for you to have your life intruded upon by someone like me."

775
00:58:47,000 --> 00:58:53,000
Lucia: "Th-That's not true at all! You're so polite, and you made everything look so nice!"

776
00:58:53,000 --> 00:59:01,000
Lucia: "You're a far cry from how Aisia was when she first came. She didn't even know how to clean things. It was a nightmare."

777
00:59:01,000 --> 00:59:03,000
Aisia: "Geez, I?mmmffffm!"

778
00:59:03,000 --> 00:59:05,000
Aisia: "Why did you stop me, Leon?"

779
00:59:05,000 --> 00:59:11,000
Leon: "What happened to the plan? Wasn't one of you supposed to sit here and watch with me?"

780
00:59:11,000 --> 00:59:15,000
*It would defeat the point if she dashed out right now.*

781
00:59:15,000 --> 00:59:19,000
Aisia: "Nnngh, but I know how to clean things already."

782
00:59:19,000 --> 00:59:25,000
Leon: "It's okay. Lucia knows that, too. Let's just keep watching the two of them for now, okay?"

783
00:59:25,000 --> 00:59:30,000
Lucia: "Besides, if Leon forgives you, then it's like I've forgiven you, as well."

784
00:59:30,000 --> 00:59:31,000
Rebecca: "Is it?"

785
00:59:31,000 --> 00:59:35,000
Lucia: "...It's always been just the two of us, after all."

786
00:59:35,000 --> 00:59:41,000
Rebecca: "This store is filled with memories that are shared by the two of you, isn't it?"

787
00:59:41,000 --> 00:59:46,000
Lucia: "Y-Yeah... it's sort of embarrassing to hear it said like that, though..."

788
00:59:46,000 --> 00:59:54,000
Rebecca: "I haven't spoken to Leon about this yet... but would it be okay for me to help do some work in this store?"

789
00:59:54,000 --> 00:59:57,000
*...She sure hasn't. That's new to me.*

790
00:59:57,000 --> 00:59:59,000
*Aisia shakes her head, as well.*

791
00:59:59,000 --> 01:00:05,000
Lucia: "...If anything, we're the ones who should be asking you for help. Would you?"

792
01:00:05,000 --> 01:00:10,000
Rebecca: "Of course I would. In fact, I had no idea what I'd do if you said no."

793
01:00:10,000 --> 01:00:13,000
Lucia: "Why'd you decide to ask, all of a sudden?"

794
01:00:13,000 --> 01:00:20,000
Rebecca: "Because of what Leon said. He told me that he cherishes this store and wants to take good care of it."

795
01:00:20,000 --> 01:00:23,000
Lucia: "R-Really... Leon said that, huh."

796
01:00:23,000 --> 01:00:29,000
Rebecca: "And something that Leon cherishes is something I'd like to cherish, as well."

797
01:00:29,000 --> 01:00:35,000
Rebecca: "That's why I'm going to take wonderful care of this store. And you, as well, Lucia~"

798
01:00:35,000 --> 01:00:37,000
Lucia: "M-Me, too? ...Fwwaaah?"

799
01:00:37,000 --> 01:00:41,000
*Rebecca straightens and pulls Lucia into a tight hug.*

800
01:00:41,000 --> 01:00:43,000
Lucia: "Um... Rebecca?"

801
01:00:43,000 --> 01:00:49,000
*Lucia squirms around in Rebecca's arms before managing to pull her face out and look up.*

802
01:00:49,000 --> 01:00:52,000
*The sight further brightens Rebecca's smile.*

803
01:00:52,000 --> 01:00:56,000
Rebecca: "This is how I show my affection. Do you... like it?"

804
01:00:56,000 --> 01:00:58,000
Lucia: "Well, yes, I supp?Fwaaah!"

805
01:00:58,000 --> 01:01:04,000
*As soon as "Yes" leaves Lucia's lips, she is drawn into an even tighter embrace by Rebecca.*

806
01:01:04,000 --> 01:01:07,000
Rebecca: "Are you okay, Lucia? Am I hurting you?"

807
01:01:07,000 --> 01:01:11,000
Lucia: "N-No... I'm okay. You're so warm... It, um, feels good..."

808
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:15,000
Rebecca: "Oh, what a lucky girl I am to be complimented by you."

809
01:01:15,000 --> 01:01:24,000
Rebecca: "I love hugging adorable girls like you. It makes me feel so happy. What about you, Lucia? Does this make you feel happy?"

810
01:01:24,000 --> 01:01:26,000
Lucia: "I... I think so."

811
01:01:26,000 --> 01:01:29,000
Rebecca: "Will you continue to be my friend?"

812
01:01:29,000 --> 01:01:30,000
Lucia: "Yes..."

813
01:01:30,000 --> 01:01:32,000
Aisia: "Lucia got instantly KO'ed!"

814
01:01:32,000 --> 01:01:36,000
Aisia: "Is hugging people Rebecca's superpower or something?!"

815
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:39,000
*Superpower might be going too far...*

816
01:01:39,000 --> 01:01:42,000
*I don't blame Aisia for thinking that, though.*

817
01:01:42,000 --> 01:01:44,000
*After all, I'm equally in shock.*

818
01:01:44,000 --> 01:01:49,000
*I don't think I've ever seen Lucia snuggle up to someone like that before.*

819
01:01:49,000 --> 01:01:51,000
Leon: "...Rebecca's amazing."

820
01:01:51,000 --> 01:01:57,000
Aisia: "Yes... but Lucia's no good at all. She didn't manage to find out anything about Rebecca."

821
01:01:57,000 --> 01:01:59,000
Leon: "Oh, yeah. Right..."

822
01:01:59,000 --> 01:02:02,000
*...Is it just me, or does Aisia look a little mad?*

823
01:02:02,000 --> 01:02:10,000
*I guess I can't blame her, since all that really happened was everyone got a refresher on Aisia's past failures...*

824
01:02:10,000 --> 01:02:16,000
Aisia: "This time, it's my turn. I'll go investigate what kind of person Rebecca is!"

825
01:02:16,000 --> 01:02:20,000
Leon: "Investigate? Are you sure you know how to do that?"

826
01:02:20,000 --> 01:02:27,000
Aisia: "Nnngh, I suppose I'm not very good at that... I-In that case, I'll go talk with her some more!"

827
01:02:27,000 --> 01:02:30,000
Leon: "...Do we still have to keep hiding, then?"

828
01:02:30,000 --> 01:02:36,000
Aisia: "Yes. If I join the conversation right now, Rebecca will still have the upper hand!"

829
01:02:36,000 --> 01:02:41,000
Aisia: "I need to wait for the right time. I'll go once I find an opening."

830
01:02:41,000 --> 01:02:45,000
Aisia: "Lucia's plans failed... so I came up with my own!"

831
01:02:45,000 --> 01:02:53,000
Aisia: "With Lucia, they started talking about things that mattered to her, and that's when everything fell apart."

832
01:02:53,000 --> 01:02:58,000
Aisia: "In that case, I'm going to go straight for topics that matter to Rebecca."

833
01:02:58,000 --> 01:03:01,000
Leon: "And that's where the garden comes in?"

834
01:03:01,000 --> 01:03:08,000
Aisia: "I thought that maybe while she's teaching me how to do gardening, I can find out more about her."

835
01:03:08,000 --> 01:03:12,000
Aisia: "But... I think I'll still have no idea what I'm doing..."

836
01:03:12,000 --> 01:03:17,000
Aisia: "So, could you watch over me to make sure I don't mess things up?"

837
01:03:17,000 --> 01:03:21,000
*...Ah, I see. Aisia's counting on me to help her right now.*

838
01:03:21,000 --> 01:03:24,000
*Realizing that, I happily go along with her plan.*

839
01:03:24,000 --> 01:03:29,000
Leon: "No problem... Are you sure you don't want me to actually do anything?"

840
01:03:29,000 --> 01:03:35,000
Aisia: "Yes, I'm sure! I would also like to become better friends with Rebecca, after all."

841
01:03:35,000 --> 01:03:39,000
*With that, Aisia skips eagerly off to the backyard.*

842
01:03:39,000 --> 01:03:42,000
Leon: "...Is she really going to be okay?"

843
01:03:42,000 --> 01:03:44,000
*She has the right idea, I think.*

844
01:03:44,000 --> 01:03:54,000
*I'm sure Rebecca will answer any questions she's asked, and she'll undoubtedly be happy to know that someone is interested in what she's doing.*

845
01:03:54,000 --> 01:04:02,000
*The only thing I'm worried about is whether Aisia can ask the right questions so she doesn't end up going in circles...*

846
01:04:02,000 --> 01:04:05,000
Rebecca: "You want to learn how to garden?"

847
01:04:05,000 --> 01:04:06,000
Aisia: "Yes."

848
01:04:06,000 --> 01:04:15,000
Rebecca: "Hmm, there's nothing special to it, you know? It's just taking care of things. I doubt you'll find it very interesting."

849
01:04:15,000 --> 01:04:16,000
Aisia: "Really?"

850
01:04:16,000 --> 01:04:25,000
Rebecca: "For example... Making sure the roots don't rot, pulling out weeds, and keeping pests away. It's just things like that."

851
01:04:25,000 --> 01:04:31,000
Rebecca: "Of course, I do change how much I water them based on the weather and temperature."

852
01:04:31,000 --> 01:04:33,000
Aisia: "Hm, hm, I see!"

853
01:04:33,000 --> 01:04:37,000
Rebecca: "...I'm sorry. This isn't very interesting at all, is it?"

854
01:04:37,000 --> 01:04:44,000
Aisia: "It's very interesting! I honestly knew nothing about this, so everything you say is a surprise to me!"

855
01:04:44,000 --> 01:04:48,000
Rebecca: "...Well, then, would you like to try it with me?"

856
01:04:48,000 --> 01:04:49,000
Aisia: "Yes! Please!"

857
01:04:49,000 --> 01:04:52,000
Leon: "...So much for worrying. She's doing fine."

858
01:04:52,000 --> 01:04:57,000
*Despite both mine and Aisia's own concerns, the conversation proceeds smoothly.*

859
01:04:57,000 --> 01:05:07,000
*Rebecca said herself that she's eager to become friends with Lucia and Aisia, and Aisia's not the kind of person to put up barriers to begin with.*

860
01:05:07,000 --> 01:05:12,000
*Lucia's performance probably just made both Aisia and I overthink things.*

861
01:05:12,000 --> 01:05:17,000
*I guess that's just how much of an impression the hug-KO left on us.*

862
01:05:17,000 --> 01:05:20,000
Rebecca: "...? Oh, Leon, you're here, too?"

863
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:23,000
Leon: "Yeah, Aisia asked me to watch over her."

864
01:05:23,000 --> 01:05:27,000
Aisia: "Waah! Waah! You're not supposed to say that!"

865
01:05:27,000 --> 01:05:31,000
Rebecca: "...Would you like to join us in our soil adventures?"

866
01:05:31,000 --> 01:05:35,000
Leon: "No, I'm good. I'll just watch from over here."

867
01:05:35,000 --> 01:05:38,000
Aisia: "You should come try, too, Leon!"

868
01:05:38,000 --> 01:05:43,000
Leon: "...Uh, well, we might still see a customer. You never know, right?"

869
01:05:43,000 --> 01:05:47,000
Aisia: "That's true! I completely forgot about that possibility!"

870
01:05:47,000 --> 01:05:52,000
*We're done deliveries, but technically, this is still business hours.*

871
01:05:52,000 --> 01:05:58,000
*To be fair, the bell would ring if a customer came, and even then I could just tell Lucia...*

872
01:05:58,000 --> 01:06:03,000
Rebecca: "...Oh, my, Aisia, there's a place on your clothes that's coming loose."

873
01:06:03,000 --> 01:06:05,000
Aisia: "Huh? Where is it?"

874
01:06:05,000 --> 01:06:10,000
Rebecca: "It's on your skirt. Leon, would you happen to have a sewing kit?"

875
01:06:10,000 --> 01:06:14,000
Leon: "Good question... I think Lucia might have one."

876
01:06:14,000 --> 01:06:20,000
Rebecca: "Then let's get that fixed right away. Aisia, could you wait for me at the table?"

877
01:06:20,000 --> 01:06:21,000
Aisia: "Y-Yes."

878
01:06:21,000 --> 01:06:26,000
*Her steps brisk and light, Rebecca climbs the stairs to the second floor.*

879
01:06:26,000 --> 01:06:29,000
Leon: "I guess we'll wait here for a bit, then."

880
01:06:29,000 --> 01:06:34,000
Aisia: "...It's my first time seeing sewing, too! This is so exciting!"

881
01:06:34,000 --> 01:06:40,000
Leon: "Yeah, she did say she learned all sorts of things during homemaking training."

882
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:47,000
*Still, though. I mean, you'd expect cooking, washing, and cleaning, but gardening and sewing, as well?*

883
01:06:47,000 --> 01:06:52,000
*Those aren't skills you just pick up. You'd need quite the proper education.*

884
01:06:52,000 --> 01:06:56,000
Leon: "...I guess she really does come from a well-to-do family."

885
01:06:56,000 --> 01:06:58,000
Aisia: "Do you mean Rebecca?"

886
01:06:58,000 --> 01:06:59,000
Leon: "Yeah..."

887
01:06:59,000 --> 01:07:09,000
*Of course, not everyone is like Rebecca, but seeing her does give me a newfound understanding of why Cullen keeps saying those envelopes are a real shame.*

888
01:07:09,000 --> 01:07:15,000
Rebecca: "Hmm... There aren't any customers, so why don't we fix this up right now?"

889
01:07:15,000 --> 01:07:24,000
*After coming back and noticing the perpetual emptiness of the store, Rebecca promptly crouches down and takes Aisia's skirt in her hands.*

890
01:07:24,000 --> 01:07:27,000
Rebecca: "Don't move now, okay, Aisia?"

891
01:07:27,000 --> 01:07:30,000
*A dazzling display of dexterity ensues.*

892
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
*Barely five minutes pass before the frayed area on Aisia's skirt looks good as new.*

893
01:07:36,000 --> 01:07:38,000
Aisia: "Th-That was amazing!"

894
01:07:38,000 --> 01:07:41,000
Leon: "Yeah... you can say that again."

895
01:07:41,000 --> 01:07:51,000
*Out of all the abilities Rebecca has shown us so far, that was probably the easiest to comprehend?mainly because we could see it happening before our eyes.*

896
01:07:51,000 --> 01:07:59,000
Rebecca: "I can probably do all sorts of things with the sewing kit that Lucia lent me. There's a Relic in there, too."

897
01:07:59,000 --> 01:08:02,000
Leon: "Huh... So, that one was used for sewing..."

898
01:08:02,000 --> 01:08:17,000
*Ever since Cullen decided she's got no use for them and "gifted" them to us, that pile of Relics has been relegated to the job of "tripping hazard" in the storeroom. I guess one of them will finally be seeing the light of day.*

899
01:08:17,000 --> 01:08:23,000
Rebecca: "If it's still usable... then I can probably even take old clothes and make them over."

900
01:08:23,000 --> 01:08:33,000
Rebecca: "And that brings us to something I've been meaning to discuss with you, Leon... Would it be okay for me to help out at this store, as well?"

901
01:08:33,000 --> 01:08:37,000
Aisia: "Hey, that's the same thing you asked Lucia just?Mmmffmm!"

902
01:08:37,000 --> 01:08:41,000
Leon: "Oh, um, yeah. About that. Lucia just told me about it."

903
01:08:41,000 --> 01:08:46,000
*...This close. Aisia was THIS close to spilling the beans about our spying.*

904
01:08:46,000 --> 01:08:50,000
Aisia: "Mmmmffffmm, mwaaahfffmmm! (Leon, let go of me, please.)"

905
01:08:50,000 --> 01:08:57,000
Rebecca: "Leon... I'm pretty sure you've got one of your fingers in Aisia's mo?Are those teeth marks?"

906
01:08:57,000 --> 01:09:07,000
Leon: "...Don't worry about it. Yep. Everything's perfectly fine. Anyway, what were we?Oh, right. I'd certainly appreciate it if you were willing to help."

907
01:09:07,000 --> 01:09:13,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, thank you. Now, why don't I get started by making, say, an apron?"

908
01:09:13,000 --> 01:09:17,000
Aisia: "Bwaah! Wow! That's amazing! You can make aprons, too?"

909
01:09:17,000 --> 01:09:25,000
Rebecca: "Yes. Making something as wonderful as your uniforms would be quite the task, but an apron is quick work."

910
01:09:25,000 --> 01:09:30,000
Leon: "'Quite the task', meaning you can actually make one if you want to..."

911
01:09:30,000 --> 01:09:31,000
Rebecca: "Yes."

912
01:09:31,000 --> 01:09:39,000
*True to her word, Rebecca shows up in the store the next day wearing a brand new apron that she finished making in one night.*

913
01:09:39,000 --> 01:09:46,000
*With more hands to spare, we can now divide up the work. Aisia and I are in charge of the kitchen,*

914
01:09:46,000 --> 01:09:50,000
*while Lucia and Rebecca are now in charge of the dining space.*

915
01:09:50,000 --> 01:09:54,000
*Of course, very rarely do customers actually show up in person,*

916
01:09:54,000 --> 01:10:00,000
*but this way, even if Lucia is tied up for a long time, we won't be short on staff.*

917
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:07,000
*A surprise to absolutely no one, Rebecca is a fast learner and quickly gets the hang of her work.*

918
01:10:07,000 --> 01:10:17,000
*Two people handle the deliveries. One is always me, while the other spot rotates through the girls. The remaining two people keep the store running.*

919
01:10:17,000 --> 01:10:22,000
*We soon find ourselves settling comfortably into our new workflow.*

920
01:10:22,000 --> 01:10:26,000
*On the sixth night since Rebecca's arrival, Cullen pops in.*

921
01:10:26,000 --> 01:10:28,000
Cullen: "Yo, Leon. Still alive?"

922
01:10:28,000 --> 01:10:32,000
Leon: "I'm fine, Cullen, thanks for asking. How have you been?"

923
01:10:32,000 --> 01:10:33,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

924
01:10:33,000 --> 01:10:41,000
Cullen: "Fine. Hey, good to see you, too, Momo. Hey, sorry about last time. Feels like I'm always bringing you trouble."

925
01:10:41,000 --> 01:10:48,000
Leon: "Not at all... In fact, I've become painfully aware of how big a help you've been all this time..."

926
01:10:48,000 --> 01:10:50,000
Cullen: "Hm? What do you mean?"

927
01:10:50,000 --> 01:10:53,000
*I have yet to tell her about Rebecca.*

928
01:10:53,000 --> 01:11:00,000
*As I mull over how to explain this, the person in question decides to show up from the back of the store.*

929
01:11:00,000 --> 01:11:03,000
Rebecca: "Leon, do we have a customer? ...Oh, my."

930
01:11:03,000 --> 01:11:07,000
Cullen: "Whoa! This is... Yep, this is definitely a new face!"

931
01:11:07,000 --> 01:11:09,000
Leon: "Uh, you see, this is..."

932
01:11:09,000 --> 01:11:12,000
*A devious glint flashes across Cullen's eyes.*

933
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:19,000
Cullen: "Well, now, looks up you've been having some fun behind my back, eh? Care to explain, young man?"

934
01:11:19,000 --> 01:11:25,000
*With an unnerving amount of emphasis placed on 'young man', she wraps her arm around my back.*

935
01:11:25,000 --> 01:11:30,000
*I can already see where this is headed. It's going to be a very long day.*

936
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:34,000
Leon: "Ugh, I can feel the headache coming on already..."

937
01:11:34,000 --> 01:11:36,000
Cullen: "Ugh? So rude!"

938
01:11:36,000 --> 01:11:49,000
Cullen: "I'll have you know I've been worried about you ever since you started living with Lucia. You've had a cute girl next to you twenty-four-seven and I've never even seen you make a move on her."

939
01:11:49,000 --> 01:12:01,000
Cullen: "So, there I am, stressing over your future and losing countless hairs in the process. Then, I take my eyes off you for one second and you've nabbed Aisia and brought her home!"

940
01:12:01,000 --> 01:12:03,000
Rebecca: "Leon! You nabbed Aisia?!"

941
01:12:03,000 --> 01:12:04,000
Leon: "Of course not!"

942
01:12:04,000 --> 01:12:13,000
Cullen: "Then, I'm gone again for just the teeniest bit of time, and I come back to another one! It's like a full-blown harem in here!"

943
01:12:13,000 --> 01:12:14,000
Leon: "It is not!"

944
01:12:14,000 --> 01:12:19,000
Cullen: "Come on, admit it. Deep down, you just can't get enough of them."

945
01:12:19,000 --> 01:12:26,000
Leon: "It's not like that with Rebecca?I mean, um... Augh, would you please listen to what I'm trying to say!"

946
01:12:26,000 --> 01:12:29,000
Cullen: "Aaah, Leon, you're breaking my heart, man."

947
01:12:29,000 --> 01:12:43,000
Cullen: "You do realize that I'm the one who has to turn those proposals down every time, right? I have to look them in the eye and be like, 'I'm sorry, there are things he cherishes, and those have to come first.'"

948
01:12:43,000 --> 01:12:57,000
Cullen: "Then, I come here expecting a little appreciation for all the hard work I do, and what do I see? More girls! You're bringing them in yourself! Like, what? Is this a thing now? Let me in on the action, too!"

949
01:12:57,000 --> 01:13:05,000
Leon: "Okay, fine! I get it! You're free for the rest of the day, right? Go ahead and place an order. It's on the house."

950
01:13:05,000 --> 01:13:15,000
Cullen: "Ooo, you think I'll let you off the hook with free food? Hm, well, you can start by convincing my stomach. How about bringing me a beer?"

951
01:13:15,000 --> 01:13:21,000
Leon: "All right, hold on. Let me go get one for you. I'll bring Lucia and Aisia later, too."

952
01:13:21,000 --> 01:13:26,000
Leon: "Hm, I think I might still have some clam chowder left, as well..."

953
01:13:26,000 --> 01:13:35,000
*I check the pot still sitting on the stove to discover that plenty remains. With some nuts as an added snack, this should be enough.*

954
01:13:35,000 --> 01:13:38,000
Rebecca: "...Are you sure about this?"

955
01:13:38,000 --> 01:13:44,000
*Rebecca comes with me to the kitchen and asks me in a whisper that only I can hear.*

956
01:13:44,000 --> 01:13:52,000
*Being unfamiliar with the dynamic between me and Cullen, that must have been a difficult conversation for Rebecca to follow.*

957
01:13:52,000 --> 01:14:04,000
Leon: "Cullen's special. She's done a lot for me. And for those two, as well. She's... well, I guess she can be like that sometimes, too, but deep down, she's a good person."

958
01:14:04,000 --> 01:14:07,000
Leon: "Here. Could you bring this to her?"

959
01:14:07,000 --> 01:14:09,000
Rebecca: "You want me to?"

960
01:14:09,000 --> 01:14:16,000
Leon: "Yeah. I'm going to go get the other two. It'd be nice if you could keep her entertained in the meantime."

961
01:14:16,000 --> 01:14:20,000
Rebecca: "...All right, if you say so. Leave it to me, then."

962
01:14:20,000 --> 01:14:29,000
Leon: "Thanks. Oh, but if she tries her usual sexual harassment routine on you, just tell her to stop. I'll warn her about it, too."

963
01:14:29,000 --> 01:14:31,000
Rebecca: "Warn her? Does that work?"

964
01:14:31,000 --> 01:14:38,000
Leon: "...Maybe. That's the part I haven't totally figured out about her. Anyway, here you go. Thanks, Rebecca."

965
01:14:38,000 --> 01:14:41,000
Rebecca: "Leon asked me to bring you this."

966
01:14:41,000 --> 01:14:45,000
Cullen: "Oh, thanks. Uh, can I call you Rebecca, too?"

967
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:49,000
Rebecca: "Certainly. In that case, I'll call you Cullen, as well."

968
01:14:49,000 --> 01:14:54,000
Cullen: "Sure. Speaking of which, I guess I haven't introduced myself yet."

969
01:14:54,000 --> 01:15:03,000
Cullen: "Cullen Lancaster. I work with the vigilante corps here and do investigations. You can think of me as Leon's big sister."

970
01:15:03,000 --> 01:15:05,000
Rebecca: "I see. Big sister..."

971
01:15:05,000 --> 01:15:11,000
Cullen: "Like I was saying before, I've known Leon and Lucia since they were just this tall."

972
01:15:11,000 --> 01:15:15,000
Cullen: "I... don't get to spend a lot of time with them, though."

973
01:15:15,000 --> 01:15:20,000
Rebecca: "Leon told me, you know? That deep down, you're a good person."

974
01:15:20,000 --> 01:15:24,000
Cullen: "...Aaaah, he doesn't have to be so blunt about it~"

975
01:15:24,000 --> 01:15:30,000
Cullen: "By the way, Rebecca, maybe I'm remembering wrong, but... have we met before?"

976
01:15:30,000 --> 01:15:33,000
Rebecca: "...No, I don't believe we have."

977
01:15:33,000 --> 01:15:39,000
Cullen: "I see. Sorry. I have a feeling I've seen you before... but I guess it's just me."

978
01:15:39,000 --> 01:15:43,000
Cullen: "So, let's hear it. How'd your love story begin?"

979
01:15:43,000 --> 01:15:44,000
Rebecca: "Love story?"

980
01:15:44,000 --> 01:15:52,000
Cullen: "Yeah. You've got a thing for Leon, too, right? I can see it in your eyes. You have the same look as Aisia and Lucia."

981
01:15:52,000 --> 01:15:54,000
Rebecca: "...Is it that obvious?"

982
01:15:54,000 --> 01:16:03,000
Cullen: "I've got a good eye for these things. You didn't deny it, though, which means... This IS a damn harem. Oh, Leon, you little..."

983
01:16:03,000 --> 01:16:10,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, that's true. My time will be up tomorrow, though. The trial will be done after that."

984
01:16:10,000 --> 01:16:14,000
Cullen: "Trial? What do you mean by your time will be up tomorrow?"

985
01:16:14,000 --> 01:16:15,000
Rebecca: "Well..."

986
01:16:15,000 --> 01:16:20,000
*I come back to the front of the store only to find Rebecca at a loss for words.*

987
01:16:20,000 --> 01:16:23,000
*Lucia walks ahead, her steps small and light.*

988
01:16:23,000 --> 01:16:26,000
Lucia: "Now, now, stop causing trouble for Rebecca."

989
01:16:26,000 --> 01:16:30,000
Aisia: "That's right! Rebecca is a very kind and gentle person!"

990
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
Leon: "Sorry. Both of them were taking a bath, so it took a while. Was Cullen being a nuisance?"

991
01:16:36,000 --> 01:16:42,000
Cullen: "We were just chatting! Geez, what does it take to earn some trust from you, Leon?"

992
01:16:42,000 --> 01:16:44,000
Leon: "I do trust you..."

993
01:16:44,000 --> 01:16:49,000
*To be a nuisance, anyway. You're equal parts trustworthy and annoying.*

994
01:16:49,000 --> 01:16:52,000
Leon: "Was she really not bothering you?"

995
01:16:52,000 --> 01:16:57,000
Rebecca: "No, I'm quite fine. In fact, I do think Cullen is a wonderful person."

996
01:16:57,000 --> 01:16:59,000
Leon: "...That's a relief to hear."

997
01:16:59,000 --> 01:17:08,000
*The mirth in the store proves more resilient than usual. Amidst an air of laughter and good cheer, the five of us chat the night away.*

998
01:17:08,000 --> 01:17:12,000
*It is a good time that we have?the very best kind of time.*

999
01:17:12,000 --> 01:17:16,000
*And before we know it, the trial has reached its final day.*

1000
01:17:16,000 --> 01:17:20,000
Aisia: "Okay! I have finished the preparations for today!"

1001
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:22,000
Lucia: "Leon, you got a minute?"

1002
01:17:22,000 --> 01:17:30,000
*As I finish preparing the deliveries with Aisia, Lucia, who was checking the destinations in advance, approaches me.*

1003
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:33,000
Leon: "What's the matter? Is something wrong?"

1004
01:17:33,000 --> 01:17:38,000
Lucia: "About today's deliveries, um... Why don't you go do them with Rebecca?"

1005
01:17:38,000 --> 01:17:45,000
Aisia: "Lucia and I talked it over and we decided that it would be best to leave it up to you, Leon."

1006
01:17:45,000 --> 01:17:48,000
Leon: "...Yeah. Okay, I'll go talk to her about it."

1007
01:17:48,000 --> 01:17:49,000
Lucia: "Please."

1008
01:17:49,000 --> 01:17:54,000
*She hands me the list of destinations. None of them are out of the ordinary.*

1009
01:17:54,000 --> 01:18:00,000
Lucia: "If that's what you want, Leon, then go for it. Just know that I support you."

1010
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:07,000
Aisia: "M-Me, too! Plus, Rebecca's smile isn't the same today. Seeing it doesn't make me happy..."

1011
01:18:07,000 --> 01:18:11,000
Lucia: "That's definitely a problem... and we need to solve it..."

1012
01:18:11,000 --> 01:18:12,000
Lucia: "And, um, I..."

1013
01:18:12,000 --> 01:18:13,000
Leon: "Lucia?"

1014
01:18:13,000 --> 01:18:19,000
Lucia: "I still think it'd be nice if this place got livelier. That hasn't changed."

1015
01:18:19,000 --> 01:18:24,000
Leon: "...Thanks. Okay, I'm heading out with Rebecca for a bit, then."

1016
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:26,000
Lucia: "Okay. Take care."

1017
01:18:26,000 --> 01:18:30,000
*I look around for Rebecca and spot her in the backyard.*

1018
01:18:30,000 --> 01:18:32,000
Rebecca: "Is something the matter?"

1019
01:18:32,000 --> 01:18:37,000
Leon: "Sorry for the sudden request, but could you come with me for deliveries?"

1020
01:18:37,000 --> 01:18:42,000
Rebecca: "I certainly don't mind, but wasn't today supposed to be Lucia's turn?"

1021
01:18:42,000 --> 01:18:49,000
*...Damn it, we did not think this through. We completely forgot to come up with an excuse for that.*

1022
01:18:49,000 --> 01:18:55,000
Leon: "Uh... Oh, right! She said something came up all of a sudden and she can't go."

1023
01:18:55,000 --> 01:18:58,000
Rebecca: "I see... Could you wait for a moment?"

1024
01:18:58,000 --> 01:19:02,000
Leon: "Sure. Was there something you were going to do?"

1025
01:19:02,000 --> 01:19:06,000
Rebecca: "I had intended to do some work around the garden..."

1026
01:19:06,000 --> 01:19:10,000
Leon: "...Do you think you can do it after we get back?"

1027
01:19:10,000 --> 01:19:12,000
Rebecca: "...Are we in a rush?"

1028
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:19,000
Leon: "They're lunchboxes, after all. You don't want to keep a bunch of hungry people waiting. They get upset."

1029
01:19:19,000 --> 01:19:22,000
Rebecca: "That does indeed sound terrible."

1030
01:19:22,000 --> 01:19:24,000
Leon: "It definitely is."

1031
01:19:24,000 --> 01:19:28,000
Rebecca: "All right. I'll tend to the garden later, then."

1032
01:19:28,000 --> 01:19:31,000
Leon: "Aisia's getting the hang of it, too."

1033
01:19:31,000 --> 01:19:36,000
Rebecca: "...Aisia certainly does learn at a surprisingly fast rate."

1034
01:19:36,000 --> 01:19:37,000
Leon: "Ah..."

1035
01:19:37,000 --> 01:19:39,000
Rebecca: "What's wrong, Leon?"

1036
01:19:39,000 --> 01:19:43,000
Leon: "N-Nothing much... It can wait until after deliveries."

1037
01:19:43,000 --> 01:19:49,000
*...That reminds me. I haven't given her any explanation regarding the thing with Aisia.*

1038
01:19:49,000 --> 01:19:54,000
*I've become so used to it that I completely forgot how much of a concern it is.*

1039
01:19:54,000 --> 01:19:59,000
*However, everything has to wait until after we convince Rebecca to stay.*

1040
01:19:59,000 --> 01:20:03,000
Radio DJ: "AL Diner in 2635 Zamond Region is currently hiring~"

1041
01:20:03,000 --> 01:20:05,000
Rebecca: "...What was that just now?"

1042
01:20:05,000 --> 01:20:18,000
Leon: "Oh, that's our help-wanted ad. They do it for us in exchange for food. We're technically still hiring right now, but I've never actually had someone come because they heard the radio ad."

1043
01:20:18,000 --> 01:20:25,000
Leon: "Originally, it was just Lucia and I running the place, and then we picked up Aisia right around there."

1044
01:20:25,000 --> 01:20:27,000
Rebecca: "Right around where?"

1045
01:20:27,000 --> 01:20:31,000
Leon: "Hm... I'm pretty sure it was right about here."

1046
01:20:31,000 --> 01:20:34,000
Rebecca: "...In the middle of nowhere?"

1047
01:20:34,000 --> 01:20:41,000
Leon: "Yeah, in the middle of nowhere, Lucia said she saw a bright, red flower blooming. That was Aisia."

1048
01:20:41,000 --> 01:20:44,000
Rebecca: "Aisia's actually a flower?!"

1049
01:20:44,000 --> 01:20:47,000
Leon: "Oh, sorry. That came out wrong."

1050
01:20:47,000 --> 01:20:51,000
Rebecca: "...Oh, you didn't mean it literally. I see."

1051
01:20:51,000 --> 01:21:03,000
Leon: "Uh, basically, Aisia was sleeping on a bright, red suitcase. The weather was really sunny, so we thought she'd end up dried out like a mummy if she stayed like that..."

1052
01:21:03,000 --> 01:21:15,000
Leon: "The next thing we knew, she was a part of our family. There were, of course, some ups and downs in between... but it's a long story, so I'll tell you some other time."

1053
01:21:15,000 --> 01:21:20,000
*Aisia is a vampire. In order to survive, she needs to feed off our blood.*

1054
01:21:20,000 --> 01:21:23,000
*...Not exactly the easiest story to believe.*

1055
01:21:23,000 --> 01:21:26,000
Rebecca: "Some other time, you say..."

1056
01:21:26,000 --> 01:21:31,000
Leon: "Yeah. It's a long story. The kind you can spend a whole night telling."

1057
01:21:31,000 --> 01:21:35,000
Leon: "It gets pretty crazy, though. You think you can handle it?"

1058
01:21:35,000 --> 01:21:38,000
Rebecca: "I... would certainly like to find out."

1059
01:21:38,000 --> 01:21:40,000
Leon: "Look forward to it, then."

1060
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:44,000
Leon: "Okay, that's all the deliveries for today. Thanks, Rebecca."

1061
01:21:44,000 --> 01:21:46,000
Rebecca: "All I did was tag along."

1062
01:21:46,000 --> 01:21:49,000
Leon: "That's helpful enough. Right, Momo?"

1063
01:21:49,000 --> 01:21:50,000
Momo: "Woof!"

1064
01:21:50,000 --> 01:21:52,000
Leon: "See? Momo agrees."

1065
01:21:52,000 --> 01:21:54,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, do you now, Momo?"

1066
01:21:54,000 --> 01:21:58,000
*Momo wags her tail back and forth as she watches us talk.*

1067
01:21:58,000 --> 01:22:02,000
Leon: "Come on, Rebecca. Give her a pat. She wants to be patted."

1068
01:22:02,000 --> 01:22:06,000
Rebecca: "...You're really in tune with animals, aren't you, Leon?"

1069
01:22:06,000 --> 01:22:14,000
Leon: "You're just an easy one to read, Momo. You only wag your tail like this when you want Rebecca to pat you, right?"

1070
01:22:14,000 --> 01:22:15,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

1071
01:22:15,000 --> 01:22:16,000
Leon: "See?"

1072
01:22:16,000 --> 01:22:17,000
Rebecca: "I see..."

1073
01:22:17,000 --> 01:22:20,000
Aisia: "Hey, the two of them are back already!"

1074
01:22:20,000 --> 01:22:23,000
Lucia: "Welcome back, Leon and Rebecca."

1075
01:22:23,000 --> 01:22:25,000
Leon: "Yeah, we're back."

1076
01:22:25,000 --> 01:22:27,000
Rebecca: "...Yes, we are."

1077
01:22:27,000 --> 01:22:29,000
Lucia: "So, what did she say?"

1078
01:22:29,000 --> 01:22:32,000
Leon: "Actually, I haven't asked her yet."

1079
01:22:32,000 --> 01:22:33,000
Aisia: "Why not?"

1080
01:22:33,000 --> 01:22:40,000
Leon: "Well, officially, Rebecca came here as a potential marriage candidate. If I asked her to stay, then..."

1081
01:22:40,000 --> 01:22:43,000
Lucia: "...Right. I see where you're going."

1082
01:22:43,000 --> 01:22:51,000
Leon: "Ideally, we'd have her people retract their proposal for the time being, and then ask her to stay, but..."

1083
01:22:51,000 --> 01:22:56,000
*The people who send me proposals all have a lot of power and influence.*

1084
01:22:56,000 --> 01:23:04,000
*In fact, it's nothing short of a miracle that Rebecca's parents haven't said anything about this whole affair yet.*

1085
01:23:04,000 --> 01:23:08,000
Lucia: "Yeah, you can't just expect them to do that."

1086
01:23:08,000 --> 01:23:12,000
*Either way, most of the burden will fall on Rebecca.*

1087
01:23:12,000 --> 01:23:19,000
*I shouldn't put what I want first and then force her to endure the fallout that comes from that.*

1088
01:23:19,000 --> 01:23:22,000
Aisia: "This is a difficult problem..."

1089
01:23:22,000 --> 01:23:27,000
Leon: "Today's our last chance, though. We need to give her some sort of answer."

1090
01:23:27,000 --> 01:23:30,000
Rebecca: "I'm finished tending to the garden."

1091
01:23:30,000 --> 01:23:31,000
Leon: "Thanks."

1092
01:23:31,000 --> 01:23:37,000
Aisia: "Thank you very much. Please tell me about what you did in the garden later!"

1093
01:23:37,000 --> 01:23:38,000
Leon: "...Lucia?"

1094
01:23:38,000 --> 01:23:40,000
Lucia: "Oh, um... Thanks, Rebecca."

1095
01:23:40,000 --> 01:23:45,000
*Her steps smaller and lighter than usual, Lucia shuffles over to Rebecca.*

1096
01:23:45,000 --> 01:23:48,000
*With her arms extended, Lucia leans in.*

1097
01:23:48,000 --> 01:23:50,000
*Rebecca gently returns her embrace.*

1098
01:23:50,000 --> 01:23:57,000
Rebecca: "...What's the matter, Lucia? It's not every day I get to see you taking the initiative in a hug."

1099
01:23:57,000 --> 01:24:00,000
Lucia: "...I just felt like doing it."

1100
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:05,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, how wonderful. In that case, let me give you a nice, big hug."

1101
01:24:05,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Lucia: "Mmhm."

1102
01:24:06,000 --> 01:24:07,000
Rebecca: "Lucia...?"

1103
01:24:07,000 --> 01:24:10,000
*Just when Rebecca is about to pat Lucia's head...*

1104
01:24:10,000 --> 01:24:12,000
Momo: "Woof! Woof, woof!"

1105
01:24:12,000 --> 01:24:16,000
*I hear a pair of foreign voices coming from outside.*

1106
01:24:16,000 --> 01:24:18,000
Lucia: "Huh? Wh-What's..."

1107
01:24:18,000 --> 01:24:20,000
Leon: "Momo, what's going on?!"

1108
01:24:20,000 --> 01:24:24,000
???: "Aaah, simmer down, damn it! Shush! You sure this store's it?"

1109
01:24:24,000 --> 01:24:34,000
???: "Word from the Market's that he works at this store. Judging from the look of this place, we can probably get away with causing a ruckus or two."

1110
01:24:34,000 --> 01:24:42,000
???: "Coming in, people... Whoa, we did it, partner! The kid's really here! We got ourselves a male of the species!"

1111
01:24:42,000 --> 01:24:45,000
???: "Finally. Kid, we were meant to meet here!"

1112
01:24:45,000 --> 01:24:46,000
Lucia: "...!"

1113
01:24:46,000 --> 01:24:51,000
*Out of the corner of my eye, I see Lucia cling tightly to Rebecca.*

1114
01:24:51,000 --> 01:24:54,000
*It's a good thing Rebecca's with her.*

1115
01:24:54,000 --> 01:25:01,000
*Even a gust of wind is enough to scare Lucia. She's probably paralyzed with fear in this situation.*

1116
01:25:01,000 --> 01:25:05,000
Leon: "(Who are they...? Robbers? Or... kidnappers?)"

1117
01:25:05,000 --> 01:25:10,000
*I can't be certain, but I can be sure of one thing?they're not normal customers.*

1118
01:25:10,000 --> 01:25:14,000
Leon: "(We have a problem here... What should I do?)"

1119
01:25:14,000 --> 01:25:22,000
*Under these circumstances, either Aisia or I have to do something... but I can't let Aisia put herself in danger.*

1120
01:25:22,000 --> 01:25:27,000
*I stand my ground while pushing Aisia behind me into the cover of furniture.*

1121
01:25:27,000 --> 01:25:31,000
*There's no time to notify Cullen's vigilante corps.*

1122
01:25:31,000 --> 01:25:37,000
*The only way for us to get in touch with them is if Cullen drops by today again...*

1123
01:25:37,000 --> 01:25:41,000
*Even then, it's still too early for Cullen to be showing up.*

1124
01:25:41,000 --> 01:25:46,000
*In any case, I need to buy time while looking for a way out of this situation.*

1125
01:25:46,000 --> 01:25:52,000
*Slowly, I begin to talk, the act bringing to my attention how parched my lips have become.*

1126
01:25:52,000 --> 01:25:57,000
Leon: "A pair of black suits at this hour... You don't look like customers to me."

1127
01:25:57,000 --> 01:26:04,000
???: "Hah, we've got a sharp one here. Listen up, young man. I'm Sandy. And this one here's my partner, Puppy."

1128
01:26:04,000 --> 01:26:08,000
Sandy: "Not that there's any point to remembering our names."

1129
01:26:08,000 --> 01:26:13,000
Puppy: "After all, we're gonna be nabbing you right here, right now."

1130
01:26:13,000 --> 01:26:14,000
Lucia: "Kyaaaaa!"

1131
01:26:14,000 --> 01:26:19,000
*Lucia trembles violently from the unfamiliar sight of a weapon being brandished.*

1132
01:26:19,000 --> 01:26:21,000
Puppy: "What do we do with the rest?"

1133
01:26:21,000 --> 01:26:27,000
Sandy: "Don't bother with'em. Just bring the young man back with us and our job'll be done."

1134
01:26:27,000 --> 01:26:32,000
Leon: "I'm the one you're after, right? What are you going to do with the others?"

1135
01:26:32,000 --> 01:26:38,000
Sandy: "As long as they keep their hands to themselves, we won't touch'em. Right, partner?"

1136
01:26:38,000 --> 01:26:42,000
Puppy: "Yeah, of course! Cross my heart and hope to die!"

1137
01:26:42,000 --> 01:26:46,000
Sandy: "And there you go. I trust you know what's best for you?"

1138
01:26:46,000 --> 01:26:49,000
Leon: "...What's going to happen to me?"

1139
01:26:49,000 --> 01:26:58,000
Sandy: "Very Important People at the Market have been looking for males of the species recently. Word is they'll be treating you real nicely."

1140
01:26:58,000 --> 01:27:02,000
Puppy: "Who knows? Maybe they'll treat you like a prince!"

1141
01:27:02,000 --> 01:27:07,000
*With no choice but to do as they say, a sense of helpless frustration sets in.*

1142
01:27:07,000 --> 01:27:10,000
Rebecca: "...Lucia, Aisia, Leon, I'm sorry."

1143
01:27:10,000 --> 01:27:12,000
Lucia: "...Rebecca? Aah!"

1144
01:27:12,000 --> 01:27:14,000
Rebecca: "Stop this, please."

1145
01:27:14,000 --> 01:27:20,000
*Without a hint of fear, Rebecca pushes Lucia further away and steps in front of me.*

1146
01:27:20,000 --> 01:27:21,000
Leon: "...Rebecca?"

1147
01:27:21,000 --> 01:27:29,000
Sandy: "...You deaf or something? Didn't I just say to keep your hands to yourself? Are you looking for trouble?"

1148
01:27:29,000 --> 01:27:34,000
Rebecca: "I most definitely will not allow you to hurt the people I cherish."

1149
01:27:34,000 --> 01:27:40,000
Rebecca: "This place has become my precious home, as well... though I'm not deserving of it."

1150
01:27:40,000 --> 01:27:41,000
Leon: "Rebecca?"

1151
01:27:41,000 --> 01:27:48,000
Puppy: "Stupid people, always wasting our time... Whoa! Partner! This one's got some tricks up her sleeve!"

1152
01:27:48,000 --> 01:27:55,000
*Trying to get Rebecca out of the way, the black suit named Puppy grabs her arm and gives it a sharp tug.*

1153
01:27:55,000 --> 01:28:02,000
Sandy: "Make her move already! I'd rather not shoot. I might hit our merchandise and lower its value."

1154
01:28:02,000 --> 01:28:07,000
Puppy: "Yeah, yeah, our clients sure are picky! All right, heave-ho!"

1155
01:28:07,000 --> 01:28:14,000
*Puppy, who was pulling on Rebecca's arm the moment before, suddenly falls backward onto the ground.*

1156
01:28:14,000 --> 01:28:17,000
Puppy: "There! Finally got you to move!"

1157
01:28:17,000 --> 01:28:20,000
Sandy: "H-Hey... What the... What is that?"

1158
01:28:20,000 --> 01:28:25,000
Puppy: "Eh? Didn't I just pull her down with me... Waaaaaaaaaaaaaah!"

1159
01:28:25,000 --> 01:28:28,000
*Puppy frantically throws her arms up in the air.*

1160
01:28:28,000 --> 01:28:31,000
*After a short pause, a dull sound is heard.*

1161
01:28:31,000 --> 01:28:34,000
*Rebecca's right hand lands on the ground.*

1162
01:28:34,000 --> 01:28:35,000
Lucia: "Eee..."

1163
01:28:35,000 --> 01:28:39,000
*The color instantly drains from Lucia's face as she falls over.*

1164
01:28:39,000 --> 01:28:47,000
Sandy: "Whoawhoawhoa, nobody told us we'd find freaks like this! Hey, how long are you gonna sit around for? We gotta scram!"

1165
01:28:47,000 --> 01:28:54,000
Puppy: "H-Hey! Wait for me! What is this? This has to be a dream! Tell me this is just a bad dream!"

1166
01:28:54,000 --> 01:28:57,000
*The two black suits scamper out of the store.*

1167
01:28:57,000 --> 01:29:00,000
Rebecca: "Lucia certainly didn't appreciate that."

1168
01:29:00,000 --> 01:29:01,000
Leon: "...Rebecca?"

1169
01:29:01,000 --> 01:29:06,000
Aisia: "W-W-Waaaah, R-Rebecca! Your right hand! I-Is... your right hand okay?!"

1170
01:29:06,000 --> 01:29:10,000
Rebecca: "I... had intended to leave without telling you."

1171
01:29:10,000 --> 01:29:15,000
*Her right hand still conspicuously absent, Rebecca takes a few steps forward.*

1172
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:20,000
*With her left hand, she reaches for the severed appendage on the ground.*

1173
01:29:20,000 --> 01:29:22,000
Rebecca: "There we go."

1174
01:29:22,000 --> 01:29:25,000
*She casually pops her right hand back into place.*

1175
01:29:25,000 --> 01:29:28,000
Rebecca: "See? It's good as new again."

1176
01:29:28,000 --> 01:29:33,000
*Rebecca closes her right hand, opens it, and then spins it around.*

1177
01:29:33,000 --> 01:29:39,000
*At a glance, there is nothing to suggest that it was in two pieces just moments before.*

1178
01:29:39,000 --> 01:29:45,000
*On closer examination, there does seem to be a faint slit in a place that is not the joint.*

1179
01:29:45,000 --> 01:29:49,000
*One would need to be looking for it to see it, though.*

1180
01:29:49,000 --> 01:29:52,000
Leon: "...I guess that wasn't a magic trick?"

1181
01:29:52,000 --> 01:29:56,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, I'd be a very popular magician if that was..."

1182
01:29:56,000 --> 01:30:00,000
Rebecca: "May I wait until Lucia wakes up before explaining?"

1183
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:02,000
Leon: "But you will explain, right?"

1184
01:30:02,000 --> 01:30:07,000
Rebecca: "...I may have just dragged you into all of this, after all."

1185
01:30:07,000 --> 01:30:10,000
Leon: "I thought that was supposed to be my line."

1186
01:30:10,000 --> 01:30:15,000
*...If they didn't come after me, Rebecca wouldn't have needed to step forward.*

1187
01:30:15,000 --> 01:30:19,000
*There's no point going over all the what-ifs, though.*

1188
01:30:19,000 --> 01:30:24,000
*Right now, my first priority is to think about what I need to do next.*

1189
01:30:24,000 --> 01:30:27,000
Leon: "Aisia, can you take care of Lucia for me?"

1190
01:30:27,000 --> 01:30:29,000
Aisia: "Yes! You can count on me!"

1191
01:30:29,000 --> 01:30:36,000
Leon: "I'm going to go notify Cullen. I'll ask the vigilante corps to come and track down those two creeps."

1192
01:30:36,000 --> 01:30:39,000
Leon: "And... can I tell Cullen about you, Rebecca?"

1193
01:30:39,000 --> 01:30:44,000
Rebecca: "Yes. If you trust her to be a good person, then so will I."

1194
01:30:44,000 --> 01:30:45,000
Leon: "...Thanks."

1195
01:30:45,000 --> 01:30:47,000
Lucia: "Mmm... Huh? Where am I?"

1196
01:30:47,000 --> 01:30:50,000
Aisia: "Lucia! I'm so glad! I'm so glad!"

1197
01:30:50,000 --> 01:30:51,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

1198
01:30:51,000 --> 01:30:55,000
Leon: "How do you feel? Does your head hurt or anything?"

1199
01:30:55,000 --> 01:30:57,000
Lucia: "No, not really..."

1200
01:30:57,000 --> 01:30:59,000
Aisia: "You're okay! What a relief!"

1201
01:30:59,000 --> 01:31:02,000
Lucia: "Wha?Is that it? The hug is done?"

1202
01:31:02,000 --> 01:31:07,000
Lucia: "If you're going to hug me, then... Wait, Rebecca! Is Rebecca okay?!"

1203
01:31:07,000 --> 01:31:09,000
Rebecca: "Yes, I'm quite fine."

1204
01:31:09,000 --> 01:31:18,000
Lucia: "Phew. You're okay. Huh? What about... Oh, I see. Haha. It was just a dream. For a minute there, I thought your right hand..."

1205
01:31:18,000 --> 01:31:23,000
Rebecca: "...It's true that my hand came off earlier. That was not a dream."

1206
01:31:23,000 --> 01:31:26,000
Lucia: "Came off? ...Wh-What are you talking about?"

1207
01:31:26,000 --> 01:31:32,000
Leon: "She's going to explain that for us right now. She wanted to wait until you woke up."

1208
01:31:32,000 --> 01:31:34,000
Leon: "So, Rebecca, shall we begin?"

1209
01:31:34,000 --> 01:31:37,000
Rebecca: "Yes. First, let me make one thing clear."

1210
01:31:37,000 --> 01:31:40,000
*Rebecca pauses and takes a deep breath.*

1211
01:31:40,000 --> 01:31:42,000
*Then, she looks us in the eyes.*

1212
01:31:42,000 --> 01:31:44,000
Rebecca: "I... am a zombie."

1213
01:31:44,000 --> 01:31:45,000
Leon: "A... zombie?"

1214
01:31:45,000 --> 01:31:52,000
*After seeing her perform live hand-reattachment surgery, I was braced for some kind of outlandish answer.*

1215
01:31:52,000 --> 01:31:54,000
*Still... I didn't see this coming.*

1216
01:31:54,000 --> 01:31:57,000
Aisia: "By zombie, do you mean THOSE zombies?"

1217
01:31:57,000 --> 01:32:05,000
Rebecca: "Yes, the same zombies you hear about all the time. Although, I might be better referred to as the living dead."

1218
01:32:05,000 --> 01:32:13,000
*The nod and smile she gives us can't be further from the image we have of those zombies we hear about all the time.*

1219
01:32:13,000 --> 01:32:17,000
Rebecca: "My body is almost all dead... but I'm still moving."

1220
01:32:17,000 --> 01:32:20,000
Leon: "...How did you end up like that?"

1221
01:32:20,000 --> 01:32:30,000
Rebecca: "I used to live in a fairly large house and was brought up as one of the upper class, receiving a wide variety of education along the way."

1222
01:32:30,000 --> 01:32:38,000
*The result of that is the multi-talented Rebecca we see today, capable of everything from house chores to needlework.*

1223
01:32:38,000 --> 01:32:46,000
Rebecca: "However, I was born with some sort of disease... and spent my days trying one treatment after another."

1224
01:32:46,000 --> 01:32:47,000
Aisia: "A disease..."

1225
01:32:47,000 --> 01:32:57,000
Rebecca: "It took quite the liking to me, that disease. I'd do my homework on a hospital bed, and then be told I was being moved to another hospital..."

1226
01:32:57,000 --> 01:33:05,000
Rebecca: "My father was rich, so he tried some of the more expensive treatments, too. Expensive and questionable."

1227
01:33:05,000 --> 01:33:11,000
*However, a cure was not found. None of the treatments had a lasting effect on her disease.*

1228
01:33:11,000 --> 01:33:15,000
Rebecca: "Even I figured I was done for. I was about to give up."

1229
01:33:15,000 --> 01:33:19,000
Rebecca: "That's when I decided to give that proposal a try."

1230
01:33:19,000 --> 01:33:23,000
*Her family business revolved around a biotech research facility.*

1231
01:33:23,000 --> 01:33:28,000
*Some professor associated with their work came up with a certain proposal.*

1232
01:33:28,000 --> 01:33:33,000
Rebecca: "The professor proposed to supplement my life force with that of plants."

1233
01:33:33,000 --> 01:33:35,000
Lucia: "...What do you mean?"

1234
01:33:35,000 --> 01:33:42,000
Rebecca: "I wanted to ask the same thing. I thought I might be getting involved in something scary."

1235
01:33:42,000 --> 01:33:47,000
*However, in the end, no other method of saving Rebecca presented itself.*

1236
01:33:47,000 --> 01:33:52,000
Rebecca: "My father must have been grasping at straws at that point..."

1237
01:33:52,000 --> 01:33:55,000
*So, the professor conducted the operation.*

1238
01:33:55,000 --> 01:33:58,000
Rebecca: "As theorized, my body became healthy."

1239
01:33:58,000 --> 01:34:04,000
Rebecca: "When I ate a meal, it tasted good, and when someone hugged me, it felt warm."

1240
01:34:04,000 --> 01:34:12,000
Rebecca: "At first, everyone including my father was ecstatic. 'Finally', they thought, 'she can lead a normal life.'"

1241
01:34:12,000 --> 01:34:13,000
Rebecca: "However..."

1242
01:34:13,000 --> 01:34:16,000
*Not everything ended like a fairy tale.*

1243
01:34:16,000 --> 01:34:20,000
Rebecca: "It came off. In front of people. Over and over."

1244
01:34:20,000 --> 01:34:21,000
Leon: "..."

1245
01:34:21,000 --> 01:34:25,000
*It's not hard to imagine the chaos that must have caused.*

1246
01:34:25,000 --> 01:34:29,000
*Especially considering Rebecca comes from a prestigious family.*

1247
01:34:29,000 --> 01:34:38,000
Rebecca: "I had many accidents at home, as well. And each time it happened, I could see the look in my father's eyes growing colder."

1248
01:34:38,000 --> 01:34:43,000
Leon: "But... wasn't your father the one who chose to go through with it?"

1249
01:34:43,000 --> 01:34:50,000
Rebecca: "My father did not grow cold because he wanted to. It was probably too much of a shock for him."

1250
01:34:50,000 --> 01:34:54,000
*Indeed, I can't even imagine what that must have been like.*

1251
01:34:54,000 --> 01:35:01,000
*One day, all of a sudden, his daughter turned into a zombie. And it was because of a decision he made.*

1252
01:35:01,000 --> 01:35:06,000
*I guess I can't blame him for becoming less and less willing to face reality.*

1253
01:35:06,000 --> 01:35:12,000
Rebecca: "Seeing that I was only going to cause more suffering, I ran away from home."

1254
01:35:12,000 --> 01:35:15,000
*She had no regrets... or so she thought.*

1255
01:35:15,000 --> 01:35:24,000
Rebecca: "That's when I remembered something. During my younger years, I was supposed to meet someone to discuss a potential marriage."

1256
01:35:24,000 --> 01:35:27,000
Leon: "That someone... was me, I guess."

1257
01:35:27,000 --> 01:35:30,000
Rebecca: "What a wonderful guess! That's correct."

1258
01:35:30,000 --> 01:35:36,000
Rebecca: "However, it was so long ago that I had no idea what kind of person you'd be, Leon."

1259
01:35:36,000 --> 01:35:43,000
Rebecca: "I imagined all sorts of possibilities. Maybe you'd be dashing... or maybe you'd be cruel."

1260
01:35:43,000 --> 01:35:47,000
*So, she came here to find out. All the way here. All by herself.*

1261
01:35:47,000 --> 01:36:03,000
Rebecca: "But as it turns out, the real Leon is caring, good at cooking, and cherishes everyone around him... Even when I showed up at his door as a complete stranger, he didn't brush me off, but genuinely listened to what I had to say."

1262
01:36:03,000 --> 01:36:12,000
Rebecca: "Seeing that, I made up my mind. 'He is a wonderful person', I thought, 'and I mustn't take advantage of his kindness.'"

1263
01:36:12,000 --> 01:36:16,000
Leon: "And... that's why you brought up the one-week limit?"

1264
01:36:16,000 --> 01:36:24,000
Rebecca: "Just one last time in my life, I wanted to spoil myself a little. A week should be plenty for that, no?"

1265
01:36:24,000 --> 01:36:25,000
Leon: "That's..."

1266
01:36:25,000 --> 01:36:29,000
*My sentence is cut short by the pain of hearing Rebecca's words.*

1267
01:36:29,000 --> 01:36:35,000
*I can't imagine how heavy her burden must have been when she first stepped through those doors,*

1268
01:36:35,000 --> 01:36:43,000
*nor can I imagine how profound her kindness must have been when she resolved to keep the truth to herself until the very end.*

1269
01:36:43,000 --> 01:36:47,000
Lucia: "Rebecca... What were you planning to do after you left?"

1270
01:36:47,000 --> 01:36:57,000
Rebecca: "...Nothing in particular. I hadn't given it any thought. After all, I'm stuck with this undying body, so I have plenty of time to think."

1271
01:36:57,000 --> 01:37:02,000
Lucia: "Well, if you have nowhere to go... In that case, why not stay here?"

1272
01:37:02,000 --> 01:37:03,000
Rebecca: "Lucia...?"

1273
01:37:03,000 --> 01:37:09,000
Lucia: "We just barely have enough rooms still, and it must be better than being on your own."

1274
01:37:09,000 --> 01:37:12,000
Rebecca: "...Thank you, Lucia, but I can't."

1275
01:37:12,000 --> 01:37:15,000
Rebecca: "I mean, look at me. I'm a..."

1276
01:37:15,000 --> 01:37:17,000
*I don't let her finish her thought.*

1277
01:37:17,000 --> 01:37:20,000
Leon: "Hmm, if we're on that topic, though..."

1278
01:37:20,000 --> 01:37:24,000
Lucia: "Yeah... Aisia's not exactly the same as us, either..."

1279
01:37:24,000 --> 01:37:26,000
Rebecca: "What... do you mean?"

1280
01:37:26,000 --> 01:37:29,000
*Rebecca looks at us with a puzzled expression.*

1281
01:37:29,000 --> 01:37:36,000
Lucia: "...Hey, Leon, this might have been a whole lot easier for Rebecca if you told her about Aisia earlier."

1282
01:37:36,000 --> 01:37:42,000
Leon: "Yeah, but it's not like I can just blab about it to everyone I meet... Right, Aisia?"

1283
01:37:42,000 --> 01:37:48,000
Aisia: "Of course. When it comes to that, even I'm careful about who and what I tell."

1284
01:37:48,000 --> 01:37:51,000
Aisia: "U-Um, Rebecca! I'm a vampire!"

1285
01:37:51,000 --> 01:37:53,000
Rebecca: "I-I see... Wait, what?"

1286
01:37:53,000 --> 01:38:00,000
Aisia: "A vampire! You know, like those people that go graaargh with their teeth and shuuuuu with your blood!"

1287
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:04,000
Rebecca: "...Leon, is this Aisia trying to comfort me?"

1288
01:38:04,000 --> 01:38:08,000
Leon: "Nah, she's actually being serious. Aisia's a vampire."

1289
01:38:08,000 --> 01:38:14,000
Aisia: "Ehehe, I haven't sucked any blood recently, so I ended up eating a lot of food."

1290
01:38:14,000 --> 01:38:19,000
Leon: "I was wondering why our breakfast seemed to disappear so quickly lately..."

1291
01:38:19,000 --> 01:38:25,000
Lucia: "Didn't we tell you to come to either me or Leon for some blood before that happens?"

1292
01:38:25,000 --> 01:38:27,000
Aisia: "Nnngh... I'm sorry..."

1293
01:38:27,000 --> 01:38:33,000
Rebecca: "V-Vampires? You mean... those vampires? How are you both okay with that?"

1294
01:38:33,000 --> 01:38:35,000
Lucia: "How? Well... you know."

1295
01:38:35,000 --> 01:38:38,000
Leon: "Yeah, she didn't seem like a bad person."

1296
01:38:38,000 --> 01:38:44,000
Lucia: "Although her stubborn refusal to stop eating definitely falls under the 'bad' category."

1297
01:38:44,000 --> 01:38:46,000
Aisia: "Hey! That's so mean!"

1298
01:38:46,000 --> 01:38:55,000
Leon: "Remember when we were doing deliveries and I said it's a long story? Yeah, there's another one, and it's the Aisia Runaway Incident."

1299
01:38:55,000 --> 01:38:58,000
Aisia: "Stop calling it that already~"

1300
01:38:58,000 --> 01:39:10,000
Leon: "And if we're on the topic of species, then look at me. I've got two ears, I'm male, and I'm apparently some sort of rare specimen that fetches a high price on the market."

1301
01:39:10,000 --> 01:39:19,000
*I honestly have no idea what that last point is, considering I just heard about it a minute ago, but whatever. It sounds convincing.*

1302
01:39:19,000 --> 01:39:24,000
Lucia: "...I think as the the normal person here, I might be the odd one out."

1303
01:39:24,000 --> 01:39:29,000
Lucia: "That's why... the fact that you're a zombie doesn't bother us at all."

1304
01:39:29,000 --> 01:39:37,000
Leon: "Ever since we woke up today, we've been trying every trick in the book to convince you to stay. I'm sure you noticed."

1305
01:39:37,000 --> 01:39:40,000
Rebecca: "I certainly did... but still, how can..."

1306
01:39:40,000 --> 01:39:44,000
Leon: "We already consider you family, Rebecca. That's how."

1307
01:39:44,000 --> 01:39:49,000
Lucia: "Plus, unlike Aisia, you don't need to be taught how to do house chores..."

1308
01:39:49,000 --> 01:39:55,000
Aisia: "I already learned how to do house chores! And the garden is still a work in progress."

1309
01:39:55,000 --> 01:39:56,000
Momo: "Arf, arf."

1310
01:39:56,000 --> 01:40:00,000
Leon: "Momo says she'd feel lonely if you left, too."

1311
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:09,000
Leon: "I need to ask you a favor, though. It's pretty selfish of me, but I'd really appreciate it if you could stay without being my wife."

1312
01:40:09,000 --> 01:40:15,000
Lucia: "...Or, you know, you could just hurry up and make everyone your wife already."

1313
01:40:15,000 --> 01:40:23,000
Leon: "Ahaha... you know, so far, Cullen's the only one who harasses me like that, and I'd much rather it stays that way."

1314
01:40:23,000 --> 01:40:26,000
Lucia: "I'm not harassing you! Stupid Leon!"

1315
01:40:26,000 --> 01:40:31,000
Aisia: "Leon was definitely the one at fault just now, right, Rebecca?"

1316
01:40:31,000 --> 01:40:33,000
Rebecca: "R-Right... I suppose so."

1317
01:40:33,000 --> 01:40:39,000
Aisia: "Oh, oh, Rebecca, in that case, what would you want to be other than a wife?"

1318
01:40:39,000 --> 01:40:41,000
Rebecca: "Other than a wife?"

1319
01:40:41,000 --> 01:40:45,000
Aisia: "For example, we have Daddy Leon and Mommy Lucia!"

1320
01:40:45,000 --> 01:40:47,000
Lucia: "Stop saying Mommy!"

1321
01:40:47,000 --> 01:40:48,000
Rebecca: "..."

1322
01:40:48,000 --> 01:40:55,000
*Rebecca's expression tightens, as though she is trying to keep a torrent of many emotions from bursting out.*

1323
01:40:55,000 --> 01:40:58,000
*She takes a deep breath. Then, another.*

1324
01:40:58,000 --> 01:40:59,000
*Finally...*

1325
01:40:59,000 --> 01:41:04,000
Rebecca: "...In that case, I could perhaps be everyone's big sister?"

1326
01:41:04,000 --> 01:41:09,000
*Her words are accompanied by that gentle smile we've come to know so well.*

1327
01:41:09,000 --> 01:41:13,000
*And her answer is, of course, the one we've all been waiting for.*

1328
01:41:13,000 --> 01:41:15,000
Aisia: "Yay! Rebecca's our Big Sis!"

1329
01:41:15,000 --> 01:41:17,000
Rebecca: "It's decided already?!"

1330
01:41:17,000 --> 01:41:22,000
Lucia: "Big Sis Rebecca... I might need some time to get used to this."

1331
01:41:22,000 --> 01:41:28,000
Leon: "Yeah, I think 'Big Sis' might be a little... How about we stick with Rebecca for now?"

1332
01:41:28,000 --> 01:41:35,000
Rebecca: "Oh, you... You silly little kids! Your big sister Rebecca will take good care of you all!"

1333
01:41:35,000 --> 01:41:38,000
Aisia: "Yay! It's decided! Big Sis Rebecca!"

1334
01:41:38,000 --> 01:41:41,000
*Aisia leaps toward Rebecca in a hug.*

1335
01:41:41,000 --> 01:41:43,000
*Rebecca returns the embrace.*

1336
01:41:43,000 --> 01:41:47,000
Rebecca: "Are you really sure it's okay for me to stay here?"

1337
01:41:47,000 --> 01:41:50,000
*Rebecca pulls Aisia into a tight hug.*

1338
01:41:50,000 --> 01:41:54,000
*Aisia closes her eyes in an expression of pure comfort.*

1339
01:41:54,000 --> 01:41:58,000
*Lucia watches the two of them with a gentle expression, as well.*

1340
01:41:58,000 --> 01:42:03,000
Lucia: "...If there's somewhere you want to go, though, we won't stop you."

1341
01:42:03,000 --> 01:42:07,000
Rebecca: "Absolutely not! I want nothing more than to stay?"

1342
01:42:07,000 --> 01:42:10,000
Aisia: "...B-Big Sis, I can't breathe."

1343
01:42:10,000 --> 01:42:13,000
Rebecca: "O-Oh, my, I'm so sorry, Aisia."

1344
01:42:13,000 --> 01:42:17,000
*After being released, Aisia's cheeks are slightly flushed.*

1345
01:42:17,000 --> 01:42:25,000
Aisia: "Ehehe, but it really does feel good to be hugged by Big Sis. Lucia, Leon, would you like to come for a hug, too?"

1346
01:42:25,000 --> 01:42:27,000
Lucia: "...I-If it's only for a bit."

1347
01:42:27,000 --> 01:42:29,000
Leon: "Wait, I'm clearly not?Mmfm!"

1348
01:42:29,000 --> 01:42:34,000
Rebecca: "All right, Big Sis Rebecca's going to give you all a hug."

1349
01:42:34,000 --> 01:42:37,000
Lucia: "L-Leon! Move your face! It's too close!"

1350
01:42:37,000 --> 01:42:41,000
Leon: "What do you expect me to do? This is how this works."

1351
01:42:41,000 --> 01:42:44,000
Aisia: "Now we're all a big, happy family."

1352
01:42:44,000 --> 01:42:46,000
Rebecca: "Yes... Yes we are."

1353
01:42:46,000 --> 01:42:54,000
*When Cullen and the vigilante corps finally show up, they find us still tightly enveloped by Rebecca's embrace.*

1354
01:42:54,000 --> 01:42:57,000
Leon: "Thanks for everything, Cullen."

1355
01:42:57,000 --> 01:43:00,000
Cullen: "Yeah... You want to step out for a moment?"

1356
01:43:00,000 --> 01:43:01,000
Leon: "Okay."

1357
01:43:01,000 --> 01:43:07,000
Cullen: "First, the duo that came after you... Sorry. We couldn't track them down."

1358
01:43:07,000 --> 01:43:08,000
Leon: "I see."

1359
01:43:08,000 --> 01:43:14,000
Cullen: "Based on what you told us, there's a good chance they'll come after you again."

1360
01:43:14,000 --> 01:43:21,000
Cullen: "For the time being, we'll take shifts coming here for patrol, but that's the most we can do."

1361
01:43:21,000 --> 01:43:24,000
Leon: "No, that's more than enough. Thank you."

1362
01:43:24,000 --> 01:43:30,000
*From here on, we'll have to be more careful and pay attention to our own safety, too.*

1363
01:43:30,000 --> 01:43:33,000
Cullen: "So much for being your big sis... Bah."

1364
01:43:33,000 --> 01:43:34,000
Leon: "Haha."

1365
01:43:34,000 --> 01:43:40,000
Cullen: "Hey, you're the one they're after, you know? You'd better look after yourself properly."

1366
01:43:40,000 --> 01:43:41,000
Leon: "...Right."

1367
01:43:41,000 --> 01:43:51,000
Cullen: "If anything happens to you, Lucia and Aisia are going to be really sad. Rebecca, too. And you can bet I'm going to be very upset, as well."

1368
01:43:51,000 --> 01:43:58,000
Cullen: "Your body isn't just your own anymore, Leon. Your well-being affects others, too. Don't forget that."

1369
01:43:58,000 --> 01:44:00,000
Leon: "Thank you. I'll remember."

1370
01:44:00,000 --> 01:44:08,000
Cullen: "Well, that's enough of that... Good job, though, with the new member. Your harem's coming along nicely."

1371
01:44:08,000 --> 01:44:14,000
Leon: "Please stop calling it that. Lucia already harassed me with that joke earlier."

1372
01:44:14,000 --> 01:44:24,000
Cullen: "Lucia, huh? Well, considering it went from just the two of you to a whopping four people now... I guess I can't blame her for getting worried."

1373
01:44:24,000 --> 01:44:25,000
Leon: "Um, Cullen?"

1374
01:44:25,000 --> 01:44:33,000
Cullen: "...Nevermind. I'm not doing anyone any favors by bringing that up now. Still, first vampires, now zombies..."

1375
01:44:33,000 --> 01:44:36,000
Cullen: "This place is a researcher's wet dream."

1376
01:44:36,000 --> 01:44:38,000
Leon: "Is this place that valuable?"

1377
01:44:38,000 --> 01:44:47,000
Cullen: "Are you kidding me? A male of the species, a vampire, and a zombie all in one spot? That kind of thing just doesn't happen."

1378
01:44:47,000 --> 01:44:53,000
Leon: "Yeah, Lucia did mention that as the normal one here, she was like the odd one out."

1379
01:44:53,000 --> 01:44:58,000
Cullen: "Tell me about it. It sure isn't getting any easier for Lucia, is it..."

1380
01:44:58,000 --> 01:45:02,000
Cullen: "Aisia's probably okay for now. The problem is Rebecca."

1381
01:45:02,000 --> 01:45:07,000
Leon: "I think she'd like to have a healthy body again, if it's possible..."

1382
01:45:07,000 --> 01:45:18,000
Cullen: "...All the stuff that's happened to you lately is a bit out of my league. I need to sit down and do some proper research. Until then, I can't really say."

1383
01:45:18,000 --> 01:45:23,000
Leon: "I guess you're going to have your hands full for a while, then?"

1384
01:45:23,000 --> 01:45:28,000
Cullen: "No worries. When the time comes, I'll make sure to have a substitute."

1385
01:45:28,000 --> 01:45:40,000
Cullen: "Now, then, I'd feel bad if I tied you up for any longer. Time to go. Oh, and Leon? If there's a future where everyone's happy, then that's the one I want to see. Got it?"

1386
01:45:40,000 --> 01:45:42,000
Leon: "Yes... I'll do my best."

1387
01:45:42,000 --> 01:45:44,000
Cullen: "...Good answer."

1388
01:45:44,000 --> 01:45:46,000
Aisia: "Ah, Leon's finally back!"

1389
01:45:46,000 --> 01:45:50,000
Lucia: "L-Leon... I don't think I can take this anymore."

1390
01:45:50,000 --> 01:45:52,000
Leon: "What's wrong with Lucia?"

1391
01:45:52,000 --> 01:45:56,000
Aisia: "Well, she asked Rebecca what zombies were like..."

1392
01:45:56,000 --> 01:46:02,000
Rebecca: "Hmm, I might have gone a little overboard with the whole 'coming off' thing."

1393
01:46:02,000 --> 01:46:05,000
Aisia: "She made all sorts of parts come off..."

1394
01:46:05,000 --> 01:46:10,000
Rebecca: "Oh, Leon, look. This part comes off, too. What do you think?"

1395
01:46:10,000 --> 01:46:13,000
Leon: "...You should probably not do that. Look at?"

1396
01:46:13,000 --> 01:46:14,000
Lucia: "Eeeeeeeeeeek!"

1397
01:46:14,000 --> 01:46:17,000
Aisia: "Ah! Lucia's going to faint again!"

1398
01:46:17,000 --> 01:46:21,000
Leon: "...It's going to be a while before we're all used to this."

1399
01:46:21,000 --> 01:46:28,000
*For the rest of the night, Rebecca continues to take off various parts of her body and put them back on.*

1400
01:46:28,000 --> 01:46:35,000
*...Lucia does eventually get used to it, too, but not before suffering through a straight week of nightmares.*

1401
01:46:35,000 --> 01:46:40,000
*Over in another room, Lucia is sleeping while clutching tightly to Aisia.*

