02:12:52,000 --> 02:13:00,000
*But considering the uninvited guests we had the other day, there's no guarantee that nothing will happen in the future.*

1826
02:13:00,000 --> 02:13:05,000
*Change, however, creeps into the familiar pace of our everyday lives.*

1827
02:13:05,000 --> 02:13:08,000
*It begins with a visit from the "other" big sis.*

1828
02:13:08,000 --> 02:13:15,000
Cullen: "Now that you've got an official sister, I guess it's time to revisit OUR relationship, Leon..."

1829
02:13:15,000 --> 02:13:19,000
Leon: "We never were siblings to begin with, by the way."

1830
02:13:19,000 --> 02:13:25,000
*Upon hearing about Rebecca, the "other" big sis immediately begins to make a fuss.*

1831
02:13:25,000 --> 02:13:33,000
*As soon as the word "relationship" leaves her lips, I can already tell this conversation is going to turn sexual.*

1832
02:13:33,000 --> 02:13:38,000
Cullen: "No way! What about that time you called me sister, huh? Was that a lie?"

1833
02:13:38,000 --> 02:13:39,000
Momo: "Woof."

1834
02:13:39,000 --> 02:13:42,000
Cullen: "Look, even Momo's mad at you."

1835
02:13:42,000 --> 02:13:46,000
Leon: "Stop trying to use Momo to make your ridiculous points."

1836
02:13:46,000 --> 02:13:56,000
*...I'm surprised she still remembers I said that. She seems, however, to have conveniently forgotten that I added the preceding adjective of "virtual".*

1837
02:13:56,000 --> 02:14:03,000
*Pointing that out sounds like a great way to ruin her mood, though, so I just apologize for the time being.*

1838
02:14:03,000 --> 02:14:07,000
Leon: "Oh-you're-right-I-did-call-you-that-sorry-Sis."

1839
02:14:07,000 --> 02:14:13,000
Cullen: "Ah... Th-That was good, Leon. One more time. Say it to me one more time! Please?"

1840
02:14:13,000 --> 02:14:17,000
Leon: "No. Go back to being your regular self already."

1841
02:14:17,000 --> 02:14:21,000
Cullen: "Hnnngh, but I just got to hear the best line from you!"

1842
02:14:21,000 --> 02:14:30,000
*It's certainly true that we're seeing more fun and excitement in our lives, and that is, of course, something we should be happy about.*

1843
02:14:30,000 --> 02:14:37,000
*...But when it comes to this particular sister, I really wish she'd tone the fun and excitement down a little.*

1844
02:14:37,000 --> 02:14:41,000
Cullen: "Oh, wait, this isn't what I came here to talk about."

1845
02:14:41,000 --> 02:14:45,000
Leon: "Could you please start with the important stuff next time?"

1846
02:14:45,000 --> 02:14:50,000
Cullen: "But I'm curious about what you've been up to. Wouldn't you be, hm?"

1847
02:14:50,000 --> 02:14:54,000
*"Hm", she says, as if I'm actually supposed to answer that.*

1848
02:14:54,000 --> 02:14:59,000
*As can be seen, Cullen has a tendency to pry into various aspects of my life.*

1849
02:14:59,000 --> 02:15:07,000
*It's her way of showing kindness and concern, but at the same time, I can't help but feel there's something else behind it.*

1850
02:15:07,000 --> 02:15:11,000
*I can't quite put my finger on what exactly it is...*

1851
02:15:11,000 --> 02:15:18,000
*But from time to time, I'd get this strange feeling that there's something more to what she means.*

1852
02:15:18,000 --> 02:15:21,000
Cullen: "I'll be gone for about two weeks."

1853
02:15:21,000 --> 02:15:23,000
Leon: "Another investigation?"

1854
02:15:23,000 --> 02:15:31,000
Cullen: "Something like that. There's a meeting at the end this time, too, so it's going to take longer than usual."

1855
02:15:31,000 --> 02:15:36,000
*Part of Cullen's work involves conducting investigations into the Disaster.*

1856
02:15:36,000 --> 02:15:41,000
*That's why she's sometimes away from Sagami Francisco for a few days, but...*

1857
02:15:41,000 --> 02:15:43,000
Leon: "Two whole weeks? That's rare."

1858
02:15:43,000 --> 02:15:48,000
Cullen: "Yeah. That's why I figured I'd give you a heads up beforehand."

1859
02:15:48,000 --> 02:15:52,000
Cullen: "I was worried you'd feel all lonely without me..."

1860
02:15:52,000 --> 02:15:53,000
Leon: "Okay, bye."

1861
02:15:53,000 --> 02:16:03,000
Cullen: "Awww, come on, is that it? Is that seriously it? Aren't you going to grab on to me and be like, 'Don't leave! I'll miss you!' and stuff?"

1862
02:16:03,000 --> 02:16:06,000
Leon: "When have I ever done something like that?"

1863
02:16:06,000 --> 02:16:10,000
Cullen: "That's why this is the perfect chance, right?"

1864
02:16:10,000 --> 02:16:11,000
Leon: "Haa..."

1865
02:16:11,000 --> 02:16:18,000
*I feel like we're not working with the same definition of "sister", and I'm not the one who has it wrong.*

1866
02:16:18,000 --> 02:16:21,000
Aisia: "We're done with the backyard."

1867
02:16:21,000 --> 02:16:22,000
Leon: "Okay, thanks."

1868
02:16:22,000 --> 02:16:25,000
Lucia: "Huh? Cullen, what are you doing here?"

1869
02:16:25,000 --> 02:16:30,000
Cullen: "Nothing much. Just educating Leon about what it means to be a sister..."

1870
02:16:30,000 --> 02:16:34,000
Leon: "And you're doing a terrible job at it, by the way."

1871
02:16:34,000 --> 02:16:36,000
Rebecca: "Oh, my, Cullen. Welcome~"

1872
02:16:36,000 --> 02:16:41,000
Cullen: "Hey, Rebecca, looks you're fitting right in here. Good to know."

1873
02:16:41,000 --> 02:16:45,000
Rebecca: "Yes, everyone is so nice to me... It's wonderful."

1874
02:16:45,000 --> 02:16:47,000
*Rebecca's expression grows gentle.*

1875
02:16:47,000 --> 02:16:52,000
*That look of sincere bliss on Rebecca appears to relax Cullen, as well.*

1876
02:16:52,000 --> 02:16:58,000
Cullen: "One of these days... I'll have to take a good look at Rebecca's situation, too."

1877
02:16:58,000 --> 02:17:02,000
Leon: "Yeah... we also still need to look for Aisia's parents."

1878
02:17:02,000 --> 02:17:04,000
Cullen: "Right... Oh, time to go."

1879
02:17:04,000 --> 02:17:07,000
Aisia: "Huh? Are you leaving already?"

1880
02:17:07,000 --> 02:17:10,000
Lucia: "You're not going to stay for some food?"

1881
02:17:10,000 --> 02:17:16,000
Cullen: "I've got somebody waiting for me in town. You guys'll be rid of me early today."

1882
02:17:16,000 --> 02:17:21,000
Rebecca: "That's a shame... I'd love to sit down with you for a chat again."

1883
02:17:21,000 --> 02:17:26,000
Cullen: "Same here. Anyway, see you, Leon. I'll swing by once I'm back."

1884
02:17:26,000 --> 02:17:27,000
Leon: "Okay."

1885
02:17:27,000 --> 02:17:31,000
*Cullen nods. Then, her expression suddenly turns serious.*

1886
02:17:31,000 --> 02:17:38,000
Cullen: "...To be honest, after an incident like that, leaving right now is the last thing I want to do."

1887
02:17:38,000 --> 02:17:39,000
Leon: "Cullen..."

1888
02:17:39,000 --> 02:17:45,000
Cullen: "If anything happens, let the vigilante corps in town know right away. Got it?"

1889
02:17:45,000 --> 02:17:46,000
Leon: "Yeah."

1890
02:17:46,000 --> 02:17:51,000
Cullen: "All right. Keep it up, everyone. I'm counting on all of you, too."

1891
02:17:51,000 --> 02:17:53,000
Aisia & Lucia & Rebecca: "Yes!"

1892
02:17:53,000 --> 02:17:54,000
Momo: "Aaaarf..."

1893
02:17:54,000 --> 02:17:58,000
Cullen: "There, there, Momo. You be a good girl, too, okay?"

1894
02:17:58,000 --> 02:18:02,000
*And so, Cullen leaves for her somewhat lengthy investigation.*

1895
02:18:02,000 --> 02:18:11,000
*To avoid a repeat of what happened last time, we start keeping our eyes open around the store and paying extra attention to visitors.*

1896
02:18:11,000 --> 02:18:14,000
*Three days have passed and evening approaches.*

1897
02:18:14,000 --> 02:18:18,000
*Lucia and I are driving toward the town of Sagami Francisco.*

1898
02:18:18,000 --> 02:18:24,000
Lucia: "I should have paid more attention. I thought we ordered them, but they wasn't there..."

1899
02:18:24,000 --> 02:18:28,000
Leon: "Yeah, and I looked it over, too. I must have missed that."

1900
02:18:28,000 --> 02:18:35,000
*After realizing that we forgot to pick up a few things at the shopping plaza, we head out again.*

1901
02:18:35,000 --> 02:18:38,000
Lucia: "The usual store is closed now, right?"

1902
02:18:38,000 --> 02:18:44,000
Leon: "Yeah, we've got no choice. We'll have to head to the Market. There isn't too much to buy."

1903
02:18:44,000 --> 02:18:50,000
Lucia: "The Market, huh... Not the kind of place you want to be at this time of day."

1904
02:18:50,000 --> 02:18:51,000
Leon: "Yeah..."

1905
02:18:51,000 --> 02:18:56,000
*Known to many as the Shades, it is, as its name suggests, a pretty shady place.*

1906
02:18:56,000 --> 02:19:02,000
*I try to only go there when it's bright out, but I'll have to make an exception for today.*

1907
02:19:02,000 --> 02:19:08,000
Lucia: "I'm always thinking about how to keep watch around the store. I can't help it."

1908
02:19:08,000 --> 02:19:13,000
Leon: "Yeah, when there's a lot on your mind, it's easy to forget other details."

1909
02:19:13,000 --> 02:19:17,000
Lucia: "I wish we can stop worrying about all this soon..."

1910
02:19:17,000 --> 02:19:22,000
*I respond to Lucia with a nod as I step further down on the gas pedal.*

1911
02:19:22,000 --> 02:19:25,000
Lucia: "Okay, have we got everything?"

1912
02:19:25,000 --> 02:19:29,000
*After our shopping trip, Lucia gives our grocery basket a pat.*

1913
02:19:29,000 --> 02:19:32,000
Leon: "Just to be safe, let's check it over."

1914
02:19:32,000 --> 02:19:37,000
Lucia: "Hm, cloves, parsley powder... and chili powder. I think that's it?"

1915
02:19:37,000 --> 02:19:39,000
Leon: "We're missing nutmeg."

1916
02:19:39,000 --> 02:19:43,000
Lucia: "Oh, right. The spices store was... this way, I think?"

1917
02:19:43,000 --> 02:19:45,000
Leon: "Yeah... I think so."

1918
02:19:45,000 --> 02:19:52,000
*Neither of us entirely confident in our memory, we pay close attention to our surroundings as we walk.*

1919
02:19:52,000 --> 02:20:00,000
Lucia: "It's nice that you can find all sorts of stuff here, but it's really hard to figure out where anything is."

1920
02:20:00,000 --> 02:20:04,000
Leon: "They don't call this place the Shades for nothing."

1921
02:20:04,000 --> 02:20:11,000
*Isn't it enough for this place to be so shady? Why do the things have to be so hard to find, as well?*

1922
02:20:11,000 --> 02:20:19,000
*I guess it's only natural, though, considering the stores here rarely stay in the same place for more than a week.*

1923
02:20:19,000 --> 02:20:22,000
Lucia: "You look a bit nervous, Leon. What's wrong?"

1924
02:20:22,000 --> 02:20:29,000
Leon: "...This place doesn't have the best atmosphere. Once we finish shopping, I'd like to get out of here."

1925
02:20:29,000 --> 02:20:36,000
Lucia: "R-Right. We wouldn't want to run into some weird people like the ones who showed up last time..."

1926
02:20:36,000 --> 02:20:42,000
Leon: "Let's leave as soon as we buy everything, then. There's no point staying here for long."

1927
02:20:42,000 --> 02:20:44,000
Lucia: "Yeah, let's do that..."

1928
02:20:44,000 --> 02:20:46,000
Lucia: "Where are we...?"

1929
02:20:46,000 --> 02:20:48,000
Leon: "Are we seriously lost...?"

1930
02:20:48,000 --> 02:20:56,000
*Despite reminding ourselves to pay attention, we still end up lost. The geography here must really be out to get us.*

1931
02:20:56,000 --> 02:20:59,000
Lucia: "And we finally bought the nutmeg, too."

1932
02:20:59,000 --> 02:21:05,000
Leon: "We were both sure the exit was this way, too. How did we both screw this up..."

1933
02:21:05,000 --> 02:21:12,000
*After simultaneously pointing in one direction and yelling "It's this way!", we come straight to a dead end.*

1934
02:21:12,000 --> 02:21:17,000
*With the sun already setting, the Market begins to take on a new look.*

1935
02:21:17,000 --> 02:21:24,000
*The distant baying of a stray dog can be heard. Lucia's expression immediately clouds with worry.*

1936
02:21:24,000 --> 02:21:28,000
Lucia: "What do we do? Should we head back the way we came?"

1937
02:21:28,000 --> 02:21:32,000
Leon: "I don't think we have any other choice... Hm?"

1938
02:21:32,000 --> 02:21:35,000
*As soon as I agree with Lucia and turn around...*

1939
02:21:35,000 --> 02:21:37,000
Sandy: "Hey, what do we have here?"

1940
02:21:37,000 --> 02:21:40,000
Puppy: "Whoa, this is one heck of a coincidence!"

1941
02:21:40,000 --> 02:21:41,000
Lucia: "Y-You people!"

1942
02:21:41,000 --> 02:21:42,000
Leon: "Tch..."

1943
02:21:42,000 --> 02:21:49,000
*Standing before us are the same two black suits who invited themselves into our store a few days ago.*

1944
02:21:49,000 --> 02:21:50,000
*...This is not good.*

1945
02:21:50,000 --> 02:21:55,000
*They're the last people I wanted to meet here, yet here they are...*

1946
02:21:55,000 --> 02:22:04,000
Sandy: "And here we thought we were heading back empty-handed to get scolded by the boss... but I guess we were wrong. Right, partner?"

1947
02:22:04,000 --> 02:22:13,000
Puppy: "We sure were! This must be divine intervention! Good thing I didn't cheap out yesterday when I was putting coins in for the offering."

1948
02:22:13,000 --> 02:22:16,000
Lucia: "Wh-Wh-Wh-What do you people want with us..."

1949
02:22:16,000 --> 02:22:21,000
Sandy: "Hey, little lady, you've got some guts... but isn't your voice shaking?"

1950
02:22:21,000 --> 02:22:23,000
Lucia: "N-N-N-No, it's not..."

1951
02:22:23,000 --> 02:22:26,000
*Lucia's hand trembles violently as she speaks.*

1952
02:22:26,000 --> 02:22:35,000
*These people aren't just street thugs. If the last time is any indication, they're probably armed and dangerous. I've got no choice.*

1953
02:22:35,000 --> 02:22:37,000
Leon: "...Leave her out of this."

1954
02:22:37,000 --> 02:22:38,000
Lucia: "Leon?!"

1955
02:22:38,000 --> 02:22:46,000
Leon: "If what you said last time is true, you're only after me, right? In that case, she's got nothing to do with this."

1956
02:22:46,000 --> 02:22:50,000
*I quietly step in front of Lucia and block her off.*

1957
02:22:50,000 --> 02:22:53,000
Lucia: "But, Leon... What are you going to do?!"

1958
02:22:53,000 --> 02:22:56,000
*Behind me, Lucia pleads in a whisper.*

1959
02:22:56,000 --> 02:23:04,000
Leon: "...Find a way to get home and tell the vigilante crops it's an emergency. After that, just leave it to Cullen."

1960
02:23:04,000 --> 02:23:05,000
Lucia: "B-But..."

1961
02:23:05,000 --> 02:23:11,000
Sandy: "I'll give you props for your courage, young man... but unfortunately, the answer is no."

1962
02:23:11,000 --> 02:23:12,000
Leon: "...!"

1963
02:23:12,000 --> 02:23:13,000
Lucia: "What..."

1964
02:23:13,000 --> 02:23:22,000
Sandy: "It'd be a nuisance if she rushed home and reported us... Until the time comes, we'll have to ask her to stay with you, young man."

1965
02:23:22,000 --> 02:23:29,000
*The black suit speaks in a smooth, effortless tone. With a practiced motion, she brings her hand to her chest.*

1966
02:23:29,000 --> 02:23:32,000
Sandy: "So, that's that. Don't cause a scene, now."

1967
02:23:32,000 --> 02:23:35,000
Puppy: "Yeah, you heard her! Don't cause a scene!"

1968
02:23:35,000 --> 02:23:36,000
Leon: "Tch..."

1969
02:23:36,000 --> 02:23:42,000
*Even if I were to start shouting, it wouldn't help if they just shot me in the leg.*

1970
02:23:42,000 --> 02:23:49,000
*More importantly, they might do something to Lucia. If that happened, I'd regret it for the rest of my life.*

1971
02:23:49,000 --> 02:23:51,000
*Is this how it ends...?*

1972
02:23:51,000 --> 02:23:53,000
*Resigned, I close my eyes.*

1973
02:23:53,000 --> 02:23:56,000
*Only a few short seconds pass before...*

1974
02:23:56,000 --> 02:24:00,000
???: "You there, I do believe you're bothering the good couple."

1975
02:24:00,000 --> 02:24:04,000
*An unexpected voice resonates through the alleyway.*

1976
02:24:04,000 --> 02:24:05,000
Puppy: "Say what?"

1977
02:24:05,000 --> 02:24:10,000
*Behind the black suits, there suddenly appears another girl also wearing black.*

1978
02:24:10,000 --> 02:24:15,000
*Her clothes are... very strange, though they look simple and easy to move in.*

1979
02:24:15,000 --> 02:24:21,000
Sandy: "Don't stick your nose in other people's business, little lady. It's for your own good."

1980
02:24:21,000 --> 02:24:25,000
Puppy: "Ah! I wanted to say that! You stole my line!"

1981
02:24:25,000 --> 02:24:31,000
Sandy: "Early bird gets the worm, right? Man, I always wanted to try saying that..."

1982
02:24:31,000 --> 02:24:36,000
Puppy: "D-Damn it... I-In that case, I get to say a cool line, too!"

1983
02:24:36,000 --> 02:24:43,000
Puppy: "Hehehe, you'd better behave yourself now, little lady, or you're gonna be in a world of hurt..."

1984
02:24:43,000 --> 02:24:44,000
Puppy: "Ugh... ooh..."

1985
02:24:44,000 --> 02:24:46,000
Lucia: "What... Wow..."

1986
02:24:46,000 --> 02:24:48,000
Leon: "What did she just do...?"

1987
02:24:48,000 --> 02:24:51,000
*The black suit barely even touched the girl.*

1988
02:24:51,000 --> 02:24:55,000
*The next instant, the black suit is crumpled on the ground.*

1989
02:24:55,000 --> 02:24:58,000
Sandy: "Eh... H-Hey, Puppy, what happened?"

1990
02:24:58,000 --> 02:25:05,000
???: "I merely hit the pit of her stomach with some force... She should wake up after ten minutes or so."

1991
02:25:05,000 --> 02:25:13,000
Sandy: "A brawler, huh... And you've got some chops. You're hiding a mean punch behind that cute face of yours, little lady."

1992
02:25:13,000 --> 02:25:17,000
???: "I believe you're next. Shall we do this, then?"

1993
02:25:17,000 --> 02:25:21,000
Sandy: "We sure shall. I have to avenge my partner..."

1994
02:25:21,000 --> 02:25:26,000
*Slowly, Sandy rises. Rising with her is the aura of someone ready for a fight.*

1995
02:25:26,000 --> 02:25:28,000
Sandy: "But, before that..."

1996
02:25:28,000 --> 02:25:31,000
Sandy: "We're going to regroup! Muahaha!"

1997
02:25:31,000 --> 02:25:37,000
*Despite her threatening words moments before, the standing black suit smiles confidently and...*

1998
02:25:37,000 --> 02:25:40,000
Sandy: "Hey, Puppy, wake up already! Come on!"

1999
02:25:40,000 --> 02:25:45,000
*Makes a frantic escape while carrying the unconscious body of her partner.*

2000
02:25:45,000 --> 02:25:46,000
Leon: "...H-Haha."

2001
02:25:46,000 --> 02:25:48,000
Lucia: "W-We're saved... right?"

2002
02:25:48,000 --> 02:25:53,000
*The encounter barely lasted five minutes, but both of us feel exhausted.*

2003
02:25:53,000 --> 02:25:58,000
???: "Are you hurt in any way? I do hope you are both feeling well..."

2004
02:25:58,000 --> 02:26:02,000
*The girl wearing black clothes asks us with a look of concern.*

2005
02:26:02,000 --> 02:26:06,000
Leon: "Yeah, we're fine. Thank you so much for saving us!"

2006
02:26:06,000 --> 02:26:10,000
???: "You owe me no thanks. I was merely doing my duty."

2007
02:26:10,000 --> 02:26:13,000
*...Duty? Is she one of the vigilantes?*

2008
02:26:13,000 --> 02:26:16,000
Lucia: "Oh, by the way, what's your name?"

2009
02:26:16,000 --> 02:26:20,000
*With perfect timing, Lucia jumps in with her question.*

2010
02:26:20,000 --> 02:26:26,000
???: "Mari Mizuno, at your service! As for my occupation, I am but a humble ninja!"

2011
02:26:26,000 --> 02:26:32,000
*Along with her name, the girl tells us something we can't make heads or tails of.*

2012
02:26:32,000 --> 02:26:33,000
Leon: "...Huh?"

2013
02:26:33,000 --> 02:26:34,000
Lucia: "A... ninja?"

2014
02:26:34,000 --> 02:26:37,000
Mari: "That is correct... Is something the matter?"

2015
02:26:37,000 --> 02:26:39,000
Leon: "Well, I mean..."

2016
02:26:39,000 --> 02:26:44,000
*Nowhere in the our world, of course, does there exist the occupation of ninja.*

2017
02:26:44,000 --> 02:26:49,000
Lucia: "I thought ninjas were from fantasy worlds, or maybe ancient Japan."

2018
02:26:49,000 --> 02:26:52,000
*What Lucia says is indeed how we think of ninjas.*

2019
02:26:52,000 --> 02:27:04,000
Mari: "I-I see. There does indeed seem to be some discrepancy between my own common sense and that of the general public. I had cautioned myself to be aware, but I was careless..."

2020
02:27:04,000 --> 02:27:07,000
Mari: "Ugh... M-My humblest apologies."

2021
02:27:07,000 --> 02:27:09,000
Leon: "Huh? Could it be that..."

2022
02:27:09,000 --> 02:27:11,000
Lucia: "You're... hungry?"

2023
02:27:11,000 --> 02:27:20,000
Mari: "Please forgive this most embarrassing matter... I must confess that I have had nothing to eat or drink since this morning."

2024
02:27:20,000 --> 02:27:22,000
Lucia: "What? Nothing at all?!"

2025
02:27:22,000 --> 02:27:27,000
Mari: "Indeed, for I have been rationing my meals as much as possible."

2026
02:27:27,000 --> 02:27:31,000
Leon: "Well, I guess we know how we're going to thank you."

2027
02:27:31,000 --> 02:27:33,000
Lucia: "Huh. Yeah, I guess we do."

2028
02:27:33,000 --> 02:27:34,000
Mari: "You... do?"

2029
02:27:34,000 --> 02:27:36,000
Mari: "Om, nom, mm, om, nom."

2030
02:27:36,000 --> 02:27:40,000
Mari: "Gulp... gulp... gulp... Phew, th-that was delicious..."

2031
02:27:40,000 --> 02:27:43,000
Aisia: "She's certainly a fast eater..."

2032
02:27:43,000 --> 02:27:46,000
Lucia: "About as fast as you, actually."

2033
02:27:46,000 --> 02:27:52,000
Aisia: "That's so mean! I've been holding back to about half my usual amount lately~"

2034
02:27:52,000 --> 02:27:56,000
Rebecca: "Leon, we don't have anything left for her to eat."

2035
02:27:56,000 --> 02:27:58,000
Leon: "She cleaned us out? Wow..."

2036
02:27:58,000 --> 02:28:05,000
Mari: "P-Please accept my deepest gratitude! I feel as though I have been brought back from the brink of death!"

2037
02:28:05,000 --> 02:28:09,000
Leon: "W-Well, she seems pretty satisfied, so I guess it's okay."

2038
02:28:09,000 --> 02:28:16,000
*As soon as she reached our diner, Mari began to devour the food we brought out, plate after plate.*

2039
02:28:16,000 --> 02:28:28,000
*This wouldn't be the first time I've watched a girl eat and wondered where all the food goes in that tiny body of hers. I've seen Aisia already, after all. Still, it boggles my mind.*

2040
02:28:28,000 --> 02:28:33,000
*Is Sagami Francisco experiencing an influx of big eaters or something?*

2041
02:28:33,000 --> 02:28:38,000
Mari: "M-May I know by whose gracious hand such delicacies were made?"

2042
02:28:38,000 --> 02:28:41,000
Leon: "Uh, I made them... but what about it?"

2043
02:28:41,000 --> 02:28:45,000
*I put my hand up only to have it firmly grabbed by Mari.*

2044
02:28:45,000 --> 02:28:46,000
Mari: "Sir Leon!"

2045
02:28:46,000 --> 02:28:47,000
Leon: "Y-Yes?"

2046
02:28:47,000 --> 02:28:53,000
Mari: "I do believe I have met the person to whom I owe my eternal gratitude and respect!"

2047
02:28:53,000 --> 02:28:59,000
Leon: "What... What's this huge fuss about? Also, you don't have to call me 'Sir'."

2048
02:28:59,000 --> 02:29:03,000
Mari: "But I must! You deserve the title of my highest regard!"

2049
02:29:03,000 --> 02:29:04,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

2050
02:29:04,000 --> 02:29:07,000
*Mari's excitement seems to have infected Momo.*

2051
02:29:07,000 --> 02:29:14,000
*She doesn't just look like a ninja. She acts like one, too, down to how she associates with people.*

2052
02:29:14,000 --> 02:29:18,000
*She's definitely a quirky one. All sorts of quirky.*

2053
02:29:18,000 --> 02:29:22,000
Rebecca: "This is the first time I've ever seen a ninja girl."

2054
02:29:22,000 --> 02:29:24,000
Leon: "That makes two of us."

2055
02:29:24,000 --> 02:29:29,000
Lucia: "Who would have thought there were still real ones in this day and age..."

2056
02:29:29,000 --> 02:29:32,000
*We breathe a collective sigh of astonishment.*

2057
02:29:32,000 --> 02:29:34,000
Aisia: "What do ninjas usually do?"

2058
02:29:34,000 --> 02:29:38,000
*Aisia immediately starts us off with a question for Mari.*

2059
02:29:38,000 --> 02:29:45,000
Mari: "Though I am a ninja, I remain but an apprentice, so I spend my days doing little more than training."

2060
02:29:45,000 --> 02:29:50,000
Lucia: "An apprentice... which means you have a master or something?"

2061
02:29:50,000 --> 02:29:55,000
Mari: "Yes, I do indeed... though he is currently in a world far, far, away."

2062
02:29:55,000 --> 02:29:58,000
*A world far away... That can only mean one thing.*

2063
02:29:58,000 --> 02:30:03,000
Lucia: "I-I'm sorry. That must have been a difficult question for you..."

2064
02:30:03,000 --> 02:30:15,000
Mari: "Ha ha, worry not. My master once said to me, 'Though the body may go, the heart shall remain. From someplace in the sky, I shall always watch over the path you take...'"

2065
02:30:15,000 --> 02:30:20,000
Mari: "Therefore, I am sure that even now, my master continues to teach me."

2066
02:30:20,000 --> 02:30:26,000
*...Sometimes, you really do have to appreciate how strange and interesting people can be.*

2067
02:30:26,000 --> 02:30:32,000
*The vigilante corps in town that Cullen belongs to does, of course, have entrance exams.*

2068
02:30:32,000 --> 02:30:44,000
*The job requires physical stamina and self-defense skills, as well as general knowledge about the world. One needs to know all sorts of things to protect the safety of others.*

2069
02:30:44,000 --> 02:30:56,000
*However, it's a different story for independent organizations. In addition to the publicly-operating vigilante corps, Sagami Francisco is home to a number of volunteer organizations.*

2070
02:30:56,000 --> 02:31:05,000
*I heard that some of those groups employ karate or fencing to defend themselves... but I never thought some of them would use ninjutsu.*

2071
02:31:05,000 --> 02:31:11,000
Leon: "Did you and your master belong to one of the organizations that protect the town, Mari?"

2072
02:31:11,000 --> 02:31:14,000
Mari: "...Pardon? What might those be?"

2073
02:31:14,000 --> 02:31:19,000
Leon: "Well, I was just wondering if you were one of those volunteer vigilantes."

2074
02:31:19,000 --> 02:31:27,000
Mari: "No, I know not of what you speak. My master and I sought only to better our own skills through our training."

2075
02:31:27,000 --> 02:31:33,000
Leon: "Huh? So... you just train however you want? You don't abide to a code or anything?"

2076
02:31:33,000 --> 02:31:38,000
Mari: "Indeed. I chose my own path and have been solemnly walking it ever since."

2077
02:31:38,000 --> 02:31:40,000
Leon: "That's, uh... Well."

2078
02:31:40,000 --> 02:31:42,000
*Pretty impressive, really...*

2079
02:31:42,000 --> 02:31:46,000
Lucia: "So, you devoted yourself solely to your ninja training."

2080
02:31:46,000 --> 02:31:49,000
Aisia: "She's so small, too. That's amazing."

2081
02:31:49,000 --> 02:31:51,000
Rebecca: "Yes, really..."

2082
02:31:51,000 --> 02:31:55,000
*A round of appreciative remarks erupt from all of us.*

2083
02:31:55,000 --> 02:32:04,000
*In this day and age, it's hard to enough to survive. I can't imagine what it's like to choose a path and stay true to it all by herself.*

2084
02:32:04,000 --> 02:32:08,000
*What grit. What determination. What a stoic way to live.*

2085
02:32:08,000 --> 02:32:16,000
*All the hardships I've gone through... Compared to her, I'm not even sure if I can call them hardships anymore...*

2086
02:32:16,000 --> 02:32:19,000
Mari: "U-Um... it pains me to say this, but..."

2087
02:32:19,000 --> 02:32:26,000
*Mari, whom I looked upon with near-worship moments before, suddenly turns to me with an expression of concern.*

2088
02:32:26,000 --> 02:32:27,000
Leon: "Hm? What's..."

2089
02:32:27,000 --> 02:32:30,000
*Before I even manage to say "Wrong"...*

2090
02:32:30,000 --> 02:32:38,000
Mari: "I-It seems that I have eaten a little too much... My body feels heavy and I find myself unable to move freely."

2091
02:32:38,000 --> 02:32:39,000
Leon: "...What?"

2092
02:32:39,000 --> 02:32:40,000
Lucia: "R-Really?"

2093
02:32:40,000 --> 02:32:41,000
Aisia: "Huh?"

2094
02:32:41,000 --> 02:32:44,000
*...I-It's definitely a stoic life that she leads.*

2095
02:32:44,000 --> 02:32:47,000
*But isn't this a little too careless for a ninja?*

2096
02:32:47,000 --> 02:32:53,000
Mari: "Would it be possible, then, for me to use your eaves as shelter for the night?"

2097
02:32:53,000 --> 02:32:54,000
Leon: "...Pffaha."

2098
02:32:54,000 --> 02:32:55,000
Mari: "...Huh?"

2099
02:32:55,000 --> 02:33:02,000
Leon: "Haha, sorry. There's something about this situation that was just too funny. It made me laugh."

2100
02:33:02,000 --> 02:33:05,000
Lucia: "Hehe, yeah. She's sort of cute."

2101
02:33:05,000 --> 02:33:08,000
Aisia: "She's just like me! The old me, that is!"

2102
02:33:08,000 --> 02:33:17,000
Mari: "I-I apologize. As a ninja, this is most embarrassing, but truly, the hunger was so intense... and the cooking here so delicious..."

2103
02:33:17,000 --> 02:33:21,000
Leon: "Don't worry. Now that you're here, you're free to relax."

2104
02:33:21,000 --> 02:33:26,000
Mari: "T-Truly? I am in your debt. I shall excuse myself to your eaves, then..."

2105
02:33:26,000 --> 02:33:32,000
Lucia: "What are you talking about? You're going to end up with back pain if you sleep there."

2106
02:33:32,000 --> 02:33:33,000
Mari: "...Pardon?"

2107
02:33:33,000 --> 02:33:40,000
Aisia: "We can throw some sheets over the living room couch on the second floor and turn it into a bed~"

2108
02:33:40,000 --> 02:33:44,000
Rebecca: "That's right! Leave that to your Big Sis, then!"

2109
02:33:44,000 --> 02:33:46,000
Mari: "Wah! W-W-W-Waaah!"

2110
02:33:46,000 --> 02:33:51,000
*Rebecca leaps toward Mari from the side and pushes her down onto a chair.*

2111
02:33:51,000 --> 02:33:54,000
Mari: "U-Um! Rebecca, what are you trying to..."

2112
02:33:54,000 --> 02:33:59,000
Leon: "Oh, don't mind her. It's just how she communicates affection."

2113
02:33:59,000 --> 02:34:05,000
Mari: "Th-This is a rather intimate?stifling, actually?show of affection... Mmfffm."

2114
02:34:05,000 --> 02:34:11,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, maybe I'll just keep hugging you until they're done putting the sheets down."

2115
02:34:11,000 --> 02:34:12,000
Mari: "Mmmfmm! Mmmm!"

2116
02:34:12,000 --> 02:34:14,000
Leon: "So much for that..."

2117
02:34:14,000 --> 02:34:23,000
*The sense of stoic tension that was in the air is gone without a trace. Both it and Mari have been swallowed up by our usual atmosphere.*

2118
02:34:23,000 --> 02:34:24,000
*Night falls.*

2119
02:34:24,000 --> 02:34:28,000
*Mari's bed is prepared and everyone is getting ready to sleep.*

2120
02:34:28,000 --> 02:34:30,000
Lucia: "Ah, you look so cute!"

2121
02:34:30,000 --> 02:34:33,000
Aisia: "She's right! It suits you so well~"

2122
02:34:33,000 --> 02:34:40,000
Mari: "U-Um... Are you certain it is all right for you to have gone as far as preparing clothes for me?"

2123
02:34:40,000 --> 02:34:47,000
*While digging through some old clothes we bought at the Market, we found some pajamas that fit Mari.*

2124
02:34:47,000 --> 02:34:50,000
Rebecca: "Fwaaah... I-It looks so good on you..."

2125
02:34:50,000 --> 02:34:53,000
Mari: "R-Rebecca! Your face! It is much too close!"

2126
02:34:53,000 --> 02:35:00,000
*Part of it might be the fact that Rebecca worked some of her magic on it, but it really does look good on her.*

2127
02:35:00,000 --> 02:35:06,000
*Girls can take on a completely different air just by wearing different clothes...*

2128
02:35:06,000 --> 02:35:09,000
Leon: "Well, then, let's sleep. Good night."

2129
02:35:09,000 --> 02:35:12,000
*With that, I turn the lights off in the room.*

2130
02:35:12,000 --> 02:35:13,000
Leon: "..."

2131
02:35:13,000 --> 02:35:14,000
Leon: "Uh, Rebecca?"

2132
02:35:14,000 --> 02:35:15,000
Rebecca: "Yes?"

2133
02:35:15,000 --> 02:35:20,000
Leon: "I don't think Mari can sleep with you being there the whole time..."

2134
02:35:20,000 --> 02:35:26,000
*After turning off the lights, both Lucia and Aisia crawled into their respective beds.*

2135
02:35:26,000 --> 02:35:31,000
*For some reason, however, Rebecca snuggled up against Mari from behind.*

2136
02:35:31,000 --> 02:35:36,000
*With a wide smile on her face, she gives no indication of moving away.*

2137
02:35:36,000 --> 02:35:39,000
Rebecca: "Hnnngh, but Mari's just so adorable."

2138
02:35:39,000 --> 02:35:43,000
Leon: "That doesn't exactly justify your behavior..."

2139
02:35:43,000 --> 02:35:48,000
Mari: "S-Sir Leon, what should I, um... be doing in this situation?"

2140
02:35:48,000 --> 02:35:53,000
Leon: "Hold on a minute. I'll convince Rebecca... Come on, let's get a move on."

2141
02:35:53,000 --> 02:35:57,000
*I grab Rebecca from under her arms and pull her away.*

2142
02:35:57,000 --> 02:36:02,000
Rebecca: "Hmph, how come you didn't pull me by the arm? That's like comedy 101."

2143
02:36:02,000 --> 02:36:07,000
Leon: "...Because if I pulled you by the arm, it would have fallen off."

2144
02:36:07,000 --> 02:36:13,000
Mari: "Huh? Um, pardon my intrusion, but is Rebecca employing the likes of an artificial arm?"

2145
02:36:13,000 --> 02:36:16,000
Leon: "Oh, right... We haven't told you yet."

2146
02:36:16,000 --> 02:36:20,000
Rebecca: "That's true... Okay, Mari, look over here."

2147
02:36:20,000 --> 02:36:22,000
Mari: "Um, all right... I am."

2148
02:36:22,000 --> 02:36:26,000
*Mari gets up from the couch and looks toward Rebecca.*

2149
02:36:26,000 --> 02:36:31,000
Rebecca: "Ready? Make sure you're looking carefully, okay? Here we go..."

2150
02:36:31,000 --> 02:36:35,000
*Rebecca takes her right arm and pulls it off from the elbow.*

2151
02:36:35,000 --> 02:36:39,000
Mari: "Wow, what a finely-crafted artificial arm... Huh?"

2152
02:36:39,000 --> 02:36:46,000
*Mari looks at the detached arm and offers some comments of praise. Then, she sees the severed side.*

2153
02:36:46,000 --> 02:36:47,000
Mari: "...Eh?"

2154
02:36:47,000 --> 02:36:49,000
Mari: "W-Waaaaaaaaaah!"

2155
02:36:49,000 --> 02:36:51,000
Lucia: "Wh-What's going on?!"

2156
02:36:51,000 --> 02:36:53,000
Aisia: "What just happened?!"

2157
02:36:53,000 --> 02:36:58,000
Mari: "I-It is Rebecca! Something terrible just happened to her arm!"

2158
02:36:58,000 --> 02:37:01,000
*When the two of them hear Mari's words...*

2159
02:37:01,000 --> 02:37:03,000
Lucia: "Oh, that's what it was..."

2160
02:37:03,000 --> 02:37:04,000
Mari: "...Huh?"

2161
02:37:04,000 --> 02:37:08,000
Aisia: "Heehee, it's quite the shocker when you first see it~"

2162
02:37:08,000 --> 02:37:09,000
Mari: "U-Um..."

2163
02:37:09,000 --> 02:37:14,000
*The two of them return to their beds, leaving Mari floundering in shock.*

2164
02:37:14,000 --> 02:37:21,000
Mari: "U-Um, what is the meaning of this? I have never heard of such a technique... Not even from my master..."

2165
02:37:21,000 --> 02:37:26,000
Leon: "It's not a technique. It's, well... just how Rebecca's body is."

2166
02:37:26,000 --> 02:37:28,000
Mari: "How... her body is?"

2167
02:37:28,000 --> 02:37:29,000
Rebecca: "Yes."

2168
02:37:29,000 --> 02:37:32,000
Mari: "I-I see. Sort of. Not really..."

2169
02:37:32,000 --> 02:37:35,000
*I explain to Mari about how Rebecca is.*

2170
02:37:35,000 --> 02:37:43,000
Mari: "This is my first time seeing, um... someone you would call a zombie, but... you seem no different from regular people."

2171
02:37:43,000 --> 02:37:48,000
Leon: "That's what I thought, too, but that's apparently what Rebecca is."

2172
02:37:48,000 --> 02:37:52,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, but look, I can take all these places off, too~"

2173
02:37:52,000 --> 02:38:02,000
*Just when I think Rebecca has finally finished brandishing her disembodied right arm, she proceeds to casually remove her left arm and both legs.*

2174
02:38:02,000 --> 02:38:03,000
Mari: "Wah! Waaaaah!"

2175
02:38:03,000 --> 02:38:05,000
*Mari's face turns a little pale.*

2176
02:38:05,000 --> 02:38:12,000
*I guess I can't blame her. I'd be confused, too, if a kind, gentle lady suddenly started doing this to me.*

2177
02:38:12,000 --> 02:38:15,000
Leon: "Rebecca, uh, how about we stop there..."

2178
02:38:15,000 --> 02:38:21,000
Rebecca: "Oh, my. I'm sorry. Mari's such fun when she's shocked. I got carried away~"

2179
02:38:21,000 --> 02:38:27,000
Mari: "I-I am quite fine! If I consider this to be training my mental fortitude..."

2180
02:38:27,000 --> 02:38:30,000
Rebecca: "Oh? Then, how about... this!"

2181
02:38:30,000 --> 02:38:33,000
Mari: "Wah! A-Again! Both... Both legs!"

2182
02:38:33,000 --> 02:38:36,000
Leon: "Hey, come on! Knock it off already!"

2183
02:38:36,000 --> 02:38:43,000
*...And so, despite the ruckus, we manage to survive the night all in one piece. Sort of, anyway.*

2184
02:38:43,000 --> 02:38:44,000
*The next morning.*

2185
02:38:44,000 --> 02:38:48,000
Leon: "Haa... Man... What a day it was yesterday... Hm?"

2186
02:38:48,000 --> 02:38:54,000
*Not long after waking up, I realize that there seems to be some kind of commotion outside.*

2187
02:38:54,000 --> 02:38:56,000
Leon: "I think it's... the backyard?"

2188
02:38:56,000 --> 02:38:58,000
*Maybe there's some sort of animal.*

2189
02:38:58,000 --> 02:39:00,000
*I head out to take a look.*

2190
02:39:00,000 --> 02:39:01,000
Mari: "Hah! Yah! Tah!"

2191
02:39:01,000 --> 02:39:02,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

2192
02:39:02,000 --> 02:39:03,000
Leon: "Ah... I see."

2193
02:39:03,000 --> 02:39:05,000
*Nothing in particular is amiss.*

2194
02:39:05,000 --> 02:39:13,000
*I step out to find Mari in the middle of her morning training. Each action she takes is accompanied by a shout of effort.*

2195
02:39:13,000 --> 02:39:18,000
*To her side is Momo, who is watching her like her faithful guard dog.*

2196
02:39:18,000 --> 02:39:20,000
Mari: "Ah, Sir Leon! Good morning!"

2197
02:39:20,000 --> 02:39:24,000
Leon: "Okay, you need to stop it with the 'Sir' thing..."

2198
02:39:24,000 --> 02:39:29,000
Mari: "Never! Embedded within your title are my profound gratitude and respect!"

2199
02:39:29,000 --> 02:39:31,000
Leon: "Ah, right. Okay... Yeah."

2200
02:39:31,000 --> 02:39:37,000
*No matter how many times I tell her, she seems to have no intention of giving it up...*

2201
02:39:37,000 --> 02:39:40,000
Leon: "So, what kind of training is this?"

2202
02:39:40,000 --> 02:39:44,000
Mari: "This? This would be training to improve my speed."

2203
02:39:44,000 --> 02:39:45,000
Leon: "Your speed?"

2204
02:39:45,000 --> 02:39:55,000
Mari: "Indeed. Those who are ninjas must always be of superior agility. Therefore, the most important thing is to always be able to move quickly."

2205
02:39:55,000 --> 02:40:00,000
*After saying that, Mari circles behind me faster than my eyes can follow.*

2206
02:40:00,000 --> 02:40:01,000
Leon: "Wh-Whoa!"

2207
02:40:01,000 --> 02:40:04,000
Mari: "Furthermore, there are feats such as..."

2208
02:40:04,000 --> 02:40:09,000
*By the time she finishes her sentence, she has already jumped onto the roof.*

2209
02:40:09,000 --> 02:40:10,000
Leon: "W-Wow..."

2210
02:40:10,000 --> 02:40:11,000
Momo: "Woof!"

2211
02:40:11,000 --> 02:40:15,000
*The next instant, she's standing in front of me again.*

2212
02:40:15,000 --> 02:40:22,000
Mari: "I had a most satisfying meal yesterday. As a result, I can move thirty percent better than normal!"

2213
02:40:22,000 --> 02:40:28,000
Leon: "Is that really how it works? ...Does that outfit have something to do with it?"

2214
02:40:28,000 --> 02:40:30,000
Mari: "Ah, you mean these?"

2215
02:40:30,000 --> 02:40:35,000
*With her fingers, Mari pulls at the ninja garb that she always wears.*

2216
02:40:35,000 --> 02:40:41,000
Mari: "I tweak them as I go to ensure they are always a perfect fit for how I move!"

2217
02:40:41,000 --> 02:40:42,000
Leon: "Ah, I see..."

2218
02:40:42,000 --> 02:40:46,000
*I guess it makes sense if she's customizing it as on the fly.*

2219
02:40:46,000 --> 02:40:54,000
Mari: "My attempts at various feats so far have proven successful, so I truly seem to be in top condition today."

2220
02:40:54,000 --> 02:40:57,000
Leon: "Well, I'm really glad to hear that, but..."

2221
02:40:57,000 --> 02:40:59,000
Mari: "Is something bothering you?"

2222
02:40:59,000 --> 02:41:08,000
Leon: "Uh, it's just that being covered in sweat so early in the morning seems like a great way to get force-bathed by Rebecca."

2223
02:41:08,000 --> 02:41:14,000
*The first thing Rebecca did when Mari came here was to throw her into the bathtub.*

2224
02:41:14,000 --> 02:41:24,000
*As I understand, what followed was a relentless bout of touching in which a particularly mischievous Rebecca thoroughly invaded Mari's personal space.*

2225
02:41:24,000 --> 02:41:25,000
Mari: "Wha?Ah! Aaah!"

2226
02:41:25,000 --> 02:41:27,000
*Panic begins to consume Mari.*

2227
02:41:27,000 --> 02:41:31,000
Mari: "I-I shall go bathe right away! I must excuse myself!"

2228
02:41:31,000 --> 02:41:36,000
*With a speed that puts her prior displays to shame, she zooms into the house.*

2229
02:41:36,000 --> 02:41:40,000
Leon: "...I think that's the fastest she's moved so far."

2230
02:41:40,000 --> 02:41:41,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

2231
02:41:41,000 --> 02:41:43,000
Mari: "Hom, nom, nom, om, nom."

2232
02:41:43,000 --> 02:41:46,000
Mari: "Wh-What is the name, nom, of this food?"

2233
02:41:46,000 --> 02:41:49,000
Lucia: "It's a meat pie... Is it that good?"

2234
02:41:49,000 --> 02:41:56,000
Mari: "I-I have eaten sweets of the same shape as this, but never have they been filled with meat."

2235
02:41:56,000 --> 02:42:02,000
Mari: "To be honest, this may as well have been a surprise attack! I find myself soundly routed!"

2236
02:42:02,000 --> 02:42:04,000
Lucia: "M-My condolences, then..."

2237
02:42:04,000 --> 02:42:11,000
Leon: "As the one who made it, it feels good to see the person eating it make it look so tasty..."

2238
02:42:11,000 --> 02:42:12,000
Aisia: "*stare*"

2239
02:42:12,000 --> 02:42:17,000
Leon: "Yeah, I know, Aisia. You make it look tasty when you eat it, too."

2240
02:42:17,000 --> 02:42:18,000
Aisia: "Ehehe..."

2241
02:42:18,000 --> 02:42:22,000
*Meanwhile, Mari picks up the bowl of cream stew with both hands.*

2242
02:42:22,000 --> 02:42:26,000
Mari: "Gulp... gulp... gulp... Phew~ That was delicious."

2243
02:42:26,000 --> 02:42:28,000
*She drinks it all in one go.*

2244
02:42:28,000 --> 02:42:30,000
Lucia: "Glad to see you liked it."

2245
02:42:30,000 --> 02:42:34,000
Aisia: "Where do you think it all goes in that tiny body of hers?"

2246
02:42:34,000 --> 02:42:37,000
*Aisia asks an absurdly hypocritical question.*

2247
02:42:37,000 --> 02:42:43,000
Rebecca: "Where does it, indeed... She's such an adorable little thing, too. Mmhmhm."

2248
02:42:43,000 --> 02:42:52,000
*After her invasion of Mari's personal space yesterday, Rebecca continues the assault by clinging to her and refusing to let go.*

2249
02:42:52,000 --> 02:42:56,000
Mari: "R-Rebecca, um... I find this most embarrassing."

2250
02:42:56,000 --> 02:43:00,000
*Even Mari is feeling a little awkward about the whole situation.*

2251
02:43:00,000 --> 02:43:04,000
Lucia: "It's almost like we've all got a little sister now."

2252
02:43:04,000 --> 02:43:05,000
Leon: "Yeah..."

2253
02:43:05,000 --> 02:43:10,000
*For the time being, Rebecca's the eldest, and Lucia is next, I guess.*

2254
02:43:10,000 --> 02:43:15,000
*As for the remaining two, it's pretty much a toss up as to which one is older.*

2255
02:43:15,000 --> 02:43:18,000
Mari: "Your hospitality has been most appreciated."

2256
02:43:18,000 --> 02:43:21,000
*After the meal, Mari formally offers her thanks.*

2257
02:43:21,000 --> 02:43:28,000
Mari: "Such a generous welcome for such a simple service... Please, allow me to repay your kindness!"

2258
02:43:28,000 --> 02:43:35,000
Lucia: "The whole reason we brought you here is to thank you. This'll never end if you thank us back."

2259
02:43:35,000 --> 02:43:38,000
Mari: "But I owe you far too great a debt!"

2260
02:43:38,000 --> 02:43:41,000
*Then, Mari seems to suddenly think of something.*

2261
02:43:41,000 --> 02:43:46,000
Mari: "Ah! I-In that case, allow me to invite you to my humble quarters!"

2262
02:43:46,000 --> 02:43:48,000
*Her reply catches us by surprise.*

2263
02:43:48,000 --> 02:43:50,000
Leon: "Your humble quarters?"

2264
02:43:50,000 --> 02:43:54,000
Mari: "Indeed! It is not very spacious, but I insist!"

2265
02:43:54,000 --> 02:44:00,000
Leon: "S-Sure, I guess we might as well, since we have to drive you back, anyway..."

2266
02:44:00,000 --> 02:44:04,000
*On that note, I have no idea what Mari's day-to-day life is like.*

2267
02:44:04,000 --> 02:44:08,000
Lucia: "You think it's going to be... a ninja house?"

2268
02:44:08,000 --> 02:44:11,000
Leon: "It's hard to imagine anything else."

2269
02:44:11,000 --> 02:44:12,000
*In any case...*

2270
02:44:12,000 --> 02:44:17,000
*It's decided that we'll pay a visit to Mari's home after dropping her off.*

2271
02:44:17,000 --> 02:44:20,000
Leon: "Am I going in the right direction?"

2272
02:44:20,000 --> 02:44:27,000
Mari: "Indeed, this is the right direction! You need only make a right after passing the next hill!"

2273
02:44:27,000 --> 02:44:30,000
Leon: "Are you sure? That heads to the desert."

2274
02:44:30,000 --> 02:44:31,000
Mari: "Yes!"

2275
02:44:31,000 --> 02:44:32,000
*Mari nods firmly.*

2276
02:44:32,000 --> 02:44:37,000
*I guess we have no choice, then... What kind of place is she living in, anyway?*

2277
02:44:37,000 --> 02:44:41,000
Rebecca: "I wonder what kind of place it is? I'm awfully curious~"

2278
02:44:41,000 --> 02:44:42,000
Leon: "Um, Rebecca..."

2279
02:44:42,000 --> 02:44:43,000
Rebecca: "Yes?"

2280
02:44:43,000 --> 02:44:46,000
Leon: "Why did you come along, again?"

2281
02:44:46,000 --> 02:44:52,000
*When we started up the car to drive Mari home, Rebecca just casually got in, too.*

2282
02:44:52,000 --> 02:44:59,000
Rebecca: "Why? ...This is my adorable little sister, after all. I'd be worried if I don't see her off."

2283
02:44:59,000 --> 02:45:02,000
Leon: "So she's already your little sister, huh..."

2284
02:45:02,000 --> 02:45:06,000
*I shift my attention away from Rebecca for a minute.*

2285
02:45:06,000 --> 02:45:09,000
Leon: "Mari, about those clothes of yours..."

2286
02:45:09,000 --> 02:45:12,000
Mari: "Yes? What about these clothes of mine?"

2287
02:45:12,000 --> 02:45:15,000
Leon: "Did you get them tailor-made from somewhere?"

2288
02:45:15,000 --> 02:45:17,000
*Mari is wearing her ninja clothes.*

2289
02:45:17,000 --> 02:45:27,000
*The way they're designed... it's not the first thing you'd think of when someone mentions ninja clothes. On top of that... they show quite a bit of skin.*

2290
02:45:27,000 --> 02:45:33,000
Mari: "These, you see, were based on the clothes of my master. I pieced them together myself!"

2291
02:45:33,000 --> 02:45:36,000
Leon: "Oh, so you made them yourself..."

2292
02:45:36,000 --> 02:45:41,000
Mari: "Yes, I took care to keep them as light as possible for ease of movement."

2293
02:45:41,000 --> 02:45:44,000
*...Ease of movement, huh. Fair enough.*

2294
02:45:44,000 --> 02:45:48,000
Leon: "I see. So, that's why you, uh... generally don't wear much."

2295
02:45:48,000 --> 02:45:49,000
Mari: "Indeed!"

2296
02:45:49,000 --> 02:45:54,000
*...I can't. I just can't. Asking her, "Are those panties?" is too much for me.*

2297
02:45:54,000 --> 02:46:00,000
*I'm still a little curious, though. It's actually kind of hard to keep my eyes away.*

2298
02:46:00,000 --> 02:46:02,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhmhmhm."

2299
02:46:02,000 --> 02:46:05,000
*Suddenly, chuckles are heard from the backseat.*

2300
02:46:05,000 --> 02:46:07,000
Leon: "What's going on, Rebecca?"

2301
02:46:07,000 --> 02:46:14,000
Rebecca: "You see, Leon... I actually have one more special ability I haven't mentioned to you yet."

2302
02:46:14,000 --> 02:46:15,000
Leon: "What?"

2303
02:46:15,000 --> 02:46:18,000
Mari: "Special ability! Wh-What could it..."

2304
02:46:18,000 --> 02:46:21,000
*Her announcement shocks me. Even Mari is curious.*

2305
02:46:21,000 --> 02:46:25,000
*Are detachable limbs not the only ability she has to offer...?*

2306
02:46:25,000 --> 02:46:31,000
Rebecca: "There's one particular emotion of people that I can read with near-perfect precision."

2307
02:46:31,000 --> 02:46:34,000
Leon: "Really? That sounds pretty impressive..."

2308
02:46:34,000 --> 02:46:38,000
Mari: "You practice the art of mind reading? Impressive, indeed!"

2309
02:46:38,000 --> 02:46:43,000
Rebecca: "That's right, and that one particular emotion happens to be..."

2310
02:46:43,000 --> 02:46:44,000
Leon: "Gulp..."

2311
02:46:44,000 --> 02:46:46,000
Mari: "Happens to be...?"

2312
02:46:46,000 --> 02:46:48,000
Rebecca: "The naughty one!"

2313
02:46:48,000 --> 02:46:49,000
Leon: "..."

2314
02:46:49,000 --> 02:46:52,000
*...I have such a bad feeling about this.*

2315
02:46:52,000 --> 02:46:55,000
Mari: "...Huh? The naughty one... you say?"

2316
02:46:55,000 --> 02:47:01,000
Rebecca: "That's right! As a matter of fact, just now, Leon was looking at your outfit and..."

2317
02:47:01,000 --> 02:47:05,000
Leon: "Whoa! Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold on a minute, Rebecca!"

2318
02:47:05,000 --> 02:47:07,000
*My bad feeling was right on!*

2319
02:47:07,000 --> 02:47:13,000
*Rebecca must have realized that my mind was in the gutter with my previous comment.*

2320
02:47:13,000 --> 02:47:18,000
*Ability, my ass! ...W-Well, okay, I guess you can sort of call it an ability.*

2321
02:47:18,000 --> 02:47:23,000
Rebecca: "He was thinking, 'How lewd! Why are you dressed like that?'"

2322
02:47:23,000 --> 02:47:24,000
Leon: "Waaaaaaaah!"

2323
02:47:24,000 --> 02:47:28,000
*D-Damn it, it's that much worse because she's actually right!*

2324
02:47:28,000 --> 02:47:31,000
Mari: "...? U-Um... So, what you mean is..."

2325
02:47:31,000 --> 02:47:36,000
*After thinking about it for a moment, Mari's face immediately turns bright red.*

2326
02:47:36,000 --> 02:47:37,000
Mari: "S-Sir Leon!"

2327
02:47:37,000 --> 02:47:38,000
Leon: "Yes!"

2328
02:47:38,000 --> 02:47:43,000
Mari: "Y-You see, um, these are not panties, but rather a swimsuit of sorts!"

2329
02:47:43,000 --> 02:47:50,000
Leon: "Are you all mind readers? How come you managed to pinpoint exactly what I was thinking of?!"

2330
02:47:50,000 --> 02:47:57,000
Mari: "W-Well, it seemed to me that if there was something lewd about this outfit... it must have been that."

2331
02:47:57,000 --> 02:48:03,000
Mari: "B-But please know that it took me a long time to decide between leggings and these!"

2332
02:48:03,000 --> 02:48:07,000
Leon: "You don't have to give me the entire backstory!"

2333
02:48:07,000 --> 02:48:13,000
Mari: "In the end, I chose these because they looked stylish and were easy to move in!"

2334
02:48:13,000 --> 02:48:18,000
Mari: "But, hnngh... never did I think that was how Sir Leon saw me... I..."

2335
02:48:18,000 --> 02:48:21,000
Leon: "N-No! That's not how I see you, so relax!"

2336
02:48:21,000 --> 02:48:26,000
Rebecca: "Oh, oh, I have an announcement! Leon just told a big, fat lie!"

2337
02:48:26,000 --> 02:48:27,000
Leon: "Rebecca!"

2338
02:48:27,000 --> 02:48:32,000
*Flustered by the unexpected turn of events, I work up an intense sweat.*

2339
02:48:32,000 --> 02:48:37,000
*Ultimately, my suspicions are put to rest by Mari's lengthy clarification.*

2340
02:48:37,000 --> 02:48:41,000
*...At the cost of my image and my mental well-being.*

2341
02:48:41,000 --> 02:48:44,000
*We spend another thirty minutes driving.*

2342
02:48:44,000 --> 02:48:50,000
*When the looming figure of our destination reveals itself, to be honest, I'm quite taken aback.*

2343
02:48:50,000 --> 02:48:51,000
Leon: "..."

2344
02:48:51,000 --> 02:48:52,000
Rebecca: "Oh, my..."

2345
02:48:52,000 --> 02:48:55,000
*A towering structure marks the end of our journey.*

2346
02:48:55,000 --> 02:48:59,000
*There is a definite air of civilization about the building.*

2347
02:48:59,000 --> 02:49:04,000
*Even Sagami Francisco doesn't have a structure of this size and scale.*

2348
02:49:04,000 --> 02:49:09,000
*There is almost always only one explanation for such an incongruous sight.*

2349
02:49:09,000 --> 02:49:11,000
Leon: "A Relic, huh..."

2350
02:49:11,000 --> 02:49:14,000
Rebecca: "I would assume so... A big one, too."

2351
02:49:14,000 --> 02:49:15,000
Leon: "Yeah..."

2352
02:49:15,000 --> 02:49:20,000
*I wonder if this building has been here since before the Disaster.*

2353
02:49:20,000 --> 02:49:27,000
*Somehow, perhaps through some coincidence, it alone was spared destruction and survived the Disaster.*

2354
02:49:27,000 --> 02:49:30,000
Mari: "Is there... something strange about my home?"

2355
02:49:30,000 --> 02:49:36,000
*Our prolonged and silent staring must have unsettled Mari, as she worriedly asks us.*

2356
02:49:36,000 --> 02:49:40,000
Leon: "Oh, no, that's not it. We were just kind of in awe."

2357
02:49:40,000 --> 02:49:45,000
*Among the remaining Relics, many of them also happen to be gigantic.*

2358
02:49:45,000 --> 02:49:50,000
*The simplest example would be the metal tower at the heart of our town.*

2359
02:49:50,000 --> 02:49:57,000
*However, for such a huge Relic to have gone mostly unnoticed until now is nothing short of a miracle.*

2360
02:49:57,000 --> 02:49:59,000
Mari: "Please, do come in!"

2361
02:49:59,000 --> 02:50:01,000
*Mari pulls on my sleeve.*

2362
02:50:01,000 --> 02:50:02,000
Leon: "S-Sure."

2363
02:50:02,000 --> 02:50:06,000
*Mari leads the way with Rebecca and I following behind.*

2364
02:50:06,000 --> 02:50:09,000
*I wonder what this place is like on the inside.*

2365
02:50:09,000 --> 02:50:10,000
Leon: "Haa... haa..."

2366
02:50:10,000 --> 02:50:13,000
*There are, of course, stairs on the inside.*

2367
02:50:13,000 --> 02:50:21,000
*While that's to be expected, a ridiculously tall building also comes with a ridiculously large number of stairs.*

2368
02:50:21,000 --> 02:50:24,000
Mari: "Sir Leon... are you all right?"

2369
02:50:24,000 --> 02:50:30,000
Leon: "Yeah, I'm okay... but I'd really like to know how many more flights we have to climb."

2370
02:50:30,000 --> 02:50:34,000
Mari: "Worry not, for there are but ten more floors!"

2371
02:50:34,000 --> 02:50:35,000
Leon: "Oh, man..."

2372
02:50:35,000 --> 02:50:37,000
*We're not even halfway there...*

2373
02:50:37,000 --> 02:50:41,000
Rebecca: "Leon, are you throwing in the towel already?"

2374
02:50:41,000 --> 02:50:46,000
Leon: "Rebecca? You're still going strong? ...I'm already feeling it."

2375
02:50:46,000 --> 02:50:52,000
Rebecca: "Well, remember how I'm not completely human? I'm only half alive, after all."

2376
02:50:52,000 --> 02:50:55,000
Leon: "Huh, so do you never feel tired?"

2377
02:50:55,000 --> 02:50:59,000
Rebecca: "That seems to be one of the perks of this body~"

2378
02:50:59,000 --> 02:51:04,000
*Ugh... This is one of those times when I almost wish I could be a zombie, too...*

2379
02:51:04,000 --> 02:51:08,000
*After reaching the eighteenth floor, Mari's steps cease.*

2380
02:51:08,000 --> 02:51:10,000
Mari: "This way, please."

2381
02:51:10,000 --> 02:51:15,000
*She points to the the only door in sight that's not covered in dust.*

2382
02:51:15,000 --> 02:51:17,000
*She opens the door and we enter.*

2383
02:51:17,000 --> 02:51:18,000
Leon: "Huh... Wow."

2384
02:51:18,000 --> 02:51:25,000
*I had a hunch when I saw the outside of the building, but the interior of the room really is well-made.*

2385
02:51:25,000 --> 02:51:33,000
*There are minimal household effects, but there is electricity, and the walls and floor look sturdy and well-built.*

2386
02:51:33,000 --> 02:51:38,000
*This place was clearly built with technology from a different time.*

2387
02:51:38,000 --> 02:51:45,000
Rebecca: "This is spectacular... You'd be hard pressed to find a room like this even in the town."

2388
02:51:45,000 --> 02:51:50,000
*Considering Rebecca's privileged upbringing, her remark is extra convincing.*

2389
02:51:50,000 --> 02:51:53,000
Mari: "I shall prepare the tea right away."

2390
02:51:53,000 --> 02:51:58,000
*While Mari makes some tea in the kitchen, I take a look around the room.*

2391
02:51:58,000 --> 02:52:01,000
Leon: "This place is a little bare, to be honest..."

2392
02:52:01,000 --> 02:52:06,000
*A large TV is complemented by stacks of video discs piled on top of each other.*

2393
02:52:06,000 --> 02:52:08,000
*The bed is clean but unadorned.*

2394
02:52:08,000 --> 02:52:12,000
*The only other object in the room is a training machine.*

2395
02:52:12,000 --> 02:52:17,000
Rebecca: "Leon, it's bad manners to stare at a girl's room, you know?"

2396
02:52:17,000 --> 02:52:19,000
Leon: "O-Oh, uh, sorry..."

2397
02:52:19,000 --> 02:52:25,000
*Though I apologize for my behavior, I'm not sure if you can even call this place a girl's room.*

2398
02:52:25,000 --> 02:52:28,000
Leon: "She's definitely a mysterious one..."

2399
02:52:28,000 --> 02:52:33,000
*Despite coming all the way to her room, I still know next to nothing about Mari.*

2400
02:52:33,000 --> 02:52:40,000
*The more she tells me about herself, the more questions I have about her and this building she calls home.*

2401
02:52:40,000 --> 02:52:48,000
Mari: "There is a garden in the basement of this building, along with a power station and a water purification plant."

2402
02:52:48,000 --> 02:52:52,000
Rebecca: "They're used exclusively for this building?"

2403
02:52:52,000 --> 02:52:57,000
Mari: "Indeed. That is why it is possible to survive on this building alone."

2404
02:52:57,000 --> 02:53:05,000
Mari: "...Of course, I am only repeating what was written in the building manual. I know little else about the details."

2405
02:53:05,000 --> 02:53:08,000
Leon: "Yeah, I wouldn't expect you to..."

2406
02:53:08,000 --> 02:53:15,000
*In this day and age, you'd probably need a vast amount of knowledge to understand what this building is.*

2407
02:53:15,000 --> 02:53:19,000
*It's probably too much for even Cullen to fully grasp.*

2408
02:53:19,000 --> 02:53:25,000
*That's the degree to which information from before the Disaster is shrouded in mystery.*

2409
02:53:25,000 --> 02:53:30,000
Mari: "First of all, there is only electricity and water from this floor and up."

2410
02:53:30,000 --> 02:53:31,000
Leon: "Huh? Really?"

2411
02:53:31,000 --> 02:53:35,000
Mari: "Otherwise, I would have lived closer to the ground."

2412
02:53:35,000 --> 02:53:39,000
*Mari smiles wryly as she gives her legs a firm pat.*

2413
02:53:39,000 --> 02:53:46,000
Mari: "Running up and down the stairs happened to be good training, though, so it all worked out."

2414
02:53:46,000 --> 02:53:50,000
*Like she said, the garden is in the basement of the building.*

2415
02:53:50,000 --> 02:53:57,000
*With stairs being the only method of vertical movement, she'd naturally have to go up and down frequently.*

2416
02:53:57,000 --> 02:54:00,000
Leon: "Yeah, that'd definitely keep you fit."

2417
02:54:00,000 --> 02:54:06,000
*In our current world, tall buildings are rare enough to be a sight all on their own.*

2418
02:54:06,000 --> 02:54:12,000
*Very few people would have the experience of going up and down one of them on a daily basis.*

2419
02:54:12,000 --> 02:54:17,000
Rebecca: "It almost seems as if they were preparing for a crisis here..."

2420
02:54:17,000 --> 02:54:21,000
*There are vegetables, water, and even stockpiles of salt.*

2421
02:54:21,000 --> 02:54:26,000
*Since there is electricity, activities of daily life can proceed unhindered.*

2422
02:54:26,000 --> 02:54:34,000
*There is a strange anachronism about the place. Though it was built in the past, it feels like it came from the future.*

2423
02:54:34,000 --> 02:54:37,000
Mari: "Try some of these, if you please."

2424
02:54:37,000 --> 02:54:40,000
*Mari hands us a package of three biscuits.*

2425
02:54:40,000 --> 02:54:43,000
Leon: "Are these... from this building, too?"

2426
02:54:43,000 --> 02:54:47,000
Mari: "Indeed. There are many of them in the storage room."

2427
02:54:47,000 --> 02:54:55,000
Rebecca: "Those stay good for a long time, too. They probably were stocking them here in case of some sort of crisis."

2428
02:54:55,000 --> 02:54:58,000
*The biscuits themselves are fairly dense.*

2429
02:54:58,000 --> 02:55:03,000
Mari: "These are quite filling. They can keep me going for a whole day."

2430
02:55:03,000 --> 02:55:06,000
*Yeah, they probably are emergency rations.*

2431
02:55:06,000 --> 02:55:11,000
*I don't feel particularly hungry right now, so I put them in my coat pocket.*

2432
02:55:11,000 --> 02:55:18,000
Rebecca: "Also, there's something I've been wondering about since we came here... and it's these."

2433
02:55:18,000 --> 02:55:22,000
*Rebecca points to the mountain of video discs beside the TV.*

2434
02:55:22,000 --> 02:55:24,000
Mari: "Ah, these. These, you see..."

2435
02:55:24,000 --> 02:55:28,000
*With the most casual tone, Mari makes another bizarre statement.*

2436
02:55:28,000 --> 02:55:29,000
Mari: "Are my master."

2437
02:55:29,000 --> 02:55:30,000
Leon: "...Eh?"

2438
02:55:30,000 --> 02:55:32,000
Rebecca: "They... are?"

2439
02:55:32,000 --> 02:55:36,000
*We have not the slightest idea what she's talking about.*

2440
02:55:36,000 --> 02:55:39,000
Leon: "H-Hey, uh, can I take a look at those discs?"

2441
02:55:39,000 --> 02:55:41,000
Mari: "Certainly. Feel free to."

2442
02:55:41,000 --> 02:55:45,000
*I take a couple of discs from Mari and look them over.*

2443
02:55:45,000 --> 02:55:51,000
Leon: "'The Legend of the Karate Ninja', 'The Flame Ninja Warrior', 'God of Ninjas'..."

2444
02:55:51,000 --> 02:55:56,000
*As I look through the titles, I start to understand what is going on.*

2445
02:55:56,000 --> 02:55:58,000
Leon: "Okay, so, basically..."

2446
02:55:58,000 --> 02:56:07,000
Leon: "You were watching these movies and trying to copy what they did in there... and that's how you were training to be a ninja?"

2447
02:56:07,000 --> 02:56:10,000
Mari: "Yes, that is exactly what I was doing!"

2448
02:56:10,000 --> 02:56:11,000
*...Seriously?*

2449
02:56:11,000 --> 02:56:17,000
*I mean, I'm the one who said it, but even I wasn't fully expecting it to be true.*

2450
02:56:17,000 --> 02:56:21,000
Rebecca: "Huh? So, the master that you were talking about..."

2451
02:56:21,000 --> 02:56:25,000
Mari: "Yes, that would this person right here! Master Sonny Toba!"

2452
02:56:25,000 --> 02:56:30,000
*On the cover of one of the disc boxes is a dashing, bearded male actor.*

2453
02:56:30,000 --> 02:56:32,000
*Mari points at him and smiles.*

2454
02:56:32,000 --> 02:56:36,000
*A long time ago, long before the Disaster happened...*

2455
02:56:36,000 --> 02:56:43,000
*In a land to the far east known as Japan, there was an action star who was a master of every martial art.*

2456
02:56:43,000 --> 02:56:45,000
Leon: "Sonny Toba, huh..."

2457
02:56:45,000 --> 02:56:48,000
*I've seen some of his films before, as well.*

2458
02:56:48,000 --> 02:56:55,000
*However, I remember them involving chains of action scenes filled with stunts that defy human limits.*

2459
02:56:55,000 --> 02:57:01,000
Leon: "You're telling me she just practiced... or rather, trained with those moves for real?"

2460
02:57:01,000 --> 02:57:05,000
*I feel like she has taken 'naive' to a whole new level.*

2461
02:57:05,000 --> 02:57:09,000
*She's got some serious guts, though. That much is certain.*

2462
02:57:09,000 --> 02:57:14,000
Mari: "That reminds me, there was a garden in the backyard of the diner, as well."

2463
02:57:14,000 --> 02:57:16,000
Rebecca: "I made that, by the way~"

2464
02:57:16,000 --> 02:57:22,000
Mari: "Huh? In that case, how did you procure vegetables before you made the garden?"

2465
02:57:22,000 --> 02:57:25,000
*Man, the things she says never fail to amaze me.*

2466
02:57:25,000 --> 02:57:30,000
Leon: "Mari... don't tell me you've never gone shopping in the town before."

2467
02:57:30,000 --> 02:57:34,000
Mari: "Certainly not. I have not the money to do so, anyway."

2468
02:57:34,000 --> 02:57:41,000
Leon: "I'd say I'm shocked... but I don't think I've ever stopped being shocked since I got here."

2469
02:57:41,000 --> 02:57:49,000
*An enigmatic structure that can provide for itself along with a girl who became a ninja by watching ninja movies...*

2470
02:57:49,000 --> 02:57:54,000
*This whole situation feels like it's lifted straight out of some fiction novel.*

2471
02:57:54,000 --> 02:57:58,000
Rebecca: "You've never gone shopping... That's terrible..."

2472
02:57:58,000 --> 02:58:01,000
Mari: "Is it enjoyable to go shopping?"

2473
02:58:01,000 --> 02:58:06,000
Rebecca: "Th-Then, how about I take you shopping next time? We can go together!"

2474
02:58:06,000 --> 02:58:10,000
Mari: "C-Certainly, I shall accompany you in this venture!"

2475
02:58:10,000 --> 02:58:19,000
*It seems like a rather strange thing for them to be getting fired up about... but, well, I guess there's nothing wrong with that, either.*

2476
02:58:19,000 --> 02:58:25,000
Mari: "Oh, speaking of the diner... there is something I would like to ask you about."

2477
02:58:25,000 --> 02:58:26,000
Leon: "What is it?"

2478
02:58:26,000 --> 02:58:28,000
*I wonder what she wants to know.*

2479
02:58:28,000 --> 02:58:35,000
*I can certainly understand if she's curious about this peculiar arrangement we have of living together...*

2480
02:58:35,000 --> 02:58:42,000
Mari: "As far as I know, those living there include Sir Leon, Lucia, Aisia, Rebecca... and Momo. Is that all?"

2481
02:58:42,000 --> 02:58:44,000
Rebecca: "That's right."

2482
02:58:44,000 --> 02:58:47,000
Leon: "Yeah, you got everyone. What about it?"

2483
02:58:47,000 --> 02:58:48,000
Mari: "..."

2484
02:58:48,000 --> 02:58:51,000
*Mari's expression suddenly turns grim.*

2485
02:58:51,000 --> 02:58:55,000
Mari: "There were times when someone else was at the diner."

2486
02:58:55,000 --> 02:58:56,000
Rebecca: "Huh?"

2487
02:58:56,000 --> 02:58:58,000
Leon: "What... did you just say?"

2488
02:58:58,000 --> 02:58:59,000
*In other words...*

2489
02:58:59,000 --> 02:59:03,000
Mari: "There must have been an uninvited guest, then."

2490
02:59:03,000 --> 02:59:07,000
*...Not the most pleasant thought, but that must be the case.*

2491
02:59:07,000 --> 02:59:15,000
*Ever since the incident with the black suits, we've tried to pay attention to anything strange around the diner.*

2492
02:59:15,000 --> 02:59:19,000
*Despite that, somehow, someone must have still gotten in...*

2493
02:59:19,000 --> 02:59:27,000
Mari: "Of course, I cannot guarantee that it was a person. It may have simply been an animal that happened to find its way in."

2494
02:59:27,000 --> 02:59:31,000
Leon: "Doesn't hurt to be be cautious, though... Right?"

2495
02:59:31,000 --> 02:59:32,000
Mari: "Yes..."

2496
02:59:32,000 --> 02:59:33,000
*Mari nods firmly.*

2497
02:59:33,000 --> 02:59:37,000
Leon: "This timing, though... Right when Cullen isn't here."

2498
02:59:37,000 --> 02:59:40,000
Rebecca: "We can't just close the store, either..."

2499
02:59:40,000 --> 02:59:42,000
Leon: "Yeah, that's not an option."

2500
02:59:42,000 --> 02:59:49,000
*Our livelihood depends on keeping the store open, and we can't stop our daily deliveries, either.*

2501
02:59:49,000 --> 02:59:57,000
*Knowing that there are some unsettling things happening nearby, though, is going to make it very hard to focus.*

2502
02:59:57,000 --> 03:00:00,000
Mari: "Um... might I make a suggestion?"

2503
03:00:00,000 --> 03:00:02,000
*Mari timidly raises her hand.*

2504
03:00:02,000 --> 03:00:07,000
Mari: "Might I be employed to perform the task of guarding the diner?"

2505
03:00:07,000 --> 03:00:08,000
Leon: "Huh?"

2506
03:00:08,000 --> 03:00:11,000
Rebecca: "Guarding the diner... you say?"

2507
03:00:11,000 --> 03:00:21,000
Mari: "Uh, yes. I doubt I can do anything particularly impressive, but if any unseemly types get in, I should be able to at least fight them off."

2508
03:00:21,000 --> 03:00:24,000
*...That sounds pretty impressive already.*

2509
03:00:24,000 --> 03:00:30,000
*Not to mention Mari has more than proven herself capable with the incident at the Market.*

2510
03:00:30,000 --> 03:00:36,000
Leon: "Well, actually, we'd love to have you do that... but are you sure about this?"

2511
03:00:36,000 --> 03:00:40,000
Mari: "Yes. My services are yours, if only you would have me..."

2512
03:00:40,000 --> 03:00:44,000
Mari: "For the debt of bed and board must be repaid!"

2513
03:00:44,000 --> 03:00:48,000
*This ninja sure is particular about repaying her debts.*

2514
03:00:48,000 --> 03:00:56,000
*We're not really concerned about debts and repayments, but having her around will definitely make us feel safer.*

2515
03:00:56,000 --> 03:01:02,000
Leon: "And what about you, Rebecca? What... you think is a foregone conclusion, I guess."

2516
03:01:02,000 --> 03:01:08,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, one of these days, I'll have to make some clothes for you, too, Mari~"

2517
03:01:08,000 --> 03:01:12,000
Mari: "And thus did I cut short my departure and return!"

2518
03:01:12,000 --> 03:01:13,000
Lucia: "Welcome back."

2519
03:01:13,000 --> 03:01:15,000
Aisia: "That was pretty quick~"

2520
03:01:15,000 --> 03:01:17,000
*Both of them are smiling.*

2521
03:01:17,000 --> 03:01:21,000
Leon: "I have to say, neither of you look very surprised..."

2522
03:01:21,000 --> 03:01:24,000
Lucia: "I sort of figured it'd end up like this."

2523
03:01:24,000 --> 03:01:28,000
Aisia: "Leon's very good at making friends, after all~"

2524
03:01:28,000 --> 03:01:33,000
*Ugh, that innocent look in Aisia's eyes makes me feel a little guilty.*

2525
03:01:33,000 --> 03:01:37,000
*Aisia's probably just making an honest remark, but...*

2526
03:01:37,000 --> 03:01:41,000
Lucia: "Yeah, Leon is just so good at making friends..."

2527
03:01:41,000 --> 03:01:45,000
Leon: "Lucia, am I hearing some undertones in that statement?"

2528
03:01:45,000 --> 03:01:47,000
Lucia: "Oho, you caught on?"

2529
03:01:47,000 --> 03:01:48,000
*...Here we go.*

2530
03:01:48,000 --> 03:01:54,000
Mari: "U-Um, please be at ease! Sir Leon and I are not bound by that kind of relationship..."

2531
03:01:54,000 --> 03:01:59,000
Leon: "Okay, the way you said that definitely just made things worse!"

2532
03:01:59,000 --> 03:02:04,000
Lucia: "Right, not that kind of relationship... for now, right, Leon?"

2533
03:02:04,000 --> 03:02:08,000
*See? As expected, Lucia does not let the topic slide.*

2534
03:02:08,000 --> 03:02:13,000
Leon: "I asked Mari to come be our guard. It's a perfectly legitimate reason."

2535
03:02:13,000 --> 03:02:15,000
Lucia: "Yeah, yeah, of course."

2536
03:02:15,000 --> 03:02:21,000
*Considering she's totally doing this on purpose, Lucia's got one heck of a personality, too...*

2537
03:02:21,000 --> 03:02:25,000
Rebecca: "At any rate, this means we can all live together again~"

2538
03:02:25,000 --> 03:02:26,000
Momo: "Woof, woof!"

2539
03:02:26,000 --> 03:02:30,000
*Momo also seems elated as she wags her tail furiously.*

2540
03:02:30,000 --> 03:02:38,000
*It's not all rainbows and butterflies, of course. The actual reason behind Mari's stay this time is a little less pleasant.*

2541
03:02:38,000 --> 03:02:44,000
*At the very least, I'll need to talk to Lucia and Aisia properly so they know what's going on.*

2542
03:02:44,000 --> 03:02:51,000
Lucia: "I, for one, was not expecting to put the bed away, and then immediately need to get it out again."

2543
03:02:51,000 --> 03:02:55,000
Aisia: "There's no shortage of fun and excitement in our home."

2544
03:02:55,000 --> 03:02:59,000
*On the first floor, Rebecca is sorting through Mari's belongings.*

2545
03:02:59,000 --> 03:03:04,000
*On the second floor, preparations are underway to turn the couch into a bed.*

2546
03:03:04,000 --> 03:03:07,000
*It almost feels like we're having a sleepover...*

2547
03:03:07,000 --> 03:03:11,000
*But the truth is, there are more troubling matters in play.*

2548
03:03:11,000 --> 03:03:12,000
Leon: "Lucia, Aisia."

2549
03:03:12,000 --> 03:03:13,000
Lucia: "Hm?"

2550
03:03:13,000 --> 03:03:14,000
Aisia: "Yes?"

2551
03:03:14,000 --> 03:03:20,000
Leon: "I sort of mentioned it earlier... but there seems to be some trouble brewing around us."

2552
03:03:20,000 --> 03:03:22,000
Lucia: "...Yeah, I know."

2553
03:03:22,000 --> 03:03:23,000
Aisia: "Yes..."

2554
03:03:23,000 --> 03:03:32,000
Leon: "The specifics will probably have to wait until Cullen gets back, but in the meantime, let's keep an eye out for each other."

2555
03:03:32,000 --> 03:03:38,000
Lucia: "Got it. We should take turns doing the rounds and checking our surroundings."

2556
03:03:38,000 --> 03:03:44,000
Aisia: "Yes. We have Mari with us now, too. Let's watch for any strange people who come."

2557
03:03:44,000 --> 03:03:47,000
Leon: "Yeah, we'll all keep our eyes open."

2558
03:03:47,000 --> 03:03:54,000
*Unfortunately, we don't have the slightest idea what is currently happening to us, or what is about to happen.*

2559
03:03:54,000 --> 03:03:58,000
*However, we still want to protect this modest life of ours.*

2560
03:03:58,000 --> 03:04:06,000
*That's why, even if we're merely indulging in the illusion of control, we have to prepare ourselves in whatever way we can...*

2561
03:04:06,000 --> 03:04:10,000
Lucia: "Aren't you glad we have everyone with us, Leon?"

2562
03:04:10,000 --> 03:04:11,000
Leon: "Yeah..."

2563
03:04:11,000 --> 03:04:18,000
Lucia: "If I was by myself, I probably would have been so scared that I'd have lost it a long time ago."

2564
03:04:18,000 --> 03:04:22,000
Lucia: "With everyone here, though, it helps keep my mind off it."

2565
03:04:22,000 --> 03:04:28,000
*Before Aisia came, Lucia was the kind of girl to jump at a particularly strong gust of wind.*

2566
03:04:28,000 --> 03:04:33,000
*Now, I think she's become quite dependable?almost like an older sibling.*

2567
03:04:33,000 --> 03:04:38,000
Aisia: "Hehehe, that's right~ Lucia can even go to the bathroom by herself now."

2568
03:04:38,000 --> 03:04:43,000
Lucia: "Ah, Aisia! You don't have to bring that up right now, even if it's true!"

2569
03:04:43,000 --> 03:04:49,000
Aisia: "Don't you think this is the perfect time to bring that up? It's a good thing, after all."

2570
03:04:49,000 --> 03:04:58,000
Lucia: "But... But that's the same as telling people I couldn't go by myself before! Listen, Leon, there's a good reason for this."

2571
03:04:58,000 --> 03:05:04,000
Leon: "...Actually, I'd say hearing that made me appreciate how much you've matured."

2572
03:05:04,000 --> 03:05:07,000
Lucia: "Geez! You people! I hate you all!"

2573
03:05:07,000 --> 03:05:13,000
*Lucia dashes away, escaping down the stairs. The embarrassment must have gotten to her.*

2574
03:05:13,000 --> 03:05:16,000
Aisia: "Ah, Lucia's running away! Stop~"

2575
03:05:16,000 --> 03:05:23,000
Leon: "...Well, I guess this is fine. Overthinking things will only make everyone more gloomy, after all."

2576
03:05:23,000 --> 03:05:27,000
*I like this atmosphere, to be honest. It's just right.*

2577
03:05:27,000 --> 03:05:34,000
*On top of that, the one our unidentified assailant is after seems to be not the girls, but rather, me.*

2578
03:05:34,000 --> 03:05:37,000
Leon: "I'd better be more careful from now on..."

2579
03:05:37,000 --> 03:05:43,000
*Mari's sleeping quarters are quickly prepared and soon after, it's time for dinner.*

2580
03:05:43,000 --> 03:05:47,000
*In the midst of our meal, Aisia suddenly makes an odd request.*

2581
03:05:47,000 --> 03:05:48,000
Aisia: "Excuse me!"

2582
03:05:48,000 --> 03:05:51,000
Aisia: "Mari, I would like to ask you a favor."

2583
03:05:51,000 --> 03:05:59,000
Mari: "Y-Yes, what do you need of me? As I have mentioned before, there is but a simple relationship between Sir Leon and me."

2584
03:05:59,000 --> 03:06:02,000
Leon: "Stop talking about that already!"

2585
03:06:02,000 --> 03:06:05,000
*Mari sure took that topic to heart...*

2586
03:06:05,000 --> 03:06:09,000
Aisia: "Um, I was wondering if you could teach us ninjutsu."

2587
03:06:09,000 --> 03:06:10,000
Mari: "What?"

2588
03:06:10,000 --> 03:06:11,000
Leon: "N-Ninjutsu?"

2589
03:06:11,000 --> 03:06:13,000
Lucia: "A-Aisia, are you serious?"

2590
03:06:13,000 --> 03:06:14,000
Aisia: "Of course."

2591
03:06:14,000 --> 03:06:16,000
*Aisia nods with a bright smile.*

2592
03:06:16,000 --> 03:06:23,000
Aisia: "Since Mari is going to be staying with us for a while, I figured we might as well learn from her!"

2593
03:06:23,000 --> 03:06:28,000
Lucia: "You know, I'm also sort of curious about what kind of things she does."

2594
03:06:28,000 --> 03:06:33,000
Rebecca: "I want to know, too! I want to know everything about Mari!"

2595
03:06:33,000 --> 03:06:39,000
Leon: "All right, well, I don't mind as long as you're okay with it, Mari. What do you think?"

2596
03:06:39,000 --> 03:06:47,000
*The question seems to have taken Mari completely by surprise, causing her to freeze with a plate of soup in her hands...*

2597
03:06:47,000 --> 03:06:51,000
Mari: "U-Um, first, allow me to... Gulp, gulp, gulp... Phew!"

2598
03:06:51,000 --> 03:06:55,000
*She drinks the soup in one go and sets the plate on the table.*

2599
03:06:55,000 --> 03:07:01,000
Mari: "U-Understood. Then, if I may be so bold, please allow me to teach you my techniques!"

2600
03:07:01,000 --> 03:07:02,000
Aisia: "Yay!"

2601
03:07:02,000 --> 03:07:05,000
Leon: "I wonder if this is really a good idea..."

2602
03:07:05,000 --> 03:07:11,000
*So, at the urging of Aisia, we promptly set up a ninja school and enroll ourselves.*

2603
03:07:11,000 --> 03:07:12,000
*The next morning.*

2604
03:07:12,000 --> 03:07:17,000
*After a light breakfast, the entire diner staff is gathered outside.*

2605
03:07:17,000 --> 03:07:27,000
*Facing us is our teacher who, if it wasn't for her tiny stature, would have cut a dashing figure. Nevertheless, she stands confidently in her ninja garb.*

2606
03:07:27,000 --> 03:07:30,000
*Her long scarf dances in the dry wind.*

2607
03:07:30,000 --> 03:07:34,000
Mari: "Today, I shall teach everyone how to throw a shuriken!"

2608
03:07:34,000 --> 03:07:38,000
Aisia: "Wow, we're diving straight into the serious stuff~"

2609
03:07:38,000 --> 03:07:42,000
Rebecca: "I thought we would start with something more basic."

2610
03:07:42,000 --> 03:07:46,000
Lucia: "Yeah, like practicing how to move quickly or something..."

2611
03:07:46,000 --> 03:07:52,000
Mari: "There certainly are such training regimens, but they, um... are rather time-consuming."

2612
03:07:52,000 --> 03:07:54,000
Lucia: "...You've got a point."

2613
03:07:54,000 --> 03:08:01,000
Rebecca: "Yes, I think it would be a tad difficult for us to, say, spend a few years doing morning jogging."

2614
03:08:01,000 --> 03:08:07,000
Mari: "Therefore, I endeavored to select skills that are both useful and quick to learn!"

2615
03:08:07,000 --> 03:08:13,000
Lucia: "In what kind of situation would it be useful to know how to throw shuriken?"

2616
03:08:13,000 --> 03:08:18,000
Rebecca: "If we're at the diner, we can perhaps try throwing knives?"

2617
03:08:18,000 --> 03:08:22,000
Leon: "Um, this conversation is getting rather violent..."

2618
03:08:22,000 --> 03:08:27,000
*I suppose it's okay if I just consider this a self-defense technique.*

2619
03:08:27,000 --> 03:08:35,000
Mari: "First of all, there are various kinds of shuriken, including four-pointed, eight-pointed, and cross-shaped."

2620
03:08:35,000 --> 03:08:43,000
Mari: "The ones I use are known as bo-shuriken, which are almost like rods. Now, this way, please! Let us practice!"

2621
03:08:43,000 --> 03:08:48,000
*Our target is a wooden board we placed at the side of the parking lot.*

2622
03:08:48,000 --> 03:08:52,000
*A few lines have been drawn with chalk to create simple markings.*

2623
03:08:52,000 --> 03:08:55,000
Leon: "Mari, could you show us an example, first?"

2624
03:08:55,000 --> 03:08:59,000
Mari: "Ah, certainly, though there is not much to see..."

2625
03:08:59,000 --> 03:09:04,000
*As she talks, Mari takes about ten shuriken in her hands and readies them.*

2626
03:09:04,000 --> 03:09:06,000
Mari: "Now, then, here I... go!"

2627
03:09:06,000 --> 03:09:10,000
*Every last one strikes the target almost dead center.*

2628
03:09:10,000 --> 03:09:11,000
Lucia: "W-Wow!"

2629
03:09:11,000 --> 03:09:16,000
Rebecca: "So this is what it's like to see the real thing in action..."

2630
03:09:16,000 --> 03:09:18,000
Aisia: "Kyaa, Mari, you're so cool!"

2631
03:09:18,000 --> 03:09:20,000
Mari: "S-Such praise is undeserved!"

2632
03:09:20,000 --> 03:09:23,000
*Mari seems embarrassed by our compliments.*

2633
03:09:23,000 --> 03:09:28,000
Mari: "W-Well, then, let us begin! Shall we have Rebecca take the first turn?"

2634
03:09:28,000 --> 03:09:29,000
Rebecca: "Absolutely!"

2635
03:09:29,000 --> 03:09:34,000
Mari: "Before you throw, face your target and pull your arm straight back."

2636
03:09:34,000 --> 03:09:36,000
Rebecca: "Um... Like this?"

2637
03:09:36,000 --> 03:09:41,000
Mari: "Ah, your arm is slightly tilted. Could you move it this way a little?"

2638
03:09:41,000 --> 03:09:48,000
Mari: "If your arm is tilted left or right at this point, you will end up throwing in a strange direction."

2639
03:09:48,000 --> 03:09:51,000
Rebecca: "Th-This is quite difficult..."

2640
03:09:51,000 --> 03:09:54,000
Mari: "Now, go ahead. Try throwing it."

2641
03:09:54,000 --> 03:09:56,000
Rebecca: "A-All right... There!"

2642
03:09:56,000 --> 03:10:01,000
*The shuriken leaves Rebecca's hand and heads in a straight line...*

2643
03:10:01,000 --> 03:10:02,000
Rebecca: "O-Oh my..."

2644
03:10:02,000 --> 03:10:06,000
*Going right over the board as it flies off into the distance.*

2645
03:10:06,000 --> 03:10:10,000
Mari: "Hmm, your posture during the throw was a little off..."

2646
03:10:10,000 --> 03:10:13,000
Rebecca: "I-I see. I'll be careful next time..."

2647
03:10:13,000 --> 03:10:15,000
Lucia: "Okay, I'm up next. There!"

2648
03:10:15,000 --> 03:10:19,000
*Lucia's shuriken fails to even head toward the board...*

2649
03:10:19,000 --> 03:10:21,000
Lucia: "Huh? H-How did it..."

2650
03:10:21,000 --> 03:10:26,000
*It flipped through the air and went heavily off-target to the left.*

2651
03:10:26,000 --> 03:10:30,000
Mari: "Um, I believe you let go of the shuriken a little late..."

2652
03:10:30,000 --> 03:10:33,000
Lucia: "I-I need one more try. Next time, I'll..."

2653
03:10:33,000 --> 03:10:36,000
Aisia: "All right, it's my turn to give it a go!"

2654
03:10:36,000 --> 03:10:37,000
Aisia: "There!"

2655
03:10:37,000 --> 03:10:38,000
Leon: "Whoa."

2656
03:10:38,000 --> 03:10:41,000
*Aisia's shuriken flies the smoothest so far.*

2657
03:10:41,000 --> 03:10:45,000
*However, it lands wide to the right of the board...*

2658
03:10:45,000 --> 03:10:50,000
Mari: "I-It seems that you were slightly facing the wrong direction..."

2659
03:10:50,000 --> 03:10:53,000
Aisia: "Oh, dear... Hm, that didn't work."

2660
03:10:53,000 --> 03:10:59,000
*...Something tells me we've got a long way to go before we pose any actual threat to people.*

2661
03:10:59,000 --> 03:11:02,000
Rebecca: "A-All right, then. Time for round two~"

2662
03:11:02,000 --> 03:11:03,000
Lucia: "M-Me, too!"

2663
03:11:03,000 --> 03:11:05,000
Rebecca: "...Not even close."

2664
03:11:05,000 --> 03:11:12,000
Lucia: "...I must have thrown a hundred of these things already and I've only hit the board twice."

2665
03:11:12,000 --> 03:11:17,000
Mari: "W-Well, practice has only just begun. There is no need to worry."

2666
03:11:17,000 --> 03:11:25,000
*Though Mari tries to be encouraging, she also seems a little taken aback by the two's sheer lack of physical dexterity.*

2667
03:11:25,000 --> 03:11:32,000
*To be honest, I feel like we might be dealing with a more fundamental problem than just lack of practice.*

2668
03:11:32,000 --> 03:11:36,000
Leon: "Okay, how about we call it a day for this practice?"

2669
03:11:36,000 --> 03:11:39,000
*I suggest wrapping up the practice session.*

2670
03:11:39,000 --> 03:11:40,000
Aisia: "Hmm..."

2671
03:11:40,000 --> 03:11:43,000
*Aisia seems to be pondering something.*

2672
03:11:43,000 --> 03:11:50,000
*After about ten or so throws, it seemed like she started to change her posture and try out various forms.*

2673
03:11:50,000 --> 03:11:54,000
Aisia: "Sorry, but may I try throwing it a few more times?"

2674
03:11:54,000 --> 03:11:59,000
*Just when we're about to finish up, she suddenly requests another go.*

2675
03:11:59,000 --> 03:12:01,000
Leon: "Uh, sure, I guess."

2676
03:12:01,000 --> 03:12:05,000
Mari: "Certainly! It is always good to practice, so go ahead!"

2677
03:12:05,000 --> 03:12:08,000
*Mari hands Aisia ten or so shurikens.*

2678
03:12:08,000 --> 03:12:10,000
Aisia: "Okay, here I go..."

2679
03:12:10,000 --> 03:12:13,000
*Then, when I see her stance, it occurs to me.*

2680
03:12:13,000 --> 03:12:14,000
Leon: "Oh, right."

2681
03:12:14,000 --> 03:12:18,000
*I finally remember that Aisia has a certain "ability".*

2682
03:12:18,000 --> 03:12:20,000
Aisia: "There! There! There!"

2683
03:12:20,000 --> 03:12:21,000
*The next instant...*

2684
03:12:21,000 --> 03:12:25,000
Mari: "I-Incredible... Every throw... is on the mark."

2685
03:12:25,000 --> 03:12:29,000
*She puts on a performance that leaves even Mari stunned.*

2686
03:12:29,000 --> 03:12:30,000
Aisia: "Yay!"

2687
03:12:30,000 --> 03:12:35,000
Rebecca: "Amazing, Aisia! I never knew you had such a marvelous talent!"

2688
03:12:35,000 --> 03:12:38,000
*Talent... isn't quite the right word for it...*

2689
03:12:38,000 --> 03:12:41,000
Lucia: "...Leon, is this what I think it is?"

2690
03:12:41,000 --> 03:12:44,000
Leon: "Yeah, it just occurred to me, too."

2691
03:12:44,000 --> 03:12:51,000
*While Aisia and Rebecca hold each other's hands and rejoice, Mari watches from the side with her mouth agape.*

2692
03:12:51,000 --> 03:12:54,000
*I walk up and tap her on the shoulder.*

2693
03:12:54,000 --> 03:12:55,000
Leon: "Hey, Mari."

2694
03:12:55,000 --> 03:12:57,000
Mari: "U-Um, Sir Leon..."

2695
03:12:57,000 --> 03:13:07,000
*Shock and awe is written all over Mari's face. It's the kind of expression one wears after bearing witness to something thoroughly confounding.*

2696
03:13:07,000 --> 03:13:08,000
Mari: "This is, um..."

2697
03:13:08,000 --> 03:13:12,000
Leon: "Hold that thought. Let me say something first."

2698
03:13:12,000 --> 03:13:13,000
Mari: "C-Certainly."

2699
03:13:13,000 --> 03:13:23,000
Leon: "Just to be clear, Aisia was not a retired ninja and she did not belong to some shadowy organization before. It's nothing like that, okay?"

2700
03:13:23,000 --> 03:13:24,000
Mari: "..."

2701
03:13:24,000 --> 03:13:31,000
Mari: "Th-Then, what is behind that entirely unnatural speed at which she improved? I simply must know!"

2702
03:13:31,000 --> 03:13:34,000
*I get how you feel, Mari. I totally get you.*

2703
03:13:34,000 --> 03:13:38,000
*But unfortunately, it's just as much of a mystery to me...*

2704
03:13:38,000 --> 03:13:41,000
*And so, our day of ninja schooling...*

2705
03:13:41,000 --> 03:13:44,000
Aisia: "So, like this, and like this, right?"

2706
03:13:44,000 --> 03:13:51,000
Mari: "How? I have barely taught you anything and you are already jumping onto rooftops! How is this happening?"

2707
03:13:51,000 --> 03:14:02,000
*...ends with one student demonstrating a completely outrageous degree of improvement to the continued bewilderment of her poor tutor. It was eventful, to say the least.*

2708
03:14:02,000 --> 03:14:06,000
Mari: "Ooh, I see that there are a variety of games here."

2709
03:14:06,000 --> 03:14:07,000
*That night.*

2710
03:14:07,000 --> 03:14:15,000
*While we are preparing for bed, Mari shows some interest in our video games, so we decide to play them together.*

2711
03:14:15,000 --> 03:14:18,000
Rebecca: "Did you play games, too, Mari?"

2712
03:14:18,000 --> 03:14:24,000
Mari: "I did, indeed. 'Ninja-man' from WPL, and 'Ninja Raiden' from Decmo, for example..."

2713
03:14:24,000 --> 03:14:26,000
Leon: "No surprise there."

2714
03:14:26,000 --> 03:14:31,000
*I'll bet she's played stuff like Striver and Ninja MattariMaru-kun, too.*

2715
03:14:31,000 --> 03:14:34,000
Leon: "How many non-ninja games have you played?"

2716
03:14:34,000 --> 03:14:35,000
Mari: "None at all!"

2717
03:14:35,000 --> 03:14:38,000
*Yeah, definitely saw that one coming.*

2718
03:14:38,000 --> 03:14:43,000
*I'd guess a significant portion of her world revolves around ninjas.*

2719
03:14:43,000 --> 03:14:49,000
Lucia: "Well, Mari, since you're here, would you like to have a go at the games, too?"

2720
03:14:49,000 --> 03:14:51,000
Mari: "Most certainly!"

2721
03:14:51,000 --> 03:14:54,000
Lucia: "In that case, how about this..."

2722
03:14:54,000 --> 03:14:56,000
*Lucia pulls out a game.*

2723
03:14:56,000 --> 03:14:57,000
Leon: "Ah?"

2724
03:14:57,000 --> 03:15:00,000
*Lucia stops me before I can say more.*

2725
03:15:00,000 --> 03:15:08,000
Leon: "You know she already plays nothing but ninja games, right? Do you want to turn her off other games even more?"

2726
03:15:08,000 --> 03:15:13,000
Lucia: "Y-You think? ...I'm sort of curious about how she'll react."

2727
03:15:13,000 --> 03:15:16,000
*Meanwhile, a title screen appears on the display.*

2728
03:15:16,000 --> 03:15:19,000
Mari: "Rou Obu Za Iisuto, I see! How exciting~"

2729
03:15:19,000 --> 03:15:23,000
Rebecca: "Law of the East... I wonder what kind of game this is."

2730
03:15:23,000 --> 03:15:25,000
Aisia: "Oh, that game... Hehe."

2731
03:15:25,000 --> 03:15:30,000
*Aisia seems to have caught on, as well. She grins and says nothing.*

2732
03:15:30,000 --> 03:15:35,000
*...I wonder if everyone has the same reaction when they play this game.*

2733
03:15:35,000 --> 03:15:39,000
Mari: "Aah, game over. It ended with me being shot again!"

2734
03:15:39,000 --> 03:15:46,000
Rebecca: "That's too bad. It must have been the answer you gave two questions ago that was no good."

2735
03:15:46,000 --> 03:15:52,000
Mari: "A-Allow me one further attempt! This time, I shall do my duty as a sheriff!"

2736
03:15:52,000 --> 03:15:54,000
Rebecca: "I'm rooting for you, Mari~"

2737
03:15:54,000 --> 03:15:57,000
Lucia: "...Wow. They're actually enjoying it."

2738
03:15:57,000 --> 03:16:01,000
Leon: "I guess you have to be the right kind of person to play it?"

2739
03:16:01,000 --> 03:16:04,000
Aisia: "Well, I quite liked it, remember?"

2740
03:16:04,000 --> 03:16:09,000
*...I can't really tell what would make you the "right kind of person", though.*

2741
03:16:09,000 --> 03:16:14,000
*In the end, Mari and Rebecca have a blast playing the game through to its end.*

2742
03:16:14,000 --> 03:16:15,000
Mari: "That was fun!"

2743
03:16:15,000 --> 03:16:22,000
Rebecca: "It was a tad short, but the way you had to pick and choose your actions was interesting."

2744
03:16:22,000 --> 03:16:26,000
Leon: "Well, we're glad you enjoyed it, right, Lucia?"

2745
03:16:26,000 --> 03:16:27,000
Lucia: "R-Right..."

2746
03:16:27,000 --> 03:16:31,000
*At the end of our gaming session, Lucia still seems unconvinced.*

2747
03:16:31,000 --> 03:16:36,000
*...Will there ever come a day when she learns to appreciate the game?*

2748
03:16:36,000 --> 03:16:40,000
Aisia: "Do you go around scavenging Relics, too, Mari?"

2749
03:16:40,000 --> 03:16:47,000
*Around these parts, you can't stick a shovel in the ground without turning up some sort of Relic.*

2750
03:16:47,000 --> 03:16:56,000
*Sometimes, you can happen upon entire warehouses that were buried, inside which are machines that have gone untouched for ages.*

2751
03:16:56,000 --> 03:17:01,000
*Our game console and Mari's video discs were all discovered like that.*

2752
03:17:01,000 --> 03:17:07,000
Mari: "Among the Relics I have discovered, one of them was known as a 'Tentendo Twitch'."

2753
03:17:07,000 --> 03:17:08,000
Lucia: "What's that?"

2754
03:17:08,000 --> 03:17:12,000
Mari: "I cannot say, though it did appear to be a game console."

2755
03:17:12,000 --> 03:17:14,000
Leon: "Huh... I haven't heard of it."

2756
03:17:14,000 --> 03:17:16,000
*Maybe it's a relatively new Relic.*

2757
03:17:16,000 --> 03:17:22,000
*Depending on where and how they're found, the Relics can be from vastly different times.*

2758
03:17:22,000 --> 03:17:24,000
Aisia: "What kind of machine was it?"

2759
03:17:24,000 --> 03:17:32,000
Mari: "Uh, it had a kind of small screen that you could carry with you, and the controllers were attached to it."

2760
03:17:32,000 --> 03:17:34,000
Leon: "So, it's a handheld device?"

2761
03:17:34,000 --> 03:17:38,000
Mari: "Not quite. It also had a cord for plugging into the TV..."

2762
03:17:38,000 --> 03:17:41,000
Lucia: "What? You mean it could do both?"

2763
03:17:41,000 --> 03:17:48,000
Mari: "Indeed. That allowed me to take the screen and controllers with me when I was going outside."

2764
03:17:48,000 --> 03:17:53,000
Leon: "That Relic must have been made after the technology improved..."

2765
03:17:53,000 --> 03:18:01,000
*Even a primitive game console like the one we have is impossible to recreate with our current scientific capabilities.*

2766
03:18:01,000 --> 03:18:07,000
*It's hard to imagine just how advanced a civilization there must have been in the past.*

2767
03:18:07,000 --> 03:18:14,000
*That's probably also why people like Cullen are devoting so much time and effort to investigating them.*

2768
03:18:14,000 --> 03:18:15,000
Mari: "Fwaaaa~"

2769
03:18:15,000 --> 03:18:18,000
*Mari suddenly opens her mouth wide and yawns.*

2770
03:18:18,000 --> 03:18:21,000
Mari: "Ah, my apologies. That was most unseemly..."

2771
03:18:21,000 --> 03:18:24,000
Rebecca: "Mmmhmhm, you're so adorable..."

2772
03:18:24,000 --> 03:18:31,000
Leon: "Personal space, Rebecca. Remember the personal space. Also, it's pretty late. Should we turn in?"

2773
03:18:31,000 --> 03:18:34,000
Lucia: "Sure. I'll get the lights, then?"

2774
03:18:34,000 --> 03:18:35,000
Aisia: "Okay."

2775
03:18:35,000 --> 03:18:44,000
*And so, Mari becomes a part of our daily lives. However, the reason she's here?that extra presence that concerned us?remains unseen.*

2776
03:18:44,000 --> 03:18:47,000
*Of course, we're going out on patrols every day.*

2777
03:18:47,000 --> 03:18:53,000
*Still, we find nothing out of the ordinary, and gradually, our caution begins to slip.*

2778
03:18:53,000 --> 03:18:57,000
*Finally, on the fourth night after Mari's arrival...*

2779
03:18:57,000 --> 03:19:00,000
Mari: "I have done the rounds for today."

2780
03:19:00,000 --> 03:19:03,000
Leon: "Thanks. Here, this is for you."

2781
03:19:03,000 --> 03:19:07,000
*As a gesture of appreciation, I hand Mari a cup full of soup.*

2782
03:19:07,000 --> 03:19:09,000
Mari: "For me? ...Are you sure?"

2783
03:19:09,000 --> 03:19:12,000
Leon: "Of course. That's why I made it, after all."

2784
03:19:12,000 --> 03:19:14,000
Mari: "Wow, thank you very much."

2785
03:19:14,000 --> 03:19:17,000
*Mari happily brings the cup to her mouth.*

2786
03:19:17,000 --> 03:19:18,000
Mari: "Ow! Hot..."

2787
03:19:18,000 --> 03:19:22,000
Leon: "Whoa, careful there. Don't drink it too fast."

2788
03:19:22,000 --> 03:19:24,000
Mari: "M-My apologies..."

2789
03:19:24,000 --> 03:19:28,000
*Mari puffs at the soup to cool it while taking small sips.*

2790
03:19:28,000 --> 03:19:33,000
Leon: "Have you noticed the presence of anything foreign since you came here?"

2791
03:19:33,000 --> 03:19:38,000
Mari: "No, not at all. I apologize for causing such a commotion over it."

2792
03:19:38,000 --> 03:19:44,000
Leon: "Nah, it's best to take precautions and have it go to waste. That means nothing happened."

2793
03:19:44,000 --> 03:19:48,000
*After all, the prior incident came completely out of the blue.*

2794
03:19:48,000 --> 03:19:54,000
*Having Mari carefully patrol our perimeter like this should help everyone feel safer.*

2795
03:19:54,000 --> 03:19:59,000
Leon: "Oh, but make sure you sleep properly, too. Everyone's worried about you."

2796
03:19:59,000 --> 03:20:03,000
Mari: "U-Understood... It does not bother me, though."

2797
03:20:03,000 --> 03:20:08,000
Leon: "No, it'll defeat the point if you end up getting sick because of that."

2798
03:20:08,000 --> 03:20:09,000
Mari: "..."

2799
03:20:09,000 --> 03:20:11,000
*For a moment, Mari falls silent.*

2800
03:20:11,000 --> 03:20:13,000
Leon: "Hm? What's wrong?"

2801
03:20:13,000 --> 03:20:18,000
Mari: "Oh, nothing... Some memories just happened to come back to me."

2802
03:20:18,000 --> 03:20:24,000
Mari: "It has been so very long since I have shared hearth and home with others..."

2803
03:20:24,000 --> 03:20:25,000
Leon: "...Mari?"

2804
03:20:25,000 --> 03:20:28,000
Mari: "Sir Leon, may I... sit over there?"

2805
03:20:28,000 --> 03:20:30,000
Leon: "Sure. Come over."

2806
03:20:30,000 --> 03:20:32,000
Mari: "Excuse me, then..."

2807
03:20:32,000 --> 03:20:35,000
*Mari walks over and plops down beside me.*

2808
03:20:35,000 --> 03:20:40,000
*Up close, her frame appears smaller than ever. Surprisingly small, really.*

2809
03:20:40,000 --> 03:20:43,000
Mari: "Um... may I ask you something?"

2810
03:20:43,000 --> 03:20:44,000
Leon: "About what?"

2811
03:20:44,000 --> 03:20:47,000
Mari: "This might be an unpleasant question, but..."

2812
03:20:47,000 --> 03:20:50,000
Mari: "Do you have any family, Sir Leon?"

2813
03:20:50,000 --> 03:20:55,000
Leon: "Family, huh... The people living here right now are my family."

2814
03:20:55,000 --> 03:20:58,000
Mari: "You mean Lucia, Aisia, and Rebecca?"

2815
03:20:58,000 --> 03:21:05,000
Leon: "Yeah. Also, there's Cullen, who's out of town right now. However, none of us are related by blood."

2816
03:21:05,000 --> 03:21:06,000
Mari: "Ah..."

2817
03:21:06,000 --> 03:21:08,000
*I tell Mari our story.*

2818
03:21:08,000 --> 03:21:15,000
*I tell her about my mother and father... About Lucia and Aisia... About Cullen... and about Rebecca.*

2819
03:21:15,000 --> 03:21:18,000
*The whole time, Mari listens intently.*

2820
03:21:18,000 --> 03:21:22,000
Mari: "That must have been a difficult story to tell. I apologize."

2821
03:21:22,000 --> 03:21:28,000
Leon: "It's not that bad. Besides, by now, I really do consider everyone my real family."

2822
03:21:28,000 --> 03:21:31,000
*Mari nods. There is a pause before she continues.*

2823
03:21:31,000 --> 03:21:33,000
Mari: "I... also have no parents."

2824
03:21:33,000 --> 03:21:36,000
*Her words escape her in almost a whisper.*

2825
03:21:36,000 --> 03:21:38,000
Leon: "Did they... pass away?"

2826
03:21:38,000 --> 03:21:41,000
*Mari shakes her head and forces a smile.*

2827
03:21:41,000 --> 03:21:48,000
Mari: "Even that is unknown to me. I had been in the town orphanage for as long as I could remember."

2828
03:21:48,000 --> 03:21:49,000
Leon: "I see..."

2829
03:21:49,000 --> 03:21:55,000
Mari: "At some point, though, I got fed up with it... and I have not had a home since."

2830
03:21:55,000 --> 03:22:02,000
*At first, she stayed in the town, but over time, both food and clothing became difficult to come by.*

2831
03:22:02,000 --> 03:22:11,000
*Having no intention of ever returning to the orphanage, she set her sights on some faraway town and snuck onto the back of a truck.*

2832
03:22:11,000 --> 03:22:14,000
Mari: "That is how I happened upon that building."

2833
03:22:14,000 --> 03:22:20,000
*With the truck stalled due to engine problems, she took a leap of faith and got off.*

2834
03:22:20,000 --> 03:22:24,000
*I can't even begin to imagine what that must have been like.*

2835
03:22:24,000 --> 03:22:28,000
*What if that building didn't have a power plant or garden?*

2836
03:22:28,000 --> 03:22:38,000
*She was still a child, devoid of any prudence or foresight. Every decision she made could have been her last. That was the kind of life she led...*

2837
03:22:38,000 --> 03:22:42,000
Leon: "You were... really lucky to have picked that building."

2838
03:22:42,000 --> 03:22:51,000
Mari: "Indeed, it was pure coincidence that the building was equipped with those facilities. It was a whim of fate that kept me alive."

2839
03:22:51,000 --> 03:22:58,000
Mari: "After rummaging through all the other rooms, I managed to gather enough things to survive... But..."

2840
03:22:58,000 --> 03:22:59,000
Leon: "But?"

2841
03:22:59,000 --> 03:23:05,000
Mari: "Well... I could survive, but truly, that was it. It afforded me nothing more."

2842
03:23:05,000 --> 03:23:06,000
Leon: "Ah... I see."

2843
03:23:06,000 --> 03:23:14,000
*People can't live on only food and water. We have desires. We want someone to talk to, or at least some recreation.*

2844
03:23:14,000 --> 03:23:22,000
Mari: "Then, when I was looking around for Relics, I discovered a mountain of video discs that were all films of my master!"

2845
03:23:22,000 --> 03:23:26,000
Leon: "And... Ah! That's how you became so obsessed with ninjas!"

2846
03:23:26,000 --> 03:23:29,000
Mari: "Indeed, and now we have come full circle!"

2847
03:23:29,000 --> 03:23:35,000
*...To be honest, I had no idea what kind of story would have taken us to where we stand now.*

2848
03:23:35,000 --> 03:23:41,000
*But seeing the threads taken apart one by one, the whole thing does make sense now.*

2849
03:23:41,000 --> 03:23:46,000
Mari: "My master's films were everything to me. They were my whole world."

2850
03:23:46,000 --> 03:23:52,000
*The reason she treasures ninjas and her master so much... is because she had nothing else.*

2851
03:23:52,000 --> 03:23:59,000
*The reason she poured her heart into her ninja training... is because there was no other refuge.*

2852
03:23:59,000 --> 03:24:05,000
*That weird way she talks must also be the result of watching so many period pieces from Japan.*

2853
03:24:05,000 --> 03:24:09,000
Leon: "Wow, you really told me a lot about yourself."

2854
03:24:09,000 --> 03:24:14,000
Mari: "M-My apologies. Never before did I have someone I could tell this to..."

2855
03:24:14,000 --> 03:24:22,000
Leon: "There's nothing to apologize for. I'm glad you told me. Feel free to tell me more, too. I'll always be happy to listen."

2856
03:24:22,000 --> 03:24:23,000
Mari: "Sir Leon..."

2857
03:24:23,000 --> 03:24:25,000
*Something glistens in Mari's eyes.*

2858
03:24:25,000 --> 03:24:29,000
Mari: "If I may be so bold, could I make one more request?"

2859
03:24:29,000 --> 03:24:31,000
Leon: "Sure. Let's hear it."

2860
03:24:31,000 --> 03:24:35,000
Mari: "My master's films have left me with one regret."

2861
03:24:35,000 --> 03:24:37,000
Leon: "Huh... What is it?"

2862
03:24:37,000 --> 03:24:42,000
Mari: "One of the films in which my master appears is called 'The Execution'..."

2863
03:24:42,000 --> 03:24:48,000
Leon: "Oh, I know that one. If memory serves, Toba's the head of a ninja village and..."

2864
03:24:48,000 --> 03:24:54,000
Mari: "Yes, yes! And during the finale in part nine, the village is completely destroyed."

2865
03:24:54,000 --> 03:25:01,000
Leon: "That's when Toba says to the remaining villagers, 'Even if you are alone, be strong and live on'..."

2866
03:25:01,000 --> 03:25:06,000
Mari: "Yes! That is why I have always kept that message close to my heart."

2867
03:25:06,000 --> 03:25:12,000
Leon: "I see. So, all those years when you were alone, that's how you kept yourself going."

2868
03:25:12,000 --> 03:25:16,000
Mari: "The warmth of my master's message keeps me strong."

2869
03:25:16,000 --> 03:25:19,000
*A hint of pride flashes across Mari's smile.*

2870
03:25:19,000 --> 03:25:24,000
Mari: "However, the final film of that series was not among the Relics I found."

2871
03:25:24,000 --> 03:25:26,000
Leon: "Huh? Then, the last one is..."

2872
03:25:26,000 --> 03:25:30,000
Mari: "Yes. I have yet to watch it... That is what I regret."

2873
03:25:30,000 --> 03:25:31,000
Leon: "...I see."

2874
03:25:31,000 --> 03:25:39,000
*Considering how much she cherishes those films, it's no surprise that she's dying to know what the last one is about.*

2875
03:25:39,000 --> 03:25:44,000
Mari: "Surely, the final film must be out there somewhere. Somehow, I must..."

2876
03:25:44,000 --> 03:25:47,000
*Mari stops before finishing her sentence.*

2877
03:25:47,000 --> 03:25:49,000
Mari: "...Do you hear something?"

2878
03:25:49,000 --> 03:25:52,000
Leon: "You mean... somewhere in the house?"

2879
03:25:52,000 --> 03:25:53,000
Mari: "No, outside!"

2880
03:25:53,000 --> 03:25:57,000
*By the time I process what she says, Mari is already at the door.*

2881
03:25:57,000 --> 03:26:01,000
Leon: "Where is it coming from? I don't even hear anything..."

2882
03:26:01,000 --> 03:26:05,000
Mari: "Shh... Let silence cleanse your ears, and listen..."

2883
03:26:05,000 --> 03:26:10,000
*I do as I'm told, not saying a word and focusing my attention on my ears.*

2884
03:26:10,000 --> 03:26:12,000
*Silence surrounds us.*

2885
03:26:12,000 --> 03:26:17,000
*Not even the slightest gust blows as I listen intently for any sound...*

2886
03:26:17,000 --> 03:26:18,000
Leon: "...!"

2887
03:26:18,000 --> 03:26:23,000
*I'd never have noticed such a faint noise if I wasn't listening so carefully.*

2888
03:26:23,000 --> 03:26:28,000
*It's a whirring sound?the kind you'd hear from the motor of some machine.*

2889
03:26:28,000 --> 03:26:30,000
Leon: "Mari... this is..."

2890
03:26:30,000 --> 03:26:32,000
*Just as I ask her in a whisper...*

2891
03:26:32,000 --> 03:26:33,000
Mari: "There!"

2892
03:26:33,000 --> 03:26:38,000
*Three rod shurikens take leave of Mari's hand and whisk sharply through the air.*

2893
03:26:38,000 --> 03:26:41,000
*Soon after, a clank is heard in the distance.*

2894
03:26:41,000 --> 03:26:43,000
Leon: "You... hit it?!"

2895
03:26:43,000 --> 03:26:50,000
*Something suddenly falls, but there is nothing to be seen. Nothing falls out of nowhere onto the ground.*

2896
03:26:50,000 --> 03:26:51,000
Mari: "Quickly!"

2897
03:26:51,000 --> 03:26:52,000
Leon: "What?"

2898
03:26:52,000 --> 03:26:58,000
Mari: "Our foes are here! They used something to spy on us. We must find out what it is!"

2899
03:26:58,000 --> 03:26:59,000
Leon: "G-Got it!"

2900
03:26:59,000 --> 03:27:02,000
*We hurry toward where the thing fell.*

2901
03:27:02,000 --> 03:27:07,000
*Ten or so meters ahead, we see something with smoke rising from it.*

2902
03:27:07,000 --> 03:27:09,000
Leon: "What... in the world is this?"

2903
03:27:09,000 --> 03:27:15,000
*Turns out, I wasn't just being literary when I said "nothing falls out of nowhere".*

2904
03:27:15,000 --> 03:27:17,000
*After all, the thing that fell...*

2905
03:27:17,000 --> 03:27:23,000
Mari: "This thing... It has melded its appearance with the ground to become invisible!"

2906
03:27:23,000 --> 03:27:25,000
*I can hardly believe what I see.*

2907
03:27:25,000 --> 03:27:31,000
*I know there are stick insects that camouflage as branches. This must be something like that.*

2908
03:27:31,000 --> 03:27:33,000
*It's got a weird shape, too.*

2909
03:27:33,000 --> 03:27:37,000
Leon: "It's in the shape of a cross, and it's got... wings?"

2910
03:27:37,000 --> 03:27:41,000
*It seems like those wings are what allowed it to fly.*

2911
03:27:41,000 --> 03:27:45,000
Mari: "Sir Leon, I do believe that... this is known as a 'drone'."

2912
03:27:45,000 --> 03:27:46,000
Leon: "Drone?"

2913
03:27:46,000 --> 03:27:52,000
Mari: "Yes, one of my master's films had a science ninja who employed such a thing."

2914
03:27:52,000 --> 03:27:57,000
Mari: "It was a type of plane that could be controlled freely and made to fly."

2915
03:27:57,000 --> 03:28:07,000
Mari: "Like its name suggests, it could disappear at will, leaving nothing but a faint drone in the air. Truly, it was a perfect reconnaissance machine."

2916
03:28:07,000 --> 03:28:16,000
Leon: "Stuff like that seriously exists? ...Okay, let's say this really is one of those 'drone' things. What was it doing at our doorstep?"

2917
03:28:16,000 --> 03:28:22,000
Mari: "I have no idea, but it was most likely spying on us. Look, it has a camera here."

2918
03:28:22,000 --> 03:28:28,000
*At the center of the "drone", there's some sort of glass marble buried in its body.*

2919
03:28:28,000 --> 03:28:33,000
Mari: "I assume it used this to film us before sending the data elsewhere."

2920
03:28:33,000 --> 03:28:35,000
Leon: "You can't be serious..."

2921
03:28:35,000 --> 03:28:40,000
*If they're after me, they must have been looking for a time when I was alone.*

2922
03:28:40,000 --> 03:28:49,000
Leon: "All right. Let's bring this back with us and take a closer look at it. I also have to warn everyone to be more careful..."

2923
03:28:49,000 --> 03:28:53,000
*I go to pick up the "drone" on the ground in front of me.*

2924
03:28:53,000 --> 03:28:55,000
Mari: "S-Sir Leon! Look out!"

2925
03:28:55,000 --> 03:28:56,000
Leon: "Eh?"

2926
03:28:56,000 --> 03:29:00,000
*Distracted by what's in front of me, I'm completely unaware...*

2927
03:29:00,000 --> 03:29:03,000
*...of the other "drone" that sneaks up behind me.*

2928
03:29:03,000 --> 03:29:04,000
Leon: "Waaaaah!"

2929
03:29:04,000 --> 03:29:05,000
Mari: "Kyaaaaa!"

2930
03:29:05,000 --> 03:29:10,000
*I can remember up to where a cloud of white smoke envelops me and Mari.*

2931
03:29:10,000 --> 03:29:12,000
*After that... is all a blank...*

2932
03:29:12,000 --> 03:29:13,000
Leon: "...Nnngh?"

2933
03:29:13,000 --> 03:29:18,000
*As I wake up, I  open my eyes, but I see nothing but a vast darkness.*

2934
03:29:18,000 --> 03:29:20,000
Leon: "Wha?Where's Mari?!"

2935
03:29:20,000 --> 03:29:26,000
*I spring up and look around, only to find that the darkness surrounds me on all sides.*

2936
03:29:26,000 --> 03:29:28,000
Mari: "Nnngh... Sir... Leon?"

2937
03:29:28,000 --> 03:29:31,000
*From some distance away comes Mari's voice.*

2938
03:29:31,000 --> 03:29:34,000
Leon: "Mari! You're okay? What a relief..."

2939
03:29:34,000 --> 03:29:36,000
Mari: "S-Sir Leon, where are you?"

2940
03:29:36,000 --> 03:29:39,000
Leon: "I'm right here! It's just too dark here..."

2941
03:29:39,000 --> 03:29:43,000
*We both reach out, probing for each other in the darkness.*

2942
03:29:43,000 --> 03:29:46,000
Mari: "Ah, I believe I just touched your finger!"

2943
03:29:46,000 --> 03:29:47,000
Leon: "Y-Yeah!"

2944
03:29:47,000 --> 03:29:52,000
*With our hands conjoined, we find some solace in each other's presence.*

2945
03:29:52,000 --> 03:29:57,000
Leon: "But, man, we're in trouble... They must have locked us in somewhere."

2946
03:29:57,000 --> 03:30:01,000
Mari: "Forgive my incompetence... I have failed you."

2947
03:30:01,000 --> 03:30:05,000
Leon: "Don't apologize! It's me who's incompetent, if anything..."

2948
03:30:05,000 --> 03:30:11,000
*Having such a tiny girl apologize to me really makes me feel like I need to do better.*

2949
03:30:11,000 --> 03:30:17,000
*How exactly I should go about doing better, though, is entirely unclear to me right now.*

2950
03:30:17,000 --> 03:30:23,000
Leon: "For the time being, let's look around this room. Maybe we'll find something useful."

2951
03:30:23,000 --> 03:30:24,000
Mari: "Understood."

2952
03:30:24,000 --> 03:30:30,000
*After fumbling around in the darkness with our hands, a few things become clear to us.*

2953
03:30:30,000 --> 03:30:34,000
*This room is approximately a five-by-five meter square.*

2954
03:30:34,000 --> 03:30:40,000
*It's basically empty, and there's only one door that's way too sturdy for us to break down.*

2955
03:30:40,000 --> 03:30:43,000
*The only object in the room is a mop.*

2956
03:30:43,000 --> 03:30:47,000
Leon: "So... this is feeling a lot like game over for us."

2957
03:30:47,000 --> 03:30:51,000
Mari: "It pains me to admit it... but you may be right."

2958
03:30:51,000 --> 03:30:58,000
*Chances are, if we keep waiting here, either those black suits from before or their buddies will show up.*

2959
03:30:58,000 --> 03:31:03,000
*We probably won't be killed, but I doubt it'll be much better than that.*

2960
03:31:03,000 --> 03:31:06,000
Leon: "Well, let's give this a try, then."

2961
03:31:06,000 --> 03:31:09,000
*I pick up the mop and head to the door.*

2962
03:31:09,000 --> 03:31:13,000
Mari: "S-Sir Leon, do you mean to strike the door with that?"

2963
03:31:13,000 --> 03:31:15,000
Leon: "Uh... yeah. Basically."

2964
03:31:15,000 --> 03:31:21,000
Mari: "That door is very sturdy. I doubt any damage will be done by striking it..."

2965
03:31:21,000 --> 03:31:27,000
Mari: "In addition, if there are guards on the other side, our actions will only alert them."

2966
03:31:27,000 --> 03:31:29,000
Leon: "Y-You've got a good point..."

2967
03:31:29,000 --> 03:31:33,000
*In that case, I should probably leave the mop alone...*

2968
03:31:33,000 --> 03:31:37,000
Mari: "Oh, but... we can certainly try poking the ceiling with it."

2969
03:31:37,000 --> 03:31:38,000
Leon: "The ceiling?"

2970
03:31:38,000 --> 03:31:44,000
Mari: "This room seems to be devoid of windows, so there might be a vent on the ceiling."

2971
03:31:44,000 --> 03:31:47,000
Leon: "You're right! And if we can get that open..."

2972
03:31:47,000 --> 03:31:50,000
Mari: "Indeed, we will be able to escape!"

2973
03:31:50,000 --> 03:31:53,000
*With mop in hand, I tap at the ceiling bit by bit.*

2974
03:31:53,000 --> 03:31:59,000
*Bare ceiling would return nothing but the dull thud of concrete, but if something was there...*

2975
03:31:59,000 --> 03:32:00,000
Leon: "Bingo!"

2976
03:32:00,000 --> 03:32:01,000
Mari: "Great!"

2977
03:32:01,000 --> 03:32:07,000
*Right around the center of the room, there's a part of the ceiling that sounds different.*

2978
03:32:07,000 --> 03:32:10,000
Leon: "This is definitely some sort of cover..."

2979
03:32:10,000 --> 03:32:13,000
Mari: "Is it possible to move it in some way?"

2980
03:32:13,000 --> 03:32:14,000
Leon: "Let me try."

2981
03:32:14,000 --> 03:32:21,000
*Thanks to the darkness, I can't even tell what shape it is, so I have no choice but to go by feel.*

2982
03:32:21,000 --> 03:32:28,000
*I tinker around with it, trying various motions such as pushing it up while trying to shift it sideways...*

2983
03:32:28,000 --> 03:32:29,000
Leon: "Hey..."

2984
03:32:29,000 --> 03:32:30,000
Mari: "Did it work?"

2985
03:32:30,000 --> 03:32:32,000
*Something is definitely there.*

2986
03:32:32,000 --> 03:32:37,000
*It feels like the broomstick just caught on a handle of some sort.*

2987
03:32:37,000 --> 03:32:39,000
Leon: "Okay, this should..."

2988
03:32:39,000 --> 03:32:44,000
*Keeping the broomstick steady, I swing it sideways as though I'm opening a door.*

2989
03:32:44,000 --> 03:32:46,000
Leon: "I-I see the sky!"

2990
03:32:46,000 --> 03:32:48,000
Mari: "Sir Leon, you did it!"

2991
03:32:48,000 --> 03:32:54,000
*Moonlight seeps in through the opening, washing away some of the darkness in the room.*

2992
03:32:54,000 --> 03:33:00,000
*Compared to how hopeless our situation seemed before, this is a definite improvement.*

2993
03:33:00,000 --> 03:33:01,000
Leon: "...Still."

2994
03:33:01,000 --> 03:33:04,000
*How are we supposed to get up there?*

2995
03:33:04,000 --> 03:33:09,000
*With the ceiling more than three meters up, I'm forced to ponder my next step.*

2996
03:33:09,000 --> 03:33:11,000
Mari: "Sir Leon, leave this to me."

2997
03:33:11,000 --> 03:33:12,000
Leon: "Huh?"

2998
03:33:12,000 --> 03:33:20,000
Mari: "It is for times like these that I have trained day and night! Behold, the art of jumping onto tall places!"

2999
03:33:20,000 --> 03:33:22,000
Leon: "Y-You're right!"

3000
03:33:22,000 --> 03:33:25,000
*That's definitely one of Mari's abilities.*

3001
03:33:25,000 --> 03:33:30,000
*If we can get at least Mari up through that opening, we'll probably be okay...*

3002
03:33:30,000 --> 03:33:32,000
Mari: "Here I... go? Huh?"

3003
03:33:32,000 --> 03:33:33,000
*However.*

3004
03:33:33,000 --> 03:33:36,000
*The confidence quickly fades from Mari's voice.*

3005
03:33:36,000 --> 03:33:37,000
Leon: "...M-Mari?"

3006
03:33:37,000 --> 03:33:40,000
*Before I can ask her what's wrong...*

3007
03:33:40,000 --> 03:33:43,000
Mari: "I-I want to jump, but... um..."

3008
03:33:43,000 --> 03:33:50,000
Mari: "I am most ashamed to admit that I seem to be a tad too hungry... I cannot muster the strength."

3009
03:33:50,000 --> 03:33:53,000
Leon: "Y-You have got to be kidding me!"

3010
03:33:53,000 --> 03:33:55,000
Mari: "The shame... Oh, the shame..."

3011
03:33:55,000 --> 03:34:01,000
*Thoroughly embarrassed and with her voice barely a whisper, Mari apologizes profusely.*

3012
03:34:01,000 --> 03:34:06,000
*Hm, if that's the case, then we'll have no choice but to keep sitting here.*

3013
03:34:06,000 --> 03:34:10,000
Leon: "I wonder if there's something for her to eat... Hm?"

3014
03:34:10,000 --> 03:34:15,000
*As I rummage through my clothes, I find something hard in my pocket.*

3015
03:34:15,000 --> 03:34:17,000
Leon: "Hey, I found something!"

3016
03:34:17,000 --> 03:34:18,000
Mari: "W-What is it?"

3017
03:34:18,000 --> 03:34:21,000
*I take it out of my pocket, revealing it to be...*

3018
03:34:21,000 --> 03:34:22,000
Mari: "..."

3019
03:34:22,000 --> 03:34:26,000
Mari: "...I do believe these are the biscuits from that time."

3020
03:34:26,000 --> 03:34:28,000
Leon: "...Yeah, they are."

3021
03:34:28,000 --> 03:34:37,000
*Left speechless by the sheer coincidence of it all, our gazes slowly drift toward each other and meet under the warm glow of soft moonlight.*

3022
03:34:37,000 --> 03:34:43,000
Mari: "...I think we have put enough distance between us and them. We should be safe now."

3023
03:34:43,000 --> 03:34:44,000
Leon: "...Yeah."

3024
03:34:44,000 --> 03:34:50,000
*Wordlessly, the two of us dash through the night while a large moon hangs overhead.*

3025
03:34:50,000 --> 03:34:57,000
*After being treated for her dire affliction?hunger?Mari successfully made the leap up to the vent.*

3026
03:34:57,000 --> 03:35:03,000
*She then dangled down a rope she found somewhere, which allowed me to get out, as well.*

3027
03:35:03,000 --> 03:35:09,000
*Fortunately, there were no guards around us, so we quickly made our escape. However...*

3028
03:35:09,000 --> 03:35:12,000
Leon: "Do you think they'll know which way we went?"

3029
03:35:12,000 --> 03:35:18,000
Mari: "I took care to tread on sandy ground, so we should have left no footprints."

3030
03:35:18,000 --> 03:35:21,000
Mari: "It should be difficult for them to track us."

3031
03:35:21,000 --> 03:35:24,000
Leon: "That's definitely good to hear."

3032
03:35:24,000 --> 03:35:27,000
*I let out a sigh of relief and look around.*

3033
03:35:27,000 --> 03:35:34,000
*There is only a single road in the barren landscape?the one that leads from the diner to the town.*

3034
03:35:34,000 --> 03:35:37,000
Leon: "From here, it's possible to just walk back."

3035
03:35:37,000 --> 03:35:40,000
Mari: "I see... Do you think we should?"

3036
03:35:40,000 --> 03:35:45,000
Leon: "At a comfortable pace, it'll probably take us an hour. Are you up for it?"

3037
03:35:45,000 --> 03:35:48,000
Mari: "Of course. I am trained for such times."

3038
03:35:48,000 --> 03:35:50,000
Leon: "Okay, let's walk, then."

3039
03:35:50,000 --> 03:35:56,000
*Slowly but surely, the two of us make our way back along the side of the National Highway.*

3040
03:35:56,000 --> 03:36:03,000
Mari: "I must apologize... My actions were uncalled for. None of this would have happened had I not..."

3041
03:36:03,000 --> 03:36:09,000
Leon: "What are you talking about? If you weren't there, we'd be even worse off right now."

3042
03:36:09,000 --> 03:36:16,000
*I'm still getting chills thinking about how that freaky thing was flying around the diner and spying on us.*

3043
03:36:16,000 --> 03:36:23,000
*We did end up captives for a while, but on the other hand, that also instilled in me a sense of urgency.*

3044
03:36:23,000 --> 03:36:30,000
Mari: "Those peaceful days you cherish... I hope I have been of use in protecting them... if only a little."

3045
03:36:30,000 --> 03:36:39,000
Leon: "Trust me, you have. What was that thing you said again? The debt of bed and board? Yeah, you've repaid that ten times over."

3046
03:36:39,000 --> 03:36:42,000
Mari: "I see... I am very glad to hear that."

3047
03:36:42,000 --> 03:36:45,000
*A profound sigh of relief escapes Mari.*

3048
03:36:45,000 --> 03:36:48,000
Mari: "I truly do treasure everyone very much."

3049
03:36:48,000 --> 03:36:57,000
Mari: "Lucia, the responsible one... Aisia, the clumsy one... Rebecca, the soft and gentle one... and Sir Leon, who is always so kind."

3050
03:36:57,000 --> 03:37:05,000
Mari: "I want everyone to stay just the way they are. That is why... hearing you say that made me feel a lot better."

3051
03:37:05,000 --> 03:37:09,000
*Step by step, we walk?two figures under a moonlit sky.*

3052
03:37:09,000 --> 03:37:13,000
*After some time, the small figure in front suddenly stops.*

3053
03:37:13,000 --> 03:37:14,000
Leon: "...Mari?"

3054
03:37:14,000 --> 03:37:16,000
*Mari turns to face me.*

3055
03:37:16,000 --> 03:37:17,000
Mari: "...Sir Leon."

3056
03:37:17,000 --> 03:37:18,000
Leon: "...Yeah?"

3057
03:37:18,000 --> 03:37:22,000
Mari: "May I... continue to live at the diner like this?"

3058
03:37:22,000 --> 03:37:23,000
Leon: "Huh?"

3059
03:37:23,000 --> 03:37:33,000
Mari: "There is no guarantee that an event like today's will not happen again. I could serve as a safeguard against such possibilities. Also..."

3060
03:37:33,000 --> 03:37:39,000
Mari: "...After living with all of you, I have become very fond of everyone's warm presence."

3061
03:37:39,000 --> 03:37:40,000
Leon: "Mari..."

3062
03:37:40,000 --> 03:37:46,000
Mari: "Is it... too much to ask? If so, perhaps I could erect a tent somewhere nearby?Mmmfm!"

3063
03:37:46,000 --> 03:37:54,000
*I walk in front of Mari, grab her, and pull her into a tight hug, smothering the last few words of her sentence.*

3064
03:37:54,000 --> 03:37:59,000
Leon: "...I think I've heard enough from this silly mouth of yours."

3065
03:37:59,000 --> 03:38:02,000
Mari: "S-Sur Reon, prease, I cannot bre?Mmmfm..."

3066
03:38:02,000 --> 03:38:05,000
*I pull back a little and allow her to breathe.*

3067
03:38:05,000 --> 03:38:06,000
Mari: "Fwaaah..."

3068
03:38:06,000 --> 03:38:13,000
Leon: "...So, the truth is, ever since the day you came back, I've been thinking of asking you to live with us."

3069
03:38:13,000 --> 03:38:15,000
Mari: "Huh? I-Is that so..."

3070
03:38:15,000 --> 03:38:19,000
*It's been on my mind ever since we went to her home.*

3071
03:38:19,000 --> 03:38:26,000
*When I found out that she lives alone in that towering building, I decided that I would ask her to stay.*

3072
03:38:26,000 --> 03:38:32,000
Leon: "At the time, though, it seemed like your training was really important to you."

3073
03:38:32,000 --> 03:38:33,000
Mari: "..."

3074
03:38:33,000 --> 03:38:35,000
*That's why I didn't bring it up.*

3075
03:38:35,000 --> 03:38:41,000
Leon: "Since you've mentioned it yourself now... well, I'd be more than happy to welcome you."

3076
03:38:41,000 --> 03:38:45,000
*Mari breaks into a smile at my reply, but soon after...*

3077
03:38:45,000 --> 03:38:48,000
Mari: "Truthfully, though... I do have one regret."

3078
03:38:48,000 --> 03:38:51,000
*She wilts again, her expression downcast.*

3079
03:38:51,000 --> 03:38:53,000
Leon: "...You do, huh."

3080
03:38:53,000 --> 03:39:01,000
Mari: "Indeed. In the end, I was not able to live on alone... My resolve faltered before the kindness everyone has shown me."

3081
03:39:01,000 --> 03:39:02,000
*Ah, that film.*

3082
03:39:02,000 --> 03:39:11,000
*In that scene, the ninja, played by Toba, had one final message for the remaining villagers?even if you are alone, be strong and live on.*

3083
03:39:11,000 --> 03:39:19,000
*Having had basically no contact with other people, those words were the only thing that kept her going all this time.*

3084
03:39:19,000 --> 03:39:24,000
Mari: "So much for being a ninja... My master would be ashamed of me."

3085
03:39:24,000 --> 03:39:28,000
*Mari smiles a cheerless smile. Her dejection is evident.*

3086
03:39:28,000 --> 03:39:32,000
*I take a moment to consider a thought that crosses my mind.*

3087
03:39:32,000 --> 03:39:36,000
*Should I say it? ...Yes. In fact, this is the perfect time.*

3088
03:39:36,000 --> 03:39:41,000
Leon: "...You know that series of Sonny Toba films you said you really liked?"

3089
03:39:41,000 --> 03:39:46,000
Mari: "The one whose final film I was never able to watch? What about it?"

3090
03:39:46,000 --> 03:39:50,000
Leon: "Actually... I know what happens in the last one."

3091
03:39:50,000 --> 03:39:51,000
Mari: "What..."

3092
03:39:51,000 --> 03:39:52,000
Mari: "Whaaaaat?!"

3093
03:39:52,000 --> 03:39:56,000
*That's right. It's a little something that I kept from her.*

3094
03:39:56,000 --> 03:40:06,000
*A long time ago, my father brought back a bunch of things from the black market. Among them was the "final film" that she'd been looking for.*

3095
03:40:06,000 --> 03:40:10,000
Mari: "Y-You mean... you know what happens in the final film?"

3096
03:40:10,000 --> 03:40:17,000
Leon: "Yeah. Part ten, the last chapter. Unfortunately, I don't have the physical copy with me anymore."

3097
03:40:17,000 --> 03:40:20,000
Mari: "I-I see... What kind of story was it?"

3098
03:40:20,000 --> 03:40:22,000
Leon: "...Do you want to know?"

3099
03:40:22,000 --> 03:40:25,000
Mari: "Y-Yes... Go ahead! Spoilers are fine!"

3100
03:40:25,000 --> 03:40:29,000
*After confirming with her, I slowly begin to tell the tale.*

3101
03:40:29,000 --> 03:40:38,000
*The last thing Mari saw was the end of part nine, where Toba, as the ninja leader, true to his word, sets out on a journey all by himself.*

3102
03:40:38,000 --> 03:40:39,000
*However...*

3103
03:40:39,000 --> 03:40:45,000
Leon: "At the conclusion of part ten, his journey ends with him living together with his family."

3104
03:40:45,000 --> 03:40:51,000
Mari: "What? B-But my master refused to ever marry! He rarely even took in apprentices!"

3105
03:40:51,000 --> 03:40:57,000
Leon: "His lonesome journey changed something in his heart. I remember him saying that."

3106
03:40:57,000 --> 03:40:58,000
Mari: "..."

3107
03:40:58,000 --> 03:41:04,000
*After spending his days in the peaceful company of his family, Toba says one final phrase.*

3108
03:41:04,000 --> 03:41:15,000
Leon: "His words were, 'There is great importance in the strength of will to live alone. However, there is much value in a life lived for others, as well...'"

3109
03:41:15,000 --> 03:41:16,000
Mari: "...I see."

3110
03:41:16,000 --> 03:41:21,000
*Still looking downwards, Mari nods contemplatively along to my words. Then...*

3111
03:41:21,000 --> 03:41:26,000
Mari: "Oh, that means it is perfectly fine for me to stay with all of you!"

3112
03:41:26,000 --> 03:41:30,000
*She suddenly looks up, her voice brimming with energy again.*

3113
03:41:30,000 --> 03:41:35,000
Leon: "Y-Yeah, that's right. So, you really don't have to worry about?"

3114
03:41:35,000 --> 03:41:37,000
Mari: "I have made up my mind!"

3115
03:41:37,000 --> 03:41:38,000
Leon: "What?"

3116
03:41:38,000 --> 03:41:44,000
*Mari cuts me off somewhat abruptly with an announcement before quickly taking my hand.*

3117
03:41:44,000 --> 03:41:50,000
Mari: "In addition to imposing upon your diner, I have made up my mind on one other thing!"

3118
03:41:50,000 --> 03:41:51,000
Leon: "W-What is it?"

3119
03:41:51,000 --> 03:41:55,000
Mari: "I have decided to love you with all my heart, Sir Leon!"

3120
03:41:55,000 --> 03:41:56,000
Leon: "..."

3121
03:41:56,000 --> 03:41:57,000
Leon: "Whaaaaaat?!"

3122
03:41:57,000 --> 03:42:02,000
*Did she just confess her love to me? Just like that? How did we even get here?*

3123
03:42:02,000 --> 03:42:06,000
Leon: "S-Slow down! What's this about all of a sudden?"

3124
03:42:06,000 --> 03:42:11,000
Mari: "There is nothing sudden about it! It has been on my mind for a long time!"

3125
03:42:11,000 --> 03:42:13,000
Leon: "A long time?! What?!"

3126
03:42:13,000 --> 03:42:20,000
Mari: "However, as one who walks the path of the ninja, I had intended to keep my thoughts hidden..."

3127
03:42:20,000 --> 03:42:27,000
Mari: "Now, after hearing my master's words about a life lived for others... It has all become clear to me!"

3128
03:42:27,000 --> 03:42:31,000
Mari: "Who else would I devote my life to if not you, Sir Leon!"

3129
03:42:31,000 --> 03:42:33,000
Leon: "A-Are you sure?"

3130
03:42:33,000 --> 03:42:41,000
Mari: "Yes! And knowing that I can now confess my love to you, I could not help but do so at the earliest opportunity!"

3131
03:42:41,000 --> 03:42:54,000
Mari: "Oh, but... p-perhaps I am not to your liking? While physiologically female, I realize that I, um, do not possess the most feminine of traits. My breasts are quite modest, for example."

3132
03:42:54,000 --> 03:43:01,000
Leon: "Wh-What are you talking about? That's not true at all! In fact, I've always thought you were cute?Waaah!"

3133
03:43:01,000 --> 03:43:06,000
*Before I can finish, Mari throws her arms around me in a tight hug.*

3134
03:43:06,000 --> 03:43:11,000
Mari: "I am so glad! Sir Leon, you really are the person I thought you were!"

3135
03:43:11,000 --> 03:43:20,000
Leon: "Hey, uh, Mari? Look, I totally understand how you feel and I'm really glad about this, too, but let's calm down first, okay?"

3136
03:43:20,000 --> 03:43:24,000
Mari: "I shall serve you with my all my heart! I am yours!"

3137
03:43:24,000 --> 03:43:26,000
Leon: "Slow down already!"

3138
03:43:26,000 --> 03:43:30,000
Mari: "Now, onward! We must hurry home, for a new life awaits us!"

3139
03:43:30,000 --> 03:43:34,000
Leon: "H-Hold on a minute! Hey, come on, stop pulling my clothes!"

3140
03:43:34,000 --> 03:43:38,000
*With a newfound spring in our steps, we continue along our path.*

3141
03:43:38,000 --> 03:43:42,000
*It's hard to imagine we were kidnapped mere moments ago.*

3142
03:43:42,000 --> 03:43:44,000
Leon: "H-Hey, what's with the rush?"

3143
03:43:44,000 --> 03:43:47,000
Mari: "...We must return before the new day dawns."

3144
03:43:47,000 --> 03:43:48,000
Leon: "...Eh?"

3145
03:43:48,000 --> 03:43:51,000
Mari: "Because... I do not want anyone to worry."

3146
03:43:51,000 --> 03:43:57,000
Mari: "So, let us make haste. I wish to be together with everyone as soon as possible."

3147
03:43:57,000 --> 03:43:59,000
Leon: "...Yeah, let's."

3148
03:43:59,000 --> 03:44:04,000
*We were all alone, but little by little, we gathered around each other.*

3149
03:44:04,000 --> 03:44:10,000
*By helping each other, we formed bonds. And with those bonds, we became a family.*

3150
03:44:10,000 --> 03:44:13,000
*Today, a new member has entered our family.*

3151
03:44:13,000 --> 03:44:18,000
*Her arrival will surely bring our family more fun and more excitement.*

3152
03:44:18,000 --> 03:44:21,000
Leon: "I can't wait to tell everyone..."

3153
03:44:21,000 --> 03:44:24,000
*Before I know it, I've already hastened my steps.*

3154
03:44:24,000 --> 03:44:26,000
*The veil of night will soon recede.*

3155
03:44:26,000 --> 03:44:29,000
*When it does, everyone will wake up.*

3156
03:44:29,000 --> 03:44:35,000
*So that we can be there in that moment?to share in that first "Good Morning" of the day?*

3157
03:44:35,000 --> 03:44:40,000
*We run, the large moon overhead bearing witness to our hurried breaths.*

3158
03:44:40,000 --> 03:44:42,000
Leon: "Hey, uh, everyone?"

3159
03:44:42,000 --> 03:44:45,000
Lucia: "Yes, what would you like to know? Hmhm~"

3160
03:44:45,000 --> 03:44:50,000
Aisia: "Leon, what's the matter? Your face looks like it's twitching."

3161
03:44:50,000 --> 03:44:58,000
Rebecca: "Oh, my, perhaps it's fatigue that's setting in. Let me make some food that will put some energy into you..."

3162
03:44:58,000 --> 03:45:05,000
Leon: "I'm fine! There's nothing wrong with me and I don't need energy! That's not the problem here!"

3163
03:45:05,000 --> 03:45:10,000
*I take another look around me before breathing out a long, deep sigh.*

3164
03:45:10,000 --> 03:45:15,000
Leon: "How about we start with this situation? What is the big idea here?"

3165
03:45:15,000 --> 03:45:19,000
Lucia: "What big idea? It's exactly what it looks like."

3166
03:45:19,000 --> 03:45:23,000
Aisia: "We're all in our pajamas and ready for bed, right?"

3167
03:45:23,000 --> 03:45:31,000
Rebecca: "If you had to pick out a difference, I suppose it would be the fact that one of us is already on the bed."

3168
03:45:31,000 --> 03:45:34,000
Lucia: "In a ninja outfit for some reason, too."

3169
03:45:34,000 --> 03:45:38,000
Aisia: "And she looks really warm. She's glowing from head to toe."

3170
03:45:38,000 --> 03:45:47,000
Rebecca: "How peculiar... She was quite normal until eating dinner. After that, she suddenly started feverishly clutching at Leon..."

3171
03:45:47,000 --> 03:45:52,000
Lucia: "What was she saying again? I think... 'I want to curl up with Sir Leon!'"

3172
03:45:52,000 --> 03:45:55,000
Aisia: "Yes, yes, that was it. She was so cute~"

3173
03:45:55,000 --> 03:45:59,000
Rebecca: "That one line made my day. It was wonderful~"

3174
03:45:59,000 --> 03:46:02,000
Lucia: "Is that enough explaining for you, Leon?"

3175
03:46:02,000 --> 03:46:07,000
Aisia: "Come on, you have to do this. You've come too far to back out now."

3176
03:46:07,000 --> 03:46:14,000
Rebecca: "Well, I think you've spent enough time being a bump on a log. Hurry up and jump in bed!"

3177
03:46:14,000 --> 03:46:16,000
Leon: "Absolutely not!"

3178
03:46:16,000 --> 03:46:19,000
*...Okay, let ME explain this situation.*

3179
03:46:19,000 --> 03:46:25,000
*Mari's official induction into our family was, of course, met with a warm round of welcome.*

3180
03:46:25,000 --> 03:46:32,000
*So did a new chapter of fun and excitement begin in our lives... And it was fine up until that point.*

3181
03:46:32,000 --> 03:46:33,000
*The problem is...*

3182
03:46:33,000 --> 03:46:39,000
*Once people heard about Mari's bold confession of love to me, the situation took a nosedive.*

3183
03:46:39,000 --> 03:46:43,000
*Lucia started elbowing me with a smirk on her face.*

3184
03:46:43,000 --> 03:46:47,000
*Aisia looked at me and showed me an unreasonably wide grin.*

3185
03:46:47,000 --> 03:46:55,000
*Rebecca... got straight to the point. She just came over and told me to be careful because Mari has a small body.*

3186
03:46:55,000 --> 03:47:03,000
*In other words, the just-now-formed Big Sis Brigade (relative to Mari) was dead set on seeing Mari and I become a couple.*

3187
03:47:03,000 --> 03:47:07,000
*I, on the other hand, was very much not dead set on seeing that.*

3188
03:47:07,000 --> 03:47:12,000
*I decided to just play it cool and ignore them for the time being, but...*

3189
03:47:12,000 --> 03:47:19,000
Lucia: "It's a shame that you noticed when we started eating dinner. We were doing so good until then, too."

3190
03:47:19,000 --> 03:47:25,000
Leon: "What were you even expecting? Did you think I wouldn't notice when Mari looked like that?"

3191
03:47:25,000 --> 03:47:28,000
Aisia: "Do you not feel the urge, Leon?"

3192
03:47:28,000 --> 03:47:35,000
Leon: "...Why do you think I'm so mad at all of you? It's been working up a storm this whole time!"

3193
03:47:35,000 --> 03:47:41,000
Rebecca: "Oh, my. Mmmhmhm... That little treat you ate is working marvelously, I see~"

3194
03:47:41,000 --> 03:47:44,000
*This all happened during the early evening today.*

3195
03:47:44,000 --> 03:47:53,000
*For some reason, the others decided to cook dinner for me. Seeing as they were so eager, I decided to take them up on their generosity.*

3196
03:47:53,000 --> 03:47:56,000
*Thinking back, that was a terrible mistake.*

3197
03:47:56,000 --> 03:48:02,000
Leon: "...I never thought you'd slip some aphrodisiac into the food for me and Mari."

3198
03:48:02,000 --> 03:48:07,000
Lucia: "Aphrodisiac? Please. All we did was put in some cocoa powder."

3199
03:48:07,000 --> 03:48:13,000
*...Judging by how my body feels right now, there is no way that's all you put in.*

3200
03:48:13,000 --> 03:48:22,000
*You want to know how I'm so sure? ...Well, I'm so sure because for the past while, I've been wanting to do it so much it hurts.*

3201
03:48:22,000 --> 03:48:28,000
*And Mari, who already went to the bedroom, is probably going through the same thing.*

3202
03:48:28,000 --> 03:48:32,000
Mari: "S-Sir Leon... wh-when will you come to have me?"

3203
03:48:32,000 --> 03:48:42,000
*With the aphrodisiacs kicking both of us into high gear, this is quickly turning into a test of endurance. Except I'm the only one who's being tested.*

3204
03:48:42,000 --> 03:48:45,000
Leon: "Why did you even do this in the first place?"

3205
03:48:45,000 --> 03:48:49,000
*I'm pretty sure this has gone a little too far to be a prank.*

3206
03:48:49,000 --> 03:48:54,000
Lucia: "...You still don't know why? You must be thicker than I thought."

3207
03:48:54,000 --> 03:49:00,000
Aisia: "No surprise there~ After all, it never clicked for him with you, either, Lucia."

3208
03:49:00,000 --> 03:49:04,000
Leon: "Wait, huh? ...Did you all do this for the same reason?"

3209
03:49:04,000 --> 03:49:06,000
*They all nod in concert.*

3210
03:49:06,000 --> 03:49:11,000
Rebecca: "You see, Leon, while you were busy being ever so clueless..."

3211
03:49:11,000 --> 03:49:14,000
*Rebecca leans in and whispers in my ear.*

3212
03:49:14,000 --> 03:49:19,000
Rebecca: "...Mari has been waiting for you ever since she started living here."

3213
03:49:19,000 --> 03:49:20,000
Leon: "...What?!"

3214
03:49:20,000 --> 03:49:24,000
*...Waiting for me? ...Does she mean what I think she means?*

3215
03:49:24,000 --> 03:49:28,000
*Seeking further confirmation, I cast a glance at Lucia and Aisia.*

3216
03:49:28,000 --> 03:49:30,000
Lucia: "Well, no surprise there..."

3217
03:49:30,000 --> 03:49:36,000
Aisia: "Just like we thought, you have to spell it out for Leon or he won't get it~"

3218
03:49:36,000 --> 03:49:38,000
*Ah, I'm being made fun of here...*

3219
03:49:38,000 --> 03:49:44,000
*It looks like I've once again committed the grave sin of being dense toward how girls feel.*

3220
03:49:44,000 --> 03:49:45,000
Rebecca: "Leon."

3221
03:49:45,000 --> 03:49:46,000
Leon: "...Yes?"

3222
03:49:46,000 --> 03:49:55,000
Rebecca: "You're the head of this family, and you're certainly free to bring more members in. We're even happy to see it happen. However..."

3223
03:49:55,000 --> 03:50:03,000
Rebecca: "If you bring someone in as family... make sure you look after them and pay attention to how they feel, too, okay?"

3224
03:50:03,000 --> 03:50:04,000
Leon: "Okay..."

3225
03:50:04,000 --> 03:50:09,000
*With nothing to say in return, I have no choice but to raise the white flag.*

3226
03:50:09,000 --> 03:50:13,000
*Still, when in the world did Mari become like that, too?*

3227
03:50:13,000 --> 03:50:19,000
*I was totally thinking we'd be a couple that leaned toward the cuter side of things.*

3228
03:50:19,000 --> 03:50:26,000
Rebecca: "Well, then! Now that's everything's settled, it's time for you to hop along to your bedroom~"

3229
03:50:26,000 --> 03:50:28,000
Leon: "Huh? W-Wait a minute! Waaah!"

3230
03:50:28,000 --> 03:50:31,000
*Rebecca forces me into the bedroom with a push.*

3231
03:50:31,000 --> 03:50:34,000
Rebecca: "All right, it's our turn today."

3232
03:50:34,000 --> 03:50:36,000
Lucia: "To do the watching."

3233
03:50:36,000 --> 03:50:38,000
Aisia: "We've got your back, Leon~"

3234
03:50:38,000 --> 03:50:40,000
Leon: "G-Give me a break already!"

3235
03:50:40,000 --> 03:50:44,000
*Mari and I find ourselves facing each other on the bed.*

3236
03:50:44,000 --> 03:50:49,000
*Acutely aware of how embarrassed we are, we keep dodging each other's gazes.*

3237
03:50:49,000 --> 03:50:51,000
Mari: "U-Um, Sir Leon."

3238
03:50:51,000 --> 03:50:54,000
*After a long struggle, Mari is the first to speak.*

3239
03:50:54,000 --> 03:50:58,000
Mari: "Would you, um... rather not do this kind of thing with me?"

3240
03:50:58,000 --> 03:51:01,000
Leon: "O-Of course not! I do want to!"

3241
03:51:01,000 --> 03:51:03,000
*Flustered, I look to Mari.*

3242
03:51:03,000 --> 03:51:09,000
*She looks back at me from across the bed, a hint of apprehension in her innocent expression.*

3243
03:51:09,000 --> 03:51:16,000
*This is, uh, how do I put this... Let's just say that my paternal instincts are in overdrive right now.*

3244
03:51:16,000 --> 03:51:18,000
Rebecca: "Aren't you going to kiss?"

3245
03:51:18,000 --> 03:51:23,000
Leon: "...Um, I'd really appreciate it if you just watched quietly."

3246
03:51:23,000 --> 03:51:28,000
*This would be one of the reasons why it still feels embarrassing for me.*

3247
03:51:28,000 --> 03:51:33,000
*Everyone just followed us in and are now watching from a corner of the bedroom.*

3248
03:51:33,000 --> 03:51:40,000
*I distinctly remember wondering this during the time with Lucia and Aisia... and with Rebecca, as well...*

3249
03:51:40,000 --> 03:51:46,000
*But seriously, is this really the kind of thing you're supposed to do with everyone watching?*

3250
03:51:46,000 --> 03:51:51,000
Lucia: "Looks like it'll be a while before we get to see the kiss from Leon."

3251
03:51:51,000 --> 03:51:55,000
Aisia: "You can't blame him. He's so shy, after all~"

3252
03:51:55,000 --> 03:51:57,000
Leon: "Okay, you people. Seriously."

3253
03:51:57,000 --> 03:52:00,000
*We clearly have too many audience members.*

3254
03:52:00,000 --> 03:52:05,000
*It's going to be hard to even look at Mari with all these eyes on me.*

3255
03:52:05,000 --> 03:52:09,000
Leon: "Hey, uh, everyone? Could I ask you all a favor?"

3256
03:52:09,000 --> 03:52:16,000
Rebecca: "If the favor is for us to excuse ourselves for a minute, the answer is most definitely no~"

3257
03:52:16,000 --> 03:52:18,000
Leon: "At least let me ask first!"

3258
03:52:18,000 --> 03:52:25,000
Rebecca: "I mean, if we don't keep an eye on you, the two of you might just end up falling asleep."

3259
03:52:25,000 --> 03:52:27,000
*She doesn't trust me, I see.*

3260
03:52:27,000 --> 03:52:28,000
Lucia: "Agreed."

3261
03:52:28,000 --> 03:52:32,000
Aisia: "Big Sis, you really know Leon inside out, don't you~"

3262
03:52:32,000 --> 03:52:35,000
*And, of course, nobody is on my side.*

3263
03:52:35,000 --> 03:52:42,000
Leon: "...Okay, fine. If you really have to stay here and watch, just keep the comments to a minimum, okay?"

3264
03:52:42,000 --> 03:52:45,000
Rebecca: "Okay~ That, we can certainly promise."

